{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth","id":416995,"title":"[IC][Exalted 2.5] The Emerald Labyrinth","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play","Play by Post"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-02-23T17:37:33-08:00","id":416995,"title":"[IC][Exalted 2.5] The Emerald Labyrinth","content":"As you walk off the hustle and bustle of the airship dock, away from the friendly environs, into the new city. You enter into a cobblestone square, with a hustle and bustle of people, centered around a large fountain in the center of the space. On one end is a crowd of people gathered around a large dead carcass on a cart. Cheers and happy singing are coming from the crowd, while on the other side, there is a small market of vendors selling their wares. You can see a variety of merchants, from Guildsmen to the infamous Icecrowners peddling the pale Rimesilk they're so famous for, and many, many others.<br /> <br /> Near the fountain is a full-figured woman in the robes of an Immaculate monk, her Rosary of the Five Dragons, stashed in her sash like a sword, and more unusual of all, an unruly mane of curls the color of the sky flows about her head. She's currently engaged in a Punch and Judy rendition of the Immaculate Dragons slaying the Anathema and sealing their souls in darkness for a gaggle of children and a band of hecklers.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-24-2015, 12:02 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:13:57-08:00","id":417073,"title":"","content":"Ever since he stepped off the airship Unrestrained Lover found the city to be full of opportunity for his knowledge of technology to be applied. Lokking to his new business partner (He still has trouble with the concept of currency) Lin Zarah the small woman had proven to be a good ally in this new world. Covered from head to toe in his furcoat with most of his face hidden behind a large scarf he found onboard so that he would not stadn out too much.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">&quot;I believed you said you have secured a residence of a sort in this city should we go see it ?&quot;</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:41:57-08:00","id":417085,"title":"","content":"&quot;-and get us some more walrus oil!&quot; The raspy voice of Grandpa Ragnar, which the airship's passengers had by necessity become accustomed to over the last couple of weeks, rang out in the cold air. &quot;We need to keep the engine from freezing up while we're in port! And we're low on spare sailcloth after that port side repair, so some of that, and see if you can't get find a good blacksmith who can replace the patch on the aft boiler, it's not gonna hold more than another month or two at best.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, Ragnar.&quot; Nergui nodded, waving over his shoulder at the old engineer.<br /> <br /> As he headed out into the crowd, he became quickly distracted by the puppet show. He watched from the side as the children laughed at the foolish Anathema and the slapstick comeuppance for their evils, and he smiled and chuckled along with them. As the show wound to its end, he quietly asked the puppeteer, &quot;Do you know the one where Snowshoe Hare tricks Father Winter into giving away his fire?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:50:30-08:00","id":417094,"title":"","content":"Orca steps off the airship, pulling his coat closer to himself, making a 'brrr' noise as he did so, &quot;Who willingly lives up here in this frozen hell, I'll never know.&quot; It had been a cold trip on the airship, and nothing made Orca miss home more than the cold. Back in the West, his voyages on his ship (the <i>Storm's Saber</i>) were long, treacherous and more often than not deadly, but at least they weren't cold. <br /> <br /> He tosses a jade piece to a vendor as he picks up an apple from a cart and looked around Last Chance. This had to be the place Plentimon was talking about. Months of traveling from frozen hellhole to frozen hellhole looking for signs hinting towards the gambling god's riddle had finally paid off. And hopefully the people he had met on board the ship would be able to help as well.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hey, I'm pretty far north,&quot; He says to no one in particular as he bites the apple, &quot;Maybe I can work out here without worrying about....&quot; He pauses, seeing the puppet show being put on by the Immaculate Monk, &quot;Oh....son of a bitch....&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:54:03-08:00","id":417102,"title":"","content":"&quot;She does them a disservice.&quot;<br /> <br /> The woman who spoke up was well into middle age, her graying hair drawn back in a severe braid. She had a matronly sort of cast, but an expression that said she would take poorly to being called &quot;mother&quot; or &quot;madame&quot;.<br /> <br /> &quot;Happy endings are won with sorrow and sacrifice, if they are won at all, and life does not provide neatly packaged endings. This is good for raising up a crop of dreamers and fools who will end up miserable or dead.&quot;<br /> <br /> She turned to her companion.<br /> <br /> &quot;Or am I just a bitter old spinster who can't let other people be happy?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T19:55:31-08:00","id":417104,"title":"","content":"Lin Zarah stepped off of the airship into the cold. She pulled her fine fur cloak tightly around her neck. <i>One day I will get used to this cold</i>, she told herself. She smiled at the monk and her Anathema puppets. <i>How I loved that show as a child. </i> As she walked past the monk, she put a coin in the offering bowl. &quot;Dragons bless you, sister,&quot; Zarah said in Skytongue. <i>May they bless you with blindness, so I will not need to have you killed. </i> It was not the monks fault she had been taught lies all her life.<br /> <br /> Zarah quickly caught up with the Unrestrained Lover. &quot;Yes, our contact was to meet us there. I'm glad the airships at least keep to some sort of schedule&quot; She smiled at Nergui, the Airship Captain, before turning and heading into town.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-23-2015, 11:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:02:54-08:00","id":417111,"title":"","content":"Nergui startled at the harsh voice interrupting the children's chatter. He turned to look at the matronly woman, frowning.<br /> <br /> Slowly, he raised a finger to his lips. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ssh,&quot; he declared.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:05:03-08:00","id":417112,"title":"","content":"Zarah whispers to Orca, &quot;Please don't start anything here. The monk is nothing to us.&quot; She smiles at the fruit vendor and compliments their selection of fruit.<br /> <br /> &quot;We should hurry.&quot; Zarah says in a more normal tone of voice. &quot;I do not want to have our contact to wait long. Anyways, I am eager to see this warehouse.&quot; <i>To see if it even exists. </i> Even after a few months in the north, Zarah was still wary of their more informal ways.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-23-2015, 11:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:35:55-08:00","id":417137,"title":"","content":"&quot;I'm not gonna start anything. Why would I start something?&quot; Orca says following after Zarah, &quot;The Immaculates are probably freezing their holier-than-thou asses off as much as I am. The last thing they want is a sun demon or whatever the hell they tell people we are.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:47:17-08:00","id":417143,"title":"","content":"Merciful's eye twitched as &quot;she&quot; walked beside Joachim. At this rate it wouldn't matter if no one found out, the Wyld Hunt would burn the emerald down around them.<br /> <br /> &quot;You know I am going to have start soon.&quot; He didn't say what, but he didn't need to. &quot;Are you alright with that?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:49:08-08:00","id":417145,"title":"","content":"&quot;To be honest, the one thing this direction needs is more sun. &quot; Zarah said, as she carefully made her way though the muddy slush covering the road.<br /> <br /> Zarah looks over the various wares as they followed the directions to the warehouse. She made a note of the various types of tools and equipment used to explore the Emerald Labyrinth. &quot;I have idea of how we can start out. We will supply the explorers with simple but quality tools needed to explore the Labyrinth. I suggest we not undercut our competition. We want to be know for quality, not cheap shit. And frankly if half the stories I have heard about this place are true, you do not want to skimp when supplying yourself. &quot; She must think of a slogan based on that idea. Something catchy.<br /> <br /> &quot;Once we make a name for ourselves, we will be the first group the explorers come to when they wish to unload any usual findings they might have. Of course, we will be doing a bit of exploring ourselves. &quot; Zarah was well aware of Orca's wish to enter the Labyrinth. A wish Zarah also shared. She was tired of sitting in offices all day with paperwork. Time to explore and test herself and this power she was gifted.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hopefully, we can hired some workers soon. I don't mean to waste your talents by forging picks and sewing tarps. But we all have to do some drudgery at first.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-24-2015, 01:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T20:51:37-08:00","id":417148,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;if you are that cold you should have let me make that coat for you Orca. Still I will need to find a book on what the words in your world means most of the time I have no idea what you are talking about, what's a demon ?&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">Lin's words made Unrestrained lover smile under his scarf for a second he felt as if he was talking to another alchemical.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Every small work can carry with it the fate of thousands where I come from, you will not hear me complain as long as we make progress. I will come to the labyrinth with you and I have a few things in mind that could be helpful with our project regarding tools and gear for expedition.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-24-2015, 12:00 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T21:18:55-08:00","id":417162,"title":"","content":"&quot;I wore this coat when I stole my first ship from the Realm Navy.&quot; Orca says to the Alchemical, adjusting the (admittedly out of place) captain's coat he wore. &quot;I wore it when found the Library of Bones and took most of it's contents before Moray Darktide even knew I was there. Most importantly, I wore this coat when I bet all my worldly wealth on a roll of the dice against a god of gambling. This coat has been good to me, Lover. And I don't leave behind what's been good to me.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't know how much good I'll be in setting up a business, Zarah.&quot; Orca continues, &quot;I know how to keep a crew happy and fed, but that's hardly enough savvy to get the Guild to start quaking in their boots. As I said, I'm considered a master in alchemy and I dabble in the artificy, so if you can find any use for that I'm....&quot; He pauses, then turns back to Lover.<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait....you don't know what a demon is? Remind me to sit down and talk to you about where you're from again.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 02-24-2015, 12:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T21:32:29-08:00","id":417165,"title":"","content":"Zarah brushed some snow off of the fine coat that the Unrestrained Lover made for Zarah in thanks for help with the Haslanti League. <br /> <br /> &quot;People usually mean two things when they use the word &quot;Demon&quot;. The first are the demons summoned by sorcery from Malfeas. I don't really know much about those demons. I have only seen them time a few times.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;The second are Anathema. The story goes that the corrupt rulers from a lost age stole the power of the sun and moon and used this power to terrorize the people. The dragon blooded rose up against these corrupt rulers and destroyed them. However these Anathema managed to cheat death and go around stealing the soul of the unrighteous and taking over their bodies. There are different variations of the story. The story is a lie to support the authority of the Dragonblooded, who now a days go about using their power to terrorize the people. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T21:35:12-08:00","id":417168,"title":"","content":"Unrestrained Lover felt the weight of that mistake on his shoulder the second it came out of his mouth damn his curiosity about everything.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\">&quot;It is a long story to explain but in simple terms, I'm not from around here and I'm not sure if I explained it that you would be able to comprehend it, at least not yet my friend. I will need to learn more of these demons from malfeas.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-24-2015, 12:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-23T22:09:04-08:00","id":417199,"title":"","content":"&quot;Oh, don't worry, Orca. I am perfectly capable on running the management side of the business. I just need talent to manage such as you and the Unrestrained Lover. I am no great crafter or sorcerer, but I can make sure you have everything you need to succeed in those endeavors. I am also not very good when things turn bloody. I managed to survive as long as I did on the Blessed Isle by not attracting attention to myself. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T10:13:52-08:00","id":417627,"title":"","content":"'I admit that I am unfamiliar with that one, sir. I do know, however, the tale of Danaad versus the Sea Devil. My grandfather taught me this one. It goes like this:<br /> <br /> &quot;One day, Danaad was hungry, so she went fishing. She waited andc waited. She waited for three days and nights, until she finally got a bite. She pulled and pulled, until she pulled up a massive sea devil; one of the Anathema and the so-called rulers of the deep.&quot;<br /> <br /> She uses the blue-haired Danaad from before with tiny fishing rod in hand, and out of nowhere, a large dragon puppet appeared. Well, kind of a dragon puppet. It was actually a stocking with button eyes. <br /> <br /> &quot;&quot;How dare you! I am a ruler of sea, land and sky! I have existed since before you and your family have lived! I lived through an age of wonders, and now you snare me with your hook! What do you wish? My life?&quot;&quot; The Sea Devil demanded angrily, the monk affecting a high-pitched falsetto for the Devil, as the little Danaad puppet shrugged.<br /> <br /> &quot;My apologies, sir Devil. I am merely trying to get a bite to eat. Would you share some of your fish with me?&quot; she asked.<br /> <br /> &quot;Never! You do me this disservice, and then you ask for fish! Begone, evildoer!&quot; the Devil demanded as Danaad replied.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please sir. It's just, they must be so terribly lonely.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;What? What do you mean?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;&quot;Well, the fish, they must be terribly tired of seeing the bottom of your ocean, Why not show them land and let them see how fun it is? We could have a party together,&quot;&quot; Danaad said. The Sea Devil thought and thought, until finally agreeing. He tossed waves of fish to Danaad who picked them up in baskets. After collecting them all, she laughed and began to leave, which infuriated the Sea Devil, who had realized he had been tricked.<br /> <br /> &quot;&quot;You tricked me!&quot; it roared, &quot;&quot;I will feast on your entrails!&quot;&quot;<br /> <br /> Danaad then pointed to the Sea Devil. <br /> <br /> &quot;&quot;You have poor grace and aplomb to one who is your better. Drown in your sins,&quot;&quot; she said, and the Devil drowned, as the evil in its heart consumed its insides. <br /> <br /> The children all clapped and laughed, and the hecklers remained silent, processing the obtuse moral, of which some were secretly sure was &quot;Shut up and die, Anathema,&quot; but remained silent anyways.<br /> <br /> \u200bWhen the puppet play was over, the monk turned to Merciful and scowled, &quot;Madam, if these children do not receive the Catechism of the Dragons, then what chance do they have of living productive lives? By my name of Nellens Xavia Franceska, I will ensure these and all those who will listen receive all the knowledge they wish of the Immaculate Faith.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T17:10:38-08:00","id":418110,"title":"","content":"Meanwhile, as Merciful and Joachim were baiting the Immaculate missionary, Zarah, Orca and Lover descended to leave quietly and track down the warehouse Zarah owned. They passed by the vendors, and on the street beyond, they found a young man with a scruffy beard and unkempt blonde mane talking to a woman with pale skin, dark hair and clear blue eyes.<br /> <br /> &quot;I tell ya, I had the dream again, a sword of light. I can make it, I tells ye, I can do it. I just need more cash,&quot; the youth pleads, as the woman frowns.<br /> &quot;So you can make another glass blade? Lukas, I swear, I've had enough with a &quot;Sword of Light you found in a wreck in the White Sea,&quot; and &quot;Conveniently lost when a bearman mugged you&quot; Give me something to work with, and we'll talk. Like these su--I mean, customers. What can I do for you, outlanders? The name is Ilse Flugelhund. Nice t'meetcha. I run the warehouse district here. Do you wish to buy or sell? I got some great stuff in today. Looks like Rudolf the Razor got one of Rehhanz's kids. That ought to catch a lot of cash. Or do you have some loot of your own?&quot; she asks, as Lukas mutters something about mirrors.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T17:33:38-08:00","id":418130,"title":"","content":"Zarah studies the woman with a critical eye. &quot;What other items do you have for sale? My colleagues and I are always on the watch for the unusual,&quot; she asks. <i>One of Rehhanz's kids? Do they trade slaves in this city?</i><br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Does this woman match the description/name Zarah was given for the Warehouse contact?<br /> <br /> Zarah is going to activate Courtier's Eye Technique on Ilse Flugehund for 3 motes of personal essence. (Exalted Core p. 214).<br /> <br /> Perception 3+ Investigation 3 = 6 dice (6 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7EXPPN6L\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7EXPPN6L</a><br /> <br /> Is there a preferred Dice Roller? I usually roll with this one: <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/</a><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-24-2015, 08:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T18:15:04-08:00","id":418162,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> [OoC: Initially, I was thinking you'd used Wise-eyed Courtier Method, and I was all ready to link to Harry Enfield's Loadsamoney for her motivation. Darn. I use Invisible Castle for my dice roller, as temperamental as it is, but that one is fine, too.]<br /> <br /> Zarah's scan of Ilse's wealth is more than even she suspected. She possesses Resources 4, Backing of 2 from the Haslanti League, and even has an influence of 1 with both them and the Guild. She is a serious contender, especially out here in the boonies. She also notes that Lukas there is a lifelong friend, if sometimes financial parasite of the broker as well, although in what regard, your magic cannot say.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, so you do have a few tricks,&quot; Ilse smiles,&quot; You're trying to cheat at the game, but that's fine. It wouldn't be fun otherwise. Besides, the Guild tries to pull fast ones all the time and forces me to only negotiate with Fae intermediaries. Anyways, I don't have much myself at the moment. A ton or two of Whipwood, a few barrels of sealsap, nothing amazing. We've hit a bit of a dry spell, with Rehhanz moving nearby and eating most of our exploration teams. I have a feeling it'll end soon, though, Rudolf says he has some cockamamie scheme to fell Rehhanz once and for all, but I doubt it'll be so cut and dry. In any case, him being here means more poor souls'll get desperate or brave enough to try venturing in again, and that's when I start rolling in the cash, as they sell their findings to me. 'Course, if you're impatient, you can always try the other brokers. The Icecrowns have one, a Zadro, I believe, while the Guild has Fefrik Keenhand. Don't trust either of them, or you'll end up penniless. That tip's free, something of a rarity with me, but sometimes, I can't help myself,&quot; Ilse says, crossing her arms and grinning.<br /> <br /> Well, then, what will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-24-2015, 09:37 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T18:27:06-08:00","id":418172,"title":"","content":"Zarah smiles back. <i>Ah, the competition. How wonderful to met you so soon,</i> she thinks. &quot;Actually, I was looking for something with a bit more substance. I'm in the market for a warehouse. And it is fortunate that we have run into you, as you are in charge of the warehouse district.&quot; <i>Let's see if she realizes that she has already sold me a warehouse or if she tries to rip us off. </i><br /> <br /> [OOC: Zarah doesn't have that charm yet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Does this woman match the description/name Zarah was given for the Warehouse contact?]","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T20:14:12-08:00","id":418281,"title":"","content":"<i>A sword of light, huh?</i> Orca thinks to himself. Now the wind was blowing in his favor.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pardon me....Lukas was it?&quot; Orca says with a smile, &quot;My name is Orca, a pleasure to meet you. I couldn't help but overhear your story about a sword of light. Would you mind telling me about it? It sounds like quite the story, and I enjoy a good story.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 02-25-2015, 07:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-24T22:51:58-08:00","id":418435,"title":"","content":"Nergui chuckled at the puppeteer's tale of Danaad overcoming the Anathema, particularly at the part where the foolish sea-devil was tricked into throwing all its fish onto the shore.<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, that is a good one!&quot; He declared. &quot;My people tell a similar story of Red Whale, son of the Whale-God, tricking the Walrus Father into sending his people ashore for the tribe to eat them.&quot;<br /> <br /> He stood, from where he'd joined the children seated in the square. He bowed to the puppeteer.<br /> <br /> &quot;I need to go now, but I love your stories. Please visit my airship at the dock tonight. We like well-told tales, and I will be happy to feed you dinner and share tales with you.&quot;<br /> <br /> Tossing a few coins to the children and telling them to buy themselves something nice, he strode off to the market, reminding himself of the list of supplies he needed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T01:07:39-08:00","id":418499,"title":"","content":"&quot;Sister Franceska, are you quarreling with the locals again?&quot; A voice said, from behind Merciful and Joachim. It spoke not in Skytongue, but High Realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T07:44:51-08:00","id":418720,"title":"","content":"Ledaal Roku suppressed a chuckle as he watched the silly little puppet show. It was all lies and half-truths, like everything else that sprung from the mouth of the Immaculate Order, and a tool to indoctrinate the weak and the ignorant. But in time the light of truth would expunge the shadows of falsehood.<br /> <br /> As it always does in the end.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Sister Franceska, are you quarreling with the locals again?&quot;</span><br /> <br /> A chill raced down his spine. High Realm wasn't common in these parts but it was common among servants of the Order. However that was not what gave him pause, it was the accent. Only someone born on High Realm had that accent. And there few highborn of the Realm that would come to a place such as Last Chance.<br /> <br /> At the top of said list was the Dragon-Blooded which could mean trouble and worse.<br /> <br /> <i>'But then ease and luxury breeds sloth and decadence while struggles and challenges breed strength and wisdom.'</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T07:55:45-08:00","id":418731,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=418172#post418172\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zarah smiles back. <i>Ah, the competition. How wonderful to met you so soon,</i> she thinks. &quot;Actually, I was looking for something with a bit more substance. I'm in the market for a warehouse. And it is fortunate that we have run into you, as you are in charge of the warehouse district.&quot; <i>Let's see if she realizes that she has already sold me a warehouse or if she tries to rip us off. </i><br /> <br /> [OOC: Zarah doesn't have that charm yet. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Does this woman match the description/name Zarah was given for the Warehouse contact?]</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Unrestrained Lover will tap on Lin's shoulder and his voice muffled by the scarf a bit and it is thick with his autochtonian accent.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new, courier, monospace\"><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">&quot;I would like to have some of that whipwood I need to learn how to work this material properly before I can begin to produce goods made of it. I can pay for them I think...&quot;</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 02-25-2015, 11:01 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T13:43:27-08:00","id":419283,"title":"","content":"Behind them stood a white haired woman. Svelt in figure and slightly shorter than Franceska. She wore robes of blue and white, in the manner of a priest in the immaculate order. Her skin was pale blue and her eyes glimmered like oricalcum. She gave an affected sigh as she polished a gleaming blue and green smashfist.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T16:00:14-08:00","id":419487,"title":"","content":"Nergui was halfway out of the small crowd of children, muttering things like, &quot;...more sailcloth for Ragnar,&quot; when the new person spoke up. Slowly, he stopped in mid-stride and turned. It would not do to be rude.<br /> <br /> &quot;Um. Your sister is welcome to join us too,&quot; he declared to the puppeteer. Looking the white haired woman up and down, he smiled. &quot;She looks like she also knows some good stories.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T18:15:58-08:00","id":419656,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> In fact, Ilse <i>does</i> match the description of the executor of the real estate transaction that led to you being an owner of a warehouse, Zarah. Fancy that. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, do you now, Mr....Erm, You seem like an Eisen. Can I call you Eisen? Whipwood is great for airship construction. It's as strong as ironwood, doesn't crack in extreme cold, and is flexible as willow, a true wonder of nature. The issue is, the trees tend to be inhabited by man-eating monkeys called Marclars. Nasty little brutes, they'll rip your head off just to eat your ears. So, how much do you want? It's in 2 thumb by 3 thumb y 14 cubit strips, and can easily be made into frames for housing, into airship frames, pretty much anything you'd like,&quot; Ilse said, her eyes lighting up in the heat of the deal.<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Lukas brightens his gloomy demeanor when Orca inquires about his exploits.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, uh, sir. Me and me Da' were out on the floes. Me Da' is a salvager, he skims the ice for wrecks and bits of scrap from ancient ships and aircraft, and we found the mother-lode, we did. We found half a golden airship, complete with intact flight drives and air crystals, and in the captain's chair, we found a book, and <i>the sword</i>. Me Da' thought it was junk, on a pedestal, it looked like a piece of trash, a hilt with no sword. Then I touched the pedestal, and me head went all fuzzy. I felt like I got drunk, but somehow, <i>I felt better</i>, instead of tipsy. Now, like this, I grabbed that hilt, and the thing grew a blade made of light. It thrummed like me Ma's bees do when they're happy, and it crackled in the air like lightning. The thing was amazing. However, that night, we met a bearman out in the floes. We offered him a bit of grub, and he thanked us for it, but when we woke up, the blade was gone. That bastard musta took it. Now, I'm trying to remake it. Such a pretty, pretty thing,&quot; he sighs, a faraway look in his eyes,&quot; All I got to show for it is this,&quot; he says, producing a silver-plated book the size of a dinner plate. <br /> <br /> &quot;I dunno what it does. I've never opened it, but I think it's a book, right,&quot; he asks, showing it to Orca.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T18:35:44-08:00","id":419673,"title":"","content":"(Plaza)<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you, kind sir. See, children? To live a chaste pure life, is to live a path of quiet rewards,&quot; the monk says, bowing, before snapping back up at her name.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who is there? A fellow priest? I am Nellens Xavia Francezka, Student to Ledaal Haiyama Ascendant Sword, and third coil student of the Orinoco Flow path of the Water Dragon. I would have your name, if you please,&quot; the Nellens demands of the newcomer monk.<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, that would do very nicely. Now, if you please, would you all keep it down? I've tolerated you overly long because you paid your evangelical license, Miss Nelly, but you're overstepping your bounds. Again. Do I need to ask the little lady here to summon one of her friends?&quot; a tall, barrel-chested man with a massive flame-red beard said, clapping the shoulder of a pale, skinny girl no more than twelve. Covered in a rough leather cowl, and with silvery unkempt hair done up in several braids, Joachim and Merciful would recognize this girl as a member of the Weiss Zahne tribe; a clan of Icewalkers who live in the bordermarches, and terrorize other tribes with their therianthropic and cannibalistic practices.<br /> <br /> &quot;Dolphin and Kestrel are at my command,&quot; she said, barely a whisper,&quot; Shall I call them?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;My name is not NELLY, Ser Sealowe, please. I won't start a fight here. Please,&quot; Francezka said, as Sealowe arched an eyebrow.<br /> <br /> &quot;Very well, Miss, but remember, I have my eye on you,&quot; Sealowe says, walking off to one side, as the little girl saunters over to Merciful and tugs on his/her hem.<br /> <br /> &quot;Grandma, you have the stink of death on you. Like, everyone you know has died. My sister loved that smell. have you seen her? She has seen 17 summers, and has beautiful hair, the color of raw flesh. She's quite pretty, but a silent wolf got her, and took her to an evil land. My instinct tells me you would know. Do you?&quot; the girl inquires.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T18:40:14-08:00","id":419680,"title":"","content":"Zarah quickly glances over to where Orca is talking to Lukas. <i>My, my, what does the young man have there? </i>She then looks down at her bag and begins to dig though it. Zarah pulls out an envelope with the deeds for the warehouse.<br /> <br /> &quot;Interesting. May we inspect the ironwood you have? But first, &quot; Zarah holds up the deed. &quot;I believe you are my contact for gaining access to my new warehouse. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 02-25-2015, 09:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T19:40:54-08:00","id":419750,"title":"","content":"&quot;That's quite a story, friend.&quot; Orca says, taking the book and looking it over. &quot;But if I know anything about weapons, you're gonna need a lot more than some money to remake your sword of light. Anyways, why haven't you given the book a look over yet? If you found a sword of light next to it, who knows what you've been unknowingly carrying around.&quot; He attempts to open the tome, &quot;So many treasure hunters and explorers go after golden ships or the treasuries of god-kings and ignore the treasures that are in the ship's ledgers and the god-king's libraries. You could have something worth a thousand swords of light here....&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm gonna take a guess and say the book has a lock on it of some sort. Either way, I'm gonna make an Intelligence+Lore roll to see what's in the book.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4787431/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4787431/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4787431/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4787431/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That's 3 successes if I'm counting right. That should be enough to find out something. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 02-25-2015, 10:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-25T21:25:57-08:00","id":419797,"title":"","content":"Merciful had hopped Joachim might try to dissuade him, it wouldn't have worked but that was beside the point. The steward was a razor of cold iron, and would spill an ocean of gossamer until it met something it could not cut. Iron was so very brittle...<br /> <br /> &quot;And how, o teacher, will your lessons serve when their spouses are unfaithful, their friends have their own problems, their partners cheat them, and their rulers are corrupt? You would do them better if you taught ho to live with disappointment.&quot; Before the monk could replay &quot;she&quot; had already walked away. There was likely nothing there, until the pillar of ice that was faith melted in the cruel light of life's ugliness or shattered from the weight of reality. Still, it was a seed that might take root, and easily tossed out.<br /> <br /> Twenty-Fifth Merciful made a lazy circuit of the market, making a show of examining wares. &quot;This would never do, it wouldn't take the cold. More down and wolf fur for the hem, that's the only thing that will do on a night without fire in the Labyrinth. And I needing two score no less! Perhaps the sledman will have something worthwhile.&quot; In truth he really didn't know if the quilted fur would have served, but that didn't matter. The items were props, vectors of communicating <i>I have money, am going to be spending a lot of it, and have few other options</i>. These were men and women of the North, they could survive adversity. Yet test them with prosperity, and one amid a hundred would endure.<br /> <br /> As &quot;she&quot; went about her survey a change came over her. Her steps were graceful, her posture stately, and the lines of age faded as her face relaxed. It was only half an act, for a more material transformation was at work on her necklace. Copper and cheap glass it had looked at first glance, crudely made and old. Now it flashed with the brilliance of emerald and gold, the elegant workmanship marking it with a master's subtlety rather than a novice's hesitation. By the time she returned to the first display she looked some northern princess: determined, innocent, and obviously from money.<br /> <br /> <i>Who does this act debase more?</i><br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Manip 5 + Socialize 0 + Artifact 3 + Stunt 2 =10<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4909/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.rpnation.com/styles/rpnlogo12.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4909/view\" target=\"_blank\"> Oops! We ran into some problems. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4909/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.rpnation.com/dice/4909/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 7 successes</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1144,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","user":"Exthalion","date":". 02-28-2015, 12:36 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T00:44:24-08:00","id":419948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=419673#post419673\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Plaza)<br /> <br /> &quot;Thank you, kind sir. See, children? To live a chaste pure life, is to live a path of quiet rewards,&quot; the monk says, bowing, before snapping back up at her name.<br /> <br /> &quot;Who is there? A fellow priest? I am Nellens Xavia Francezka, Student to Ledaal Haiyama Ascendant Sword, and third coil student of the Orinoco Flow path of the Water Dragon. I would have your name, if you please,&quot; the Nellens demands of the newcomer monk.</div> </div> </div> </div>After their interruption, Xisa took a moment to remember herself, clapping her smashfists together.<br /> &quot;My name is Ledaal Xisa.&quot; She replied with a smile and a bow. &quot;I was sent here to seek counsel from Uncle Haiyama.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 02-26-2015, 03:55 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T10:40:48-08:00","id":420428,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Unrestrained Lover looks at the woman for a few second before answering.</span><br /> <br /> &quot;The name Eisen will be fine for your world, my other name is confusing to your kind. The negotiation of the whipwood will be handle by her.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Unrestrained Lover gesture toward Zarah before turning his attention to both Orca and Lukas, taking a peek at the book cover for a second and looking at Lukas again.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;The weapon you have described matches one of the weapons used by my people I can help you build one should you wish to but it may not be the same weapon. However your book is of interest to me too should you wish to use my expertise the price will be for me to study the book I have the tools to study it correctly.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-26T10:52:25-08:00","id":420446,"title":"","content":"Zarah is amused by the two crafters intense interest in Lukas' book. &quot;While my colleagues are busy, perhaps we can discuss business. I apologize for my rudeness, but I have not introduced myself. My name is Lin Zarah. &quot; <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Now, Zarah activates Mastery of Small Manners (Exalted Core p. 239-240) for one mote of personal essence. <br /> <br /> Investigation Roll for Ilse - Perception 3 + Investigation 3 = 6 Dice (2 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7WCYQE4K\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7WCYQE4K</a><br /> <br /> Investigation Roll for Lukas -Perception 3 + Investigation 3 = 6 Dice (3 successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=67VLXWFK\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=67VLXWFK</a><br /> <br /> Blah, I just reread the charm. I didn't need to make those rolls. Opps. <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T09:36:36-08:00","id":421885,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> As Orca studies the book, he examines a section on the binding. Pressing it, the book begins to glow, shooting open, and a transparent blue specter appeared. No taller than a cat, it was a miniature woman, with an overflowing mane of hair, a series of ornate robes and a horned circlet on her head. She spoke in crisp Old Realm, saying:<br /> <br /> <i>&quot;Herro, Famza Craastusu, this buku is dedicatede zu yu. Yooru Faza hasa asakada me zu pene disi foro yuu. He hasa askada zata I alazo gibi yuu disi messaja.<br /> <br /> &quot;Herro, zonno. I know yuu askado zu go zu Malafeasa, butu yuuru Mazah hasa askada zata yuu conotinue yuuru stahdies. Nowo, nowo, Dada isi noto alla businesse. I thinki you'llu liki ze aza gifiti zata yuur Mazah anda I goto fah yuu. I willi see yuu afata zisi banaquete zata Kojeke izi calliniji. Lovo, Dada&quot;</i><br /> <br /> [TL Note: We understand that Old Realm is effin' weird, so here it is in proper American English:<br /> <br /> Hello, Famza Craastus, this book is dedicated to you. Your Father has asked me to pen this for you. He has asked that I also give you this message.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, Son. I know you asked to go to Malfeas, but your Mother has asked that you continue your studies. Now, now, Dad isn't all business. I think you'll like the other gift your Mother and I got for you. I'll see you after this banquet Kojek is calling. Love, Dad.&quot;]<br /> <br /> With that, the book's pages flare with new silvery writing, spelling out <i>The Big Boy's Book of Monsters, Vol. 4: Nothern Nasties, by Kardalla Flugelhund</i>.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, what subject do you wish to know of?&quot; the transparent sprite inquired to no one in particular.<br /> <br /> Ilse's jaw dropped at the sudden glowing of the book, but quickly returned to her former aloof posture.<br /> <br /> &quot;The whipwood? Of course. Oh, you've finally come! Good, good! A pleasure, Miss Lin. This way, &quot; she says, motioning towards one side of the street. At one end, you follow her into a large building, which is truly massive. You see barrels and pots which suggest the place would be bustling and very cramped if full. At one end, you see a tall pile of thin strips of wood.<br /> <br /> &quot;Here it is, Mmm. Looks like 1.7 tons. That comes about to, oh, 51 dinar or so. That's of course, assuming you want the whole lot. While you're thinking on it, here, let me show you your place.&quot;<br /> <br /> The broker leads you to the opposite end of the street, where you find a dilapidated old building filled with dust and junk.<br /> <br /> &quot;This used to be Jorg's warehouse. Jorg was a trapper and survivalist, and a damn good one, but I guess Rehhanz finally got the best of him. He went on one of Rudolf's hunting parties, and never came back. He has all this weird junk in here, I didn't even bother to sort through it all. Don't worry, it comes with the land. Good luck and good riddance to this damned place. This plot has been over my neck like an Albatross,&quot; Ilse says, handing you the key and pulling out a piece of vellum.<br /> <br /> &quot;That's the deed. Now, is there anything else I can do for you?&quot;<br /> <br /> Meanwhile, back with the trio of smiths, explorers and explorer-smiths, Lukas asks, &quot;So, is this thing really as valuable as ye say, Mister?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1586,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","user":"Dietaku","date":". 02-27-2015, 12:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T09:56:27-08:00","id":421909,"title":"","content":"<i>Great Dragons, what is that smell?</i> Zarah covered her nose when she looked inside of the old dilapidated warehouse. She quickly closed the door and followed Ilse. With a smile she accepted the deed to her warehouse. <i>I hope the boys can do something to fix up the building.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;About the whipwood.... Does 51 dinar include delivery? How long has the wood been sitting? &quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> How many resources does 51 dinar equal to?<br /> <br /> Also, since I must use ALL THE CHARMS.... I am activating Insightful Buyer Technique (Core p. 231) for 3 motes of personal essence on the Whipwood. Is 51 dinar a good price for 1.7 tons?<br /> <br /> Zarah has used 7 motes of personal essence so far.<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T10:22:50-08:00","id":421929,"title":"","content":"(Plaza)<br /> <br /> &quot;You ignored me, Sister always ignored me as well, &quot; the little girl said, as Merciful walked off, snubbing her inquiry. She wandered over to Roku and looked him over.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Wyld has spoken. Your life will be harsh and beset with heavy destiny. I see a falcon descending, also, beware of copper cutlery,&quot; she said quietly, before rejoining Sealowe.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pardon me, sir. Please excuse Mitzi. She's a little strange, but she was once a Wyld shaman for an Icewalker tribe, so she sees things differently than other folk. I am Sealowe Verd, the Burgermeister here. Are you new in Last Chance?&quot; the man asks. <br /> <br /> Meanwhile, Franceska softened at the sound of a familiar name, ignoring Merciful's lambasting as best as she could, &quot; Ascendant Sword-Sifu never mentioned another supplicant, but what does it matter. What would you have me do?&quot;<br /> <br /> With Merciful' slow circuit, heads began to turn, and focus became singular upon the newcomer. <br /> <br /> &quot;My lady, would you care for some rimesilk, the most expensive and finest of all northern commodities. It would look lovely upon one such as you,&quot; a pale, tall man with regal bearing says, bearing armfuls of his wares. The man's obsidian shirt and the black iron badge depicting a crown suggested that man was one of the Icecrown company.<br /> <br /> 'No, no, Zadro, she needs one of our iron torques. Blessed by a priestess of Venus, it will offer long life and good luck: the finest of the Ironsong family's wares,&quot; a dark man in the garb of a blacksmith calls, hefting an intricate armlet with the symbols of the Maiden of Serentiy. <br /> <br /> &quot;You're both daft, this fine maiden needs some of my applefish, fished directly out of the White Sea this morning. Eat one of these, and it will grant you life, beauty and happiness,&quot; a short , bearded man calls, holding up a strange fish looking like it had just been plucked from a tree. <br /> <br /> However, out of the crowd arrives a striking man in leather armor, with a variety of slashing swords on his person. <br /> <br /> &quot;My lady, for one such as you, I would brave the very depths of the Labyrinth. For you, &quot; he says, producing a large cut horn, blacker than night, with veins of red and green running across it.<br /> <br /> &quot;Cut from the head of Rehhanz's child, I wish you to treasure it, and think of me, Rudolf the Razor, when you see it,&quot; he says proudly. However, while Rudolf may be smitten with Merciful's act, his comrade isn't. A gaunt, thin man with shocking white-blue hair, he is of impeccable breeding, as his frozen breath and the crackling electricity around his eyes would suggest. He glowers a small thunderstorm at Merciful and walks off towards a nearby pub.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T13:23:37-08:00","id":422146,"title":"","content":"&quot;Fascinating...&quot; Orca says as he watches the specter float above the pages of the book, &quot;Lukas, you appear to have a sophisticated guide to the most terrifying beasts in the Northern reaches of Creation. Albeit one that seems to have been designed for a child, but that's no reason to write it off as useless. Especially if you intend to go out into the Labyrinth, if everything I've heard is true.&quot; He turns back to the book, &quot;Of course, it'd be useless to anyone who doesn't know the language of the First Age.&quot;<br /> <br /> He clears his throat, <b>&quot;What can you tell me about the creatures that inhabit the islands of the White Sea?&quot;</b><br /> <br /> OOC: The stuff Orca says in bold is being said in Old Realm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T16:58:19-08:00","id":422315,"title":"","content":"&quot;He probably hasn't received word of my-&quot; She paused thinking of the least disruptive synonym for 'exile. &quot;-arrival. It's a bit of a..complex situation back at the Blessed Island, could you tell me the way to the nearest Temple or somewhere one could get out of the cold? I just arrived in town and don't know my bearings. Perhaps somewhere to get a drink?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-27T21:22:43-08:00","id":422590,"title":"","content":"Joachim watches the exchanges thus far, and he has yet to feel his services are needed. He could try to reign in Merciful's excesses, but if he didn't let the Infernal vent now and again, things got interesting. And not in a good way.<br /> <br /> The horn Rudolf produces, however, catches Joachim's eye. Reinhanz's child? Is this Reinhanz some sort of Wyld mutated beast? Or perhaps a behemoth? Regardless, from the way that these hunters speak of it, it is a beast worth hunting.<br /> <br /> With Rudolf basking in the center of attention, and lusting for Merciful, Joachim will follow the lithe, electrical man into the bar. He will then buy a pair of beers, give one to Rudolf's compatriot, and introduce himself, keeping out the part with him being a shapeshifting godling. Most people tend to think that freakish. The weirdos.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T13:29:59-08:00","id":424426,"title":"","content":"Unrestrained Lover found people facination for the magical technologies to be greatly out of proportion at least for him since Orca seemed to have this situation in hand. He decided to leave him to it he could always ask about it later and the boy didn't seem to want is help with the so called sword of light.<br /> <br /> Old Realm: &quot;<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">Don't forget to ask the boy where the golden ship is we could fix it <b>Captain </b>Orca</span>.&quot;<br /> <br /> Leaving Orca with Lukas, Unrestrained Lover will go meet up with Zarah and Ilse.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T09:32:30-08:00","id":426634,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> [Sorry, I forgot to include this before, Wonderandawe.<br /> <br /> Ilse's motivation is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ON-7v4qnHP8\" target=\"_blank\"> Well...</a> while Lukas' is to reforge or find his 'Sword of Light.'<br /> <br /> 51 dinar is a solid Resources 2 amount of funds. The asking price is also actually slightly less than market value, being around 4 dinar per deciton.]<br /> <br /> &quot;It's been here for around three months, since the last explosion of activity. Delivery is included. Don't worry. I want this out of my warehouse. I can feel it in my gut, there's going to be a good haul this time,&quot; Ilse smiles, &quot; So, what do you say?&quot;<br /> <br /> Meanwhile with Orca and Lover, the specter blinks, flattens her robes and says, &quot; The White Sea's inhabitants are a variety of fauna, ranging from the temperate to the subartic, from the lush temperate forests of Bak'Ng Zuda to the harsh cliff-lined fjords of Zustar Fen. The most populous animals are insects, from the Greater Huskroach to the Lesser Dailyfly. The most distinctive, though, are the furred whales and the Flying Pterowyrms, great flying reptiles whose flocks can be seen throughout the north. I could go on, but to describe every animal would be somewhat taxing upon you. Is there anything else?&quot;<br /> <br /> Lukas says, &quot; Mr. Eisen, you said you've seen this sort of thing before, and could help me with me sword. You know about this stuff?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T10:09:50-08:00","id":426655,"title":"","content":"[Plaza]<br /> <br /> (It occurs to you that you've not actually ever heard of the household of Hayama. Roll Int+Lore, difficulty 1, Revenge)<br /> <br /> &quot;Mm, very well, then. i welcome you, and will provide as well as I can. Sadly, the only temple around is where I am staying here. These people do not revere the Dragons, but worship ancient heroes, recalcitrant gods, and Anathema who have propped themselves up as glorious god-beast shamans of these harsh lands. Come, I will show you,&quot; she says, motioning for Xisa to follow. <br /> <br /> provided she does, you'll find a very modest one room apartment near the airship docks. On one end is a copy of <i>The Scriptures of the Five Dragons</i>, and several melted candles, presumably used for vigil meditations. <br /> <br /> &quot;Feel free to stay here as long as you desire. Sadly, my resources are small at this point. I have been living off donations and bounties for defeating evil spirits from these uncouth barbarians. On top of this, my parents have cut me off, ever since I was defeated by that Fist King of Whitewall,&quot; the Water Dragon screws up her face, fighting back tears.<br /> <br /> [Nergui] <br /> <br /> While everyone is obsessing over Merciful, you begin to smell something...enticing. Roll Perception+Survival, difficulty 2. <br /> <br /> [Joachim]<br /> <br /> Inside the bar, you see that it largely empty, save for the white-haired man from before and a person in robes with an impressive set of horns on their head.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, you followed me, eh? Well, pull up a chair, friend,&quot; the white-haired man says, motioning for you to sit by him,&quot; The name's Polestar Ephemereal Zan. Some call me Zan the Storm Lord, but you can just call me Zan, I guess. You might've guessed, but it wasn't Rudolf that killed that animal, it was me. And it wasn't a short and sweet deal, either. It took three days before infection and loss of blood finally killed it. My fighting style is brutal, but Incarnae in Heaven, that thing was tough. And Rudolf wants to go after the parent, Sheisse, this is going to be a terrible ordeal. I may very well end up dead. Ah, what am I saying, telling a newcomer like you my issues. Where do you come from, friend?&quot; <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T10:58:09-08:00","id":426706,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=426634#post426634\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> [Sorry, I forgot to include this before, Wonderandawe.<br /> <br /> Ilse's motivation is <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ON-7v4qnHP8\" target=\"_blank\"> Well...</a> while Lukas' is to reforge or find his 'Sword of Light.'<br /> <br /> 51 dinar is a solid Resources 2 amount of funds. The asking price is also actually slightly less than market value, being around 4 dinar per deciton.]<br /> <br /> &quot;It's been here for around three months, since the last explosion of activity. Delivery is included. Don't worry. I want this out of my warehouse. I can feel it in my gut, there's going to be a good haul this time,&quot; Ilse smiles, &quot; So, what do you say?&quot;<br /> <br /> Meanwhile with Orca and Lover, the specter blinks, flattens her robes and says, &quot; The White Sea's inhabitants are a variety of fauna, ranging from the temperate to the subartic, from the lush temperate forests of Bak'Ng Zuda to the harsh cliff-lined fjords of Zustar Fen. The most populous animals are insects, from the Greater Huskroach to the Lesser Dailyfly. The most distinctive, though, are the furred whales and the Flying Pterowyrms, great flying reptiles whose flocks can be seen throughout the north. I could go on, but to describe every animal would be somewhat taxing upon you. Is there anything else?&quot;<br /> <br /> Lukas says, &quot; Mr. Eisen, you said you've seen this sort of thing before, and could help me with me sword. You know about this stuff?&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>Unrestrained Lover stops turning around and comming a bit uncomfortably close to Lukas before saying with a metalic voice.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;I exist for the sole purpose of creating technological weapons Lukas should your sword be the weapon I think it is I can build one and show you how to do so but it is a long and difficult process. If you have the will to learn the secrets of magitech I will teach you. Come to Lin Zarah's warehouse tomorrow for now I have work to do.&quot; <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">Turning around...Again Unrestrained Lover leaves the boy with Orca to meet up with Zarah and Ilse as they are still dealing.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;You have an interesting companion miss Ilse, as the price been negotiated Lin Zarah ?.&quot;</span></span></span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T11:34:27-08:00","id":426741,"title":"","content":"Weighing the different market factors, Zarah decides that Ilse\u2019s Whipwood trade is a fair deal. She holds out her hand and says \u201cI believe we have a deal.\u201d<br /> <br /> After making arrangements to transfer the funds, Zarah leads The Unrestrained Lover (and Orca, if he is finished with Lukas) to the warehouse.<br /> <br /> &quot;What can you make out of the Whipwood we just bought?&quot; Zarah asks the Unrestrained Lover.<br /> <br /> Zarah unlocked the door. \u201cThe warehouse is in about the shape I imagined it to be. However, I was not expecting all this junk\u2026or the smell.\u201d She covers her face with the sleeve of her coat, after opening the door. \u201cThe former owner was a trapper, so I assume there is some dead thing rotting in here.\u201d<br /> <br /> She walks around, checking in one of the crates. \u201cPerhaps we can find something interesting in this mess. \u201c<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> I hope I am not going too far with the smell thing I added to the warehouse. It could be some dead thing or it could be Zarah being a prissy bitch. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-03-2015, 02:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-03T21:22:36-08:00","id":427373,"title":"","content":"Orca shrugs, shutting the book, &quot;This could prove to be very useful once we learn more about what the Labyrinth was when this book was written.&quot; He hands the book back to Lukas, &quot;It was a certainly pleasure, Lukas. I'd love to read this again, preferably when I have explored the Labyrinth a bit more.&quot; He lifts off his hat and gives a nod to the young man before turning around to join his companions.<br /> <br /> Orca wrinkles his nose as soon as he enters the warehouse. &quot;I don't suppose any of us hired anyone to open these crates for us?&quot; He asks Lover and Zarah. After a long silence, he claps his hands together, &quot;Right then, let's see what wonders this smelly warehouse holds!&quot; <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Perception+Investigation Roll to find any awesome stuff in the warehouse<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4792683/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4792683/\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4792683/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4792683/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That would make 5 successes. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T05:29:39-08:00","id":427630,"title":"","content":"OOC: <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EKQH4QP3\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes on smellin'.</a><br /> <br /> Nergui, determined not to be distracted again as he made his way to the market to purchase supplies for his airship...found himself once again distracted, by an enticing odor.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T10:52:11-08:00","id":427836,"title":"","content":"&quot; The name's Joachim,&quot; the steward says, &quot;I'm from a small town not far from Iceholm. I make it my occupation to slay strange monsters and beasts, especially those from the Wyld.&quot;<br /> <br /> Setting down a drink in front of Zan, Joachim takes a hearty drink of his own, savor in the earthy flavors of the drink before continuing. &quot;Some friends of mine came here to set up business, and I came along to safeguard their interests from the local wildlife. Or the local wyldlife, as the case may be. Care to tell the story of how you took down that beastie? I'd be more than happy to offer another story in exchange.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T14:48:21-08:00","id":428161,"title":"","content":"It was a humble abode, to be sure. Nevertheless, she bowed to Sister Fran after hearing her tale.<br /> &quot;I am in your debt for this hospitality, Sister. If you need help, do not hesitate to call on me.&quot;<br /> With that she placed her pack in the corner and walked out into the streets, lost in thought as she puzzled over what she knew of her Uncle's side of the family. Unerringly, she arrived at a Teahouse.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793269/\" target=\"_blank\">2d10.hits(6)=1</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 03-04-2015, 07:18 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T17:50:21-08:00","id":428357,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> &quot;Wait, Mister Orca. I really appreciate you telling me all this. If you need anything, I have a smithy in the business district. You come on down if you need anything, 'kay?&quot; he says, bowing. <br /> <br /> At Zarah's warehouse, the smell is overwhelming, a mixture of rot, ammonia, and the must of neglect. Orca's searching, however, comes up with a small section in the back hollowed out of the boxes and other rubbish. There was a cot, several hides stretched out on racks, and a series of parchments tacked onto a nearby wall. Of note, there are a trio of pieces:<br /> <br /> &quot;Rehhanz: Poison, blades, arrows, traps. Nothing works. Maybe blunt force? I've secured the hardest hides I can. This ought to protect me from his fangs. <br /> <br /> Xa Borugo: He is always seen in water. I bet if I dam his marshes, the bastard would be weakened. Gotta beware his tongue, though. <br /> <br /> Yrmanaea: I see her flying everyday. She seems to have no interest in ground targets. I observed her motions all day. I'm unsure what, if anything, I can do. Ugh, my head aches. I need to open my eyes. My eyes <i>are</i> open, though. I'm abandoning my disguises now, I don't need them, even in the open. It'll be cold tonight. What am I doing? Is this all in vain? No, I need to hold on. <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">There </span><span style=\"color:#FF8C00\">can </span><span style=\"color:#FFFF00\">be </span><span style=\"color:#00FF00\">no </span><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">shame</span><span style=\"color:#EE82EE\">.</span><br /> <br /> On another page, there read:<br /> <br /> &quot;Ugh. No more skywatching Yrmanaea. She messed me up something fierce. However, when in my trance, I found the name &quot;Salamandarian.&quot; I've seen that on several pillars near the Forest Folk's territory. I better check it out.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, the notes end. What will you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T17:57:47-08:00","id":428359,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The lumbering Steward follows the scent to a side alley of the marketplace, where she sees a coughing man in robes. He turns to Nergui.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorry, Guv,&quot; he says in a squelchy voice, before hacking up a strange, pinkish, brackish liquid, and collapsing, a large pink flower erupting out of his back. The man's visible flesh collapses like a deflated balloon, overtaken by a onrush of vines and similar flowers growing out of the body with supernatural speed. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, Forest Folk Illness. I'd stay away if I were you, kind sir,&quot; a fishwife says, sauntering over to the Lunar, &quot; Explorers who get too close to the Forest Folk get like this. Some say it's the Will of the Labyrinth itself, to kill those who displease it and its ancient goals.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, that was odd, what will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T18:02:50-08:00","id":428361,"title":"","content":"(Bar)<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, well met, Joachim. Oh, how I took it down? Well, I'm blessed by the Dragons with great power, and my family knows some tricks. I joined Rudolf to earn some dosh, and the work seemed easy enough. Then he takes us to hunt that thing. It ambled out of the brush like the trees around it were water to be brushed aside. He approached us, and trampled one of our number like they were a bug. It then took three arrows to the face like they were nothing. Rudolf then did his thing and cut off its horn. All that did was make it mad. I had to fight it. It took me three days to wear it down, and that was because of my family's special techniques. I guess it lost too much blood and was too ill with all the flesh I ripped off it. That's my one weakness, I can't fight partway,&quot; he says solemnly, taking another shot&quot; What of you, then? I suspect that a hunter like you isn't ordinary if you came here of your own free will, eh?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T18:07:45-08:00","id":428365,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> You realize in your reflection that there is no Ledaal household called Hayama. Hayama is in fact, a gens from Lookshy. As you enter the teahouse, you see that the establishment has a few patrons at the moment, but your gaze turns to a tall, elegant woman in glasses, reading a scroll.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-04T20:03:31-08:00","id":428462,"title":"","content":"&quot;Damn it,&quot; Orca says, &quot;Ten minutes after I let the book walk out of here.&quot; He gathers up the papers off the wall. He begins walking between the crates, focusing on the four names on the paper. &quot;Rehhanz....Xa Borugo.....Yrmanaea....Salamandarian....&quot; He repeats the names in his head again and again. &quot;Have I heard those names before? They appear to be either places or the names of hunters....looking for this Salamandarian beast...&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm gonna make an Intelligence+Lore roll to see if Orca knows anything about what is written in these papers. Namely the three names Rehhanz, Xa Borugo and Yrmanaea.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793486/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793486/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793486/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4793486/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> A grand total of 4 successes. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T10:42:33-08:00","id":428972,"title":"","content":"Zarah removed her coat sleeve from her nose and tries to find the source of the stink. She meanders through the warehouse, checking any suspicious crate or puddle. <br /> <br /> <br /> Upon hearing the word \u201cRehhanz\u201d from Orca, Zarah says \u201cIlse said that someone killed one of Rehhanz\u2019s kids. We should probably see if we can take a look at the corpse before it is parted out.\u201d <br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Investigation Roll to find source of smell - Perception 3 + Investigation 3 = 6 Dice (3 Successes) - <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=Q2BGW2HF\" target=\"_blank\">http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=Q2BGW2HF</a><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T13:36:53-08:00","id":429229,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=428365#post428365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> You realize in your reflection that there is no Ledaal household called Hayama. Hayama is in fact, a gens from Lookshy. As you enter the teahouse, you see that the establishment has a few patrons at the moment, but your gaze turns to a tall, elegant woman in glasses, reading a scroll.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Xisa was pleasanty surprised. She honestly was not expecting the locals to be literate. As she passed behind the woman had to remind herself that reading over someone's shoulder was terribly rude and unbecoming of a priestess of the great dragons.<br /> <br /> Funny how a few sparse weeks can change a person. Time was, that mode of thought would have stopped her.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><ul><li>Per+Linguistics to read the Scroll: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4794140/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4794140/</a> 4 Hits</li> <li>Wits+Stealth to not get caught:<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4794142/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4794142/ </a>9 Hits</li> </ul></div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 03-05-2015, 06:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-05T22:35:39-08:00","id":429848,"title":"","content":"(Plaza - Twenty-Fifth Merciful)<br /> <br /> There is a certain trick to layering false emotions. It served Merciful's purpose to appear to be overwhelmed, and it served the character he was playing to seem in control. The end result was a flash of uncertainty followed by what looked to be the practiced act of restoring a mask of calm. It was calculated, deliberate, and unnatural in its way as lasting peace to mankind.<br /> <br /> The man of Whitewall had been something of a liar as a child, before the rod broke him of it. Yet he had never learned the art of it. Even the Echo of the Abyss had not been able to impart the zen of freedom. Instead the demon prince had been ammused to teach him the ordered ways of deceit. In some ways that was better, for it made every lie a choice rather than the emmanation of a truthless heart.<br /> <br /> Begin by securing the mercenary. Appeal to his gallant worldview before dismissing him and begin suduction.<br /> <br /> &quot;Lord Razor, you do my hou- I mean you do me a great honor.&quot; The woman accepted the token gravely, planning to examine it later for potential traps. &quot;I accept this gift though I have none of equal worth to offer in exchange, save what treasures and glory lie within the deep Emerald. With you by my side of I have no doubt we will succeed mightily. I must only request that when we are not among the crowds you will consent to display your skills. While I have no doubt of your quality, I could not bear the thought that you would risk too much harm on my account.&quot;<br /> <br /> Make it personal, don't separate them from their services and make them think there was more promised or hoped for.<br /> <br /> The woman turned to regard the remaining merchants. &quot;I have no doubt that I will need of all of you. From what you have already displayed I believe there is much we could do together.&quot;<br /> <br /> Hint at future business with the tact of one only moderately skilled at the game of negotiation, while more subtlely indicating that she wouldn't be able to refute the prices they would quote.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Labryinth is a trecherous place, and the expedition I will be putting together will need every chance of success. Moreover, I will need those with an eye for value to know best how to use what we recover.&quot;<br /> <br /> Finally, appear superstitious and in need of more expensive wares. Offset the minor slight to the fishmonger and clother merchant with requests for favors to build trust.<br /> <br /> &quot;Were I divine I could meet with all of you first, but I am afraid that I am not. Master Ironsong, I would dearly love the aid of the Great Goddess in my venture. With her blessing I will surely prosper. Might you have other protections for the other members as well as our provisions?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T15:43:28-08:00","id":430710,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse) <br /> <br /> Orca recalls that he has heard of Rehhanz before; a great black beast that bedevils Last Chance every so often, having done so for decades. Its origin or species being unknown. He also recalls an airship sailor at the docks turning to the horizon, where some unusually violent clouds were forming muttering the odd prayer, 'Orame, Orame, Deus Vult, Yrmanaea,&quot; under his breath, although what that could mean is anyone's guess. <br /> <br /> The others, though, especially the Salamandarian? You recall nothing. <br /> <br /> Zarah's quest to locate the smells turns her towards the tanning racks. She then tries to locate the rotting smell, and finds another nook in the rubbish and boxes to find a stone slab, upon which a piglet has been gutted. From the gruesome removal of its guts and the 'Divination for dummies&quot; manual in Rivertongue nearby, you'd surmise that the previous owner used this space for trying to gain insight into the future. A gross, intestinal future.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:00:48-08:00","id":430744,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The scroll is not what you expected. Although, upon reflection, you're not sure what you expected. The scroll turns out to contain a variety of comics in Old Realm. Called &quot;Hai and Roishi,&quot; it depicts a male Unclean (Twilight) and a female Frenzied (Full Moon) vacillating between being incredibly introspective and being incredibly crass with one another. Of particular note is the incredibly low-brow tack of the humor, which seems to revolve around sexual situations or the two protagonists molesting one another. A memorable strip was where Roishi the Unclean commented that MRL's taxation plan was like Hai in that it poked him in the eye at inopportune moments, all while Hai is in a half-Human, half-Spotted Hyena visage, flustered at the comment. A hawkish female figure called MRL, usually accompanied by another woman in tacky glowing wings appeared every so often, usually to be the butt of some joke, while another recurring character, Za Maganasa, seemed to generally earn high fives and be an all-round cool guy, even if all he did was show up and wear sunglasses. <br /> <br /> Truly, this was an artifact from a dark point in history...<br /> <br /> The reader doesn't notice you. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:04:39-08:00","id":430746,"title":"","content":"Upon seeing the inside of the warehouse Unrestrained Lover began to wander throught the crates and check the walls and doors to see structural weakpoints and flaws before answering Zarah.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Nothing for now. First let's clean and fix this place up a bit first then build an office to allow you to do proper trade next will be rooms and furniture along with beds for us stay here. Do you find such course of action acceptable ?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:12:43-08:00","id":430751,"title":"","content":"(Plaza-Merciful and Marian)<br /> <br /> &quot;Of course, my lady. My wish to only to assist such a brave soul as yourself,&quot; Rudolf says, bowing, clearly pleased with the attention he was getting, while Zadro's face became an imperceptible mask. <br /> <br /> &quot;I don't have any other such artifacts on hand. The priestess I had consecrate them doesn't live here. She usually is up in Diamond Hearth, although I could call her here via airmail. It would take about a week for her to get the message and come here, though,&quot; Ironsong replies, tugging at his beard absentmindedly,&quot; Although I could begin work on the torques right away.&quot;<br /> <br /> The entire market seemed intent on answering Merciful's call, his implicit promises of wealth and fame worming their ways into their hearts. All, it seems, except Mitzi and Sealowe, who seem to have their own thoughts and goings on. <br /> <br /> This odd scene was what Marian walked into off the airship dock. Truly, his <i>Grim Grimoire of the Black Sun</i> hadn't prepared him for this spectacle. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:27:17-08:00","id":430764,"title":"","content":"&quot;Anything, as long as we clean ...THAT... &quot; Zarah gestures towards the gutted corpse. She turns and runs out of the warehouse. Both Orca and The Unrestrained Lover hear the sound of Zarah retching just outside of the door.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-06T16:36:52-08:00","id":430793,"title":"","content":"&quot;Nothing too special&quot; Joachim says, &quot;I'm not from any powerful stock. I had a run in with the Fae when I was younger. They were chasing me and, well...&quot;<br /> <br /> Joachim takes a drink of his rapidly diminishing beer, pondering how exactly to put this. Zan doesn't seem to have Immaculate views, but still, letting it out that he's a Lunar might not be a good idea anyway.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, I wouldn't be here if I hadn't run into an ancient and terrible spirit that really didn't like Fae. In exchange for service in her battles with the Fae, she levied upon me a number of powerful divine blessings. Among them is the power to gain the strength of beasts I slay. My hunting is just a way for me to earn a living while acting in service of my patron.&quot;<br /> <br /> True, but not the truth.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Rolling (Manipulation + Presence) boosted by 3 dice with the First Manipulation Excellency, Joachim gets <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4795262/\" target=\"_blank\">3 successes</a>.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-07T21:03:21-08:00","id":432214,"title":"","content":"Prodigal steps into the scene in the market and steps back to observe what is going on. After all, one does not learn anything if they don't observe. He skirts around the outskirts of the activity and politely declines any goods or services offered. Should any of the merchants be too keen on a sale, a more stern and meaningful look should do the trick.<br /> <br /> <i>I wonder how many of these people will pledge themselves to assist the lady before they even know her, </i>He muses. <i>She almost has me convinced, but I am not so easily swayed. Not anymore.</i><br /> <br /> The Daybreak will observe for now. Content to be away from the attentions of others and try to keep the doubts and fears at the back of his mind from overwhelming the possibilities for furthering his own goals the Emerald would present to him.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T01:53:23-08:00","id":432417,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=430744#post430744\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The scroll is not what you expected. Although, upon reflection, you're not sure what you expected. The scroll turns out to contain a variety of comics in Old Realm. Called &quot;Hai and Roishi,&quot; it depicts a male Unclean (Twilight) and a female Frenzied (Full Moon) vacillating between being incredibly introspective and being incredibly crass with one another. Of particular note is the incredibly low-brow tack of the humor, which seems to revolve around sexual situations or the two protagonists molesting one another. A memorable strip was where Roishi the Unclean commented that MRL's taxation plan was like Hai in that it poked him in the eye at inopportune moments, all while Hai is in a half-Human, half-Spotted Hyena visage, flustered at the comment. A hawkish female figure called MRL, usually accompanied by another woman in tacky glowing wings appeared every so often, usually to be the butt of some joke, while another recurring character, Za Maganasa, seemed to generally earn high fives and be an all-round cool guy, even if all he did was show up and wear sunglasses.<br /> <br /> Truly, this was an artifact from a dark point in history...<br /> <br /> The reader doesn't notice you. What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Intrigued, Xisa got comfortable and continued reading along behind the woman, curious as to where she got this scroll. It might've occurred to her to ask, but it also occurred to her that she probably wouldn't tell any stranger, much less an Immaculate Monk, she'd probably think Xisa would try and confiscate the rest or something.<br /> <br /> A particularly crude joke made her giggle. Damn the luck.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T05:54:10-07:00","id":432563,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=428359#post428359\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The lumbering Steward follows the scent to a side alley of the marketplace, where she sees a coughing man in robes. He turns to Nergui.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sorry, Guv,&quot; he says in a squelchy voice, before hacking up a strange, pinkish, brackish liquid, and collapsing, a large pink flower erupting out of his back. The man's visible flesh collapses like a deflated balloon, overtaken by a onrush of vines and similar flowers growing out of the body with supernatural speed.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, Forest Folk Illness. I'd stay away if I were you, kind sir,&quot; a fishwife says, sauntering over to the Lunar, &quot; Explorers who get too close to the Forest Folk get like this. Some say it's the Will of the Labyrinth itself, to kill those who displease it and its ancient goals.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, that was odd, what will you do now?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Is there a healer in the area good enough to treat it?&quot; Nergui stepped forward and knelt beside the ill man, who was deflating before his eyes. He lowered his head next to the flowers and vines as he listened for a heartbeat or liquid in lungs. He dipped two fingers into the strange liquid and sniffed it before licking his fingers to taste it, trying to determine from its flavor what the plant was doing to this man's insides. &quot;I am g-graced by the Mother of All Dreams, and do not grow sick as other men do. I can carry him to a healer..&quot;<br /> <br /> OOC:<a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=V3B7W2YL\" target=\"_blank\"> 2 successes on a Percep+Medicine roll to examine the man</a>. Hopefully he's not dead yet and may still be saved. If he is dead, hopefully Nergui can determine the manner of death (or the manner of infection) to help prevent others from sharing his fate. Also: any of you other PCs who's traveled on Nergui's ship mentioned being a supernaturally potent healer or doctor in the last few weeks? If you haven't brought it up he won't think of you, but if you've mentioned you're a healer he may go to you first with this.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T00:45:30-07:00","id":433650,"title":"","content":"Orca watches Zarah run and vomit with a puzzled look on his face, &quot;You'd think she'd never seen an animal sacrifice to peer into the future.&quot; The pirate gathers up the animal corpse as if it were just another piece of trash, taking it outside and tossing it into a refuse heap in a nearby alleyway.<br /> <br /> &quot;It takes some time to turn any ship into a home, friends. Especially if that ship is a warehouse. But we have all our time here in Last Chance to do that. For now, I'd like to take my new crewmates out for drinks!&quot; He puts an arm around Zarah and another around Lover. He looks over Lover's strange appearance, raising an eyebrow, &quot;.....do they have taverns in whatever place you are from?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T06:36:56-07:00","id":433886,"title":"","content":"Unrestrained Lover lover tuun to Orca and laugh a bit before taking off his scarf revealing his face covered in motonic circuits and his other implant in the back of the head that look at lot like cooling vents along with crystals held in an oricalchum that covers most of the back of his head before becoming smaller and descending along his spine dissapearing in his clothings. <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Of course we have my world is habited by human after all, in a way I am like you which is why I look different. Are you sure it won't cause problem ? I think it is time to tell you both where I am from don't you agree ?&quot;</span><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T07:27:55-07:00","id":434002,"title":"","content":"While Orca was cleaning up the piglet corpse, Zarah freshened up a bit. <br /> <br /> &quot;On the Blessed Isle, we don't use such...savage means of divination.\u201d She thought for a moment. How did they peer into the future in the Imperial Court? Zarah never saw a requisition for animals for that purpose. An old memory surfaced from when she was a student at the Spiral. She remembered preparing tea for distinguished guests from the Imperial Court. Or was it the Heptagram. The more she thought about it, the less certain she was.<br /> <br /> \u201cTea leaves. Our Astrologist read the dregs of tea leaves to gain insight into the future.\u201d Zarah tried to remember how she connected tea leaves to divination. Must have been a book she read years ago. <br /> <br /> She brightened at the idea of getting out of the warehouse for a bit, though she no longer wanted to see Rehhanz\u2019s offspring. After the piglet the prospect of seeing another dead animal corpse was unbearable. <br /> <br /> \u201cYes. I am quite interested in hearing more about your life, <i>Mr. Eisen</i>. \u201c Zarah has assumed that the man was some Seventh Legion experiment when she first met him. As she traveled with the Unrestrained Lover, she realized that was not true. He knew too little\u2026about everything. But a great deal about machines. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T13:16:19-07:00","id":436114,"title":"","content":"(Tavern-Joachim, Orca, Zarah and Lover)<br /> <br /> &quot;Is that right? I'll drink to that. Although, I have a piece of advice. Never, ever, let your your guard down out there. That's how this mess started. You relax and the Labyrinth eats your face. I've seen that happen once. It was kind of funny in hindsight,&quot; Zan says, sipping his drink. <br /> <br /> At that, Orca, Zarah and Lover all entered the bar, to find their comrade conversing with an Air Aspect Dragonblood. In the corner is a figure in robes with large horns on their head, drinking a foul-smelling liquid which may or may not be gasoline. The bartender, a portly, balding man with an impressive moustache, asks for your order.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T13:21:05-07:00","id":436120,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The man is alive, but only just. The woman, clearly surprised by your refusal to let the man expire, says,&quot; Well, there's Adelheid, but he's never been able to treat the disease, nor has anyone ever since it was first seen. If you'd like to take him there, Adelheid is up on the far end of the plaza, that's where his clinic is, anyways.&quot;<br /> <br /> A small crowd of people have begun to gather around Nergui and the sick man. Clearly, his act of kindness is being noticed.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T14:52:43-07:00","id":436300,"title":"","content":"Zarah takes in the unfamiliar selection of bottles lining the wall behind the bar. &quot;Do you have any Icewine?&quot; she asks the bartender.<br /> <br /> After taking her drink, Zarah walks over to the table with Joachim and the Dragon blooded. \u201cJoachim, just the man I wanted to see. Have you heard anything about this Reinhanz creature? Not too many people want to go into the Labyrinth with a man eating beast out there. You can imagine the impact on the local economy with no exotic goods coming in. \u201c","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T15:50:28-07:00","id":436364,"title":"","content":"(Prodigial)<br /> <br /> This strange new sight overtakes you: While Merciful is peddling his implicit pyramid scheme, a new crowd begins to gather around Nergui while he calls for a healer.<br /> <br /> However, a strange sense of nostalgia and dread seems to wash over you. Roll Wits+Occult at difficulty 3. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T17:25:58-07:00","id":436445,"title":"","content":"Prodigal stares around him in mute reverie, wracking his brain in an attempt to figure out why this is so unsettling to him. It's right there in the dark recesses of his mind. Fleeing from him. Like something skittering in the darkness. Retreating before the light. Promising to be caught if only one can be quick enough.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I decided to try and use Wise Old Guru's dice roller as Invisible Castle was down. I had to roll twice and regret that I didn't roll the first one right. It would seem I had less successes on the first roll, but I can't be sure as I can't see the results of the individual dice. Therefore I can't be sure exactly how many successes I got and I have to go with the results of the second roll. You should be able to see both rolls with the link provided.<br /> <br /> Without further delay, you can find my roll of Wits (3) + Occult (5) = Eight (8) dice = <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7F267926\" target=\"_blank\">Seven (7) successes</a> here.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T17:31:18-07:00","id":436451,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The woman turns around, any surprise she had is not noticeable. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, you like it, do you? That's wonderful. Most everyone around here can't read them. It's a shame, it really is joy to read. I am Sala, by the by. Might I have your name, honorable scholar? Come, sit, I have many more of these, if you'd like,&quot; she says, patting a nearby chair and waving her hand over several other scrolls with such titles as &quot;Hi and Roishi: Brass Dancer Boogie, Hi and Roishi: Pattern Spiders are not Construction Materials, and Hi and Roishi: House of Daiklaives&quot; littered around on the table.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-10T17:34:56-07:00","id":436454,"title":"","content":"(Prodigial)<br /> <br /> Your thought process was relatively spot on, as you get the unmistakable sense that this area is steeped in the essence of death. Something undead is here, and has been for some time. Just thinking about it makes your mouth burn with the coppery tang of the Underworld. <br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T05:44:20-07:00","id":436920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=436120#post436120\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The man is alive, but only just. The woman, clearly surprised by your refusal to let the man expire, says,&quot; Well, there's Adelheid, but he's never been able to treat the disease, nor has anyone ever since it was first seen. If you'd like to take him there, Adelheid is up on the far end of the plaza, that's where his clinic is, anyways.&quot;<br /> <br /> A small crowd of people have begun to gather around Nergui and the sick man. Clearly, his act of kindness is being noticed.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Gently lifting the man, Nergui stood. &quot;Adelheid will get another chance, then.&quot;<br /> <br /> He walked to the other end of the plaza quickly and as smoothly as possible. If this sick man was going to die, Nergui didn't want his last memories to be uncomfortable jostling and bouncing.<br /> <br /> &quot;Please run ahead and let Adelheid know we are coming?&quot; He spoke to a young person in the crowd. &quot;He may want to treat this man away from other patients.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-11T20:47:45-07:00","id":437965,"title":"","content":"Orca tosses down a few bits of silver onto the counter, &quot;A round of strong drink for me and my friends.&quot; He gestures back to Zarah and Lover. At that moment he spots Joachim talking to the Dragon-Blooded, recognizing him from the <i>Dancing Pelican</i>, &quot;And a drink for my friend and the gentleman at that table over there!&quot; He pauses a moment, then smirks, &quot;Aw, to hell with it! A round for the whole place!&quot; With that, he tosses down a pouch of silver, &quot;I just got here and it's always good to make some new friends.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm gonna roll Socialize+Charisma to get on the good side of the bar patrons (and hopefully a good chunk of Last Chance too, hopefully). I'll use 3 motes to use my First Excellency and boost my die pool a bit:<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=7LYGGGPJ\" target=\"_blank\">44(9d10) = 44</a><br /> <br /> So that's 5 successes. (Sorry, InvisibleCastle seems to be down and I'm not used to this new one. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T08:44:26-07:00","id":438443,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=436451#post436451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The woman turns around, any surprise she had is not noticeable.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;Oh, you like it, do you? That's wonderful. Most everyone around here can't read them. It's a shame, it really is joy to read. I am Sala, by the by. Might I have your name, honorable scholar? Come, sit, I have many more of these, if you'd like,&amp;quot; she says, patting a nearby chair and waving her hand over several other scrolls with such titles as &amp;quot;Hi and Roishi: Brass Dancer Boogie, Hi and Roishi: Pattern Spiders are not Construction Materials, and Hi and Roishi: House of Daiklaives&amp;quot; littered around on the table.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Ledaal Xisa, pupil of Sifu Five, Grandchild of Mela, Petitioner of Clouds.&quot; Xisa replied before surveying the pile. &quot;Its a very interesting collection. Where'd you find such works in this condition?&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 03-13-2015, 06:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-12T21:17:10-07:00","id":439352,"title":"","content":"The Daybreak stops his thoughts in mid-stream. <i>Of course there would be something like that here. The only question is what exactly is it and how do we deal with it?</i> He walks slowly, deliberately. His steps a mirror to his thoughts. The Abyssal searches through the memories and histories he has cataloged in his brain for any information that might be of use to his current inquiry.<br /> <br /> He knows that his source of power is even more precious here than in the underworld, but he pours everything he can into the effort of bringing forth the knowledge he knows he contains in his mind. In his mind he can see musty old tomes that open, pages that fly by in a flash. Yet he can still read them that fast, as it is his sharp mind doing the reading without having to rely on his eyes. He is recalling that which he has already committed to memory. So the tomes will open, flash their contents to him, and close to make way for others as he dismisses them as being not pertinent to his current quest for information.<br /> <br /> He stops walking only when he feels he has come to the end of the line with his thought process. Whether that is a conclusion that will help or not, time will tell. Prodigal looks up to find that he has stopped in front of a tavern. Feeling like he could use a seat and a decent drink, although nothing the tavernkeep would be willing to serve would fully sate the thirst he developed after using his power. He vowed to keep himself in check, this time.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will be cranking ten (10) personal motes into Occult Essence Overwhelming in order to get ten (10) more dice on the Intelligence + Occult roll that I will be doing in an attempt to see if I can gain any information on what kind of undead creature would be in the area or what specific legendary creature could be in the area. I am going to assume a one (1) die stunt.<br /> <br /> So this gives me Intelligence (5) + Occult (5) + Excellency (10) + Stunt (1) = Twenty one (21) dice = <a href=\"http://&#91;URL=http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=M2XYWMWB]101(21d10) = 101&#91;/URL]\" target=\"_blank\">Eight Successes</a> You will have to forgive me not rolling the stunt die separately. I still have to get used to this other dice roller. Should my stunt be denied we can drop the successes down to six. Also, I have taken the liberty of going to and entering the tavern where the others are as I figured that it would be better to have the group together. Since I have used ten (10) personal essence, this leaves me with four (4) personal in my pool. Should I be granted the stunt, I will add the motes to that pool to bring it up to six (6) motes.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T08:29:34-07:00","id":439955,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Thank you Orca a good drink will be more than welcome I don't think I will ever get use to this cold.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Unrestraind lover will follow Zarah to Joachim's table, his scarf once again covering most of his face to avoid trouble he would need to upgrade himself to be more subtle in the future. Hearing Zarah talk about Reinhanz spark his interest.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Indeed I myself want to know more about the wildlife of this place it will be quite a boon to my knowledge to test my weapons design against such creatures.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T11:55:23-07:00","id":440239,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;The Labyrinth's wildlife? You underestimate it if you mention it so ca--&quot; Zan says, as silence overtakes the bar. A ululating roar erupts from the woods, and a thud smashes into the wall. Something red streaks down the window and most of the bar looks at Zarah before continuing what they were doing.<br /> <br /> &quot;-sually. Like his name. He is Re***hanz,&quot; Zan says, saying each asterisk clearly, and pulling out a small red book,&quot; Book, Re***hanz, King of Hoof.&quot;<br /> <br /> The book opens on its own accord, and a small specter akin to the one in Lukas' book appears.<br /> <br /> &quot;Tactical Manual of Supernatural Threats to Creation. Reinhanz, King of Hoof? Processing. <br /> <br /> &quot;<i>In the days before Man, there existed great beasts, descendants of The Mountain and the Beast Upon It. Of these, stood one whose gait stomped out the life of river and mountain, who feasted on both plant and those who lived off them. He beget all hoofed animals, from the smallest Humba to the mighty Andrewsarchus. All are his children. The Primordial War was viewed by him as &quot;Bad Hunting,&quot; and he has withstood the test of time with patience. Do not engage if possible. Class-DeciKukla level threat to Creation,&quot; </i>the sprite said succinctly<i>,&quot; Anything else?</i>&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, thank you for the drink, I need that,&quot; Zan says to Orca, downing it in one pull,&quot; Th' name's Polestar Zan by the b. Do you know each other?&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T12:11:14-07:00","id":440276,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The fishwife nods, and runs off, as Nergui follows her. On the opposite end of the plaza is a cottage with a pole with a spiraling red striped down the side. Inside is a man with impressive mutton chops, watery eyes and rather thick glasses. Upon seeing the Steward and the ill man in his grasp, the doctor sighs, and wipes his glasses. <br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, another one? I'm not sure what to do. My grandfather and my father tried to heal it, but nothing works. We can slow down its spread, but it doesn't ultimately cure it. It seems like the disease is the victim's flesh shaping itself into the plants. Gruesome and effective at killing. I think I have some of the salves that slow it down, though. Do you want to try?&quot; he asks, with a resigned look.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T13:56:50-07:00","id":440441,"title":"","content":"&quot;By the Ocean Father, does everyone have one of these books? I want one.&quot; Orca says, taking a seat at the table with Joachim, Zarah and Zan, putting his boots up on the table. &quot;The name is Orca. Just hopped off the airship earlier today.&quot; He looks over at the red-smeared window, then back at the group, &quot;Should.....we be concerned about that?&quot; He asks before drinking from his own mug, &quot;Or is raining corpses just another weather phenomenon here in the North?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:12:27-07:00","id":440459,"title":"","content":"(Prodigal)<br /> <br /> Your thoguht processes whirr in your head as you seek out your quarry. As the crowd jostles around you, and you see Zadro slink into a nearby teahouse, you soldier on. Clearly, this town's history of death and suffering would be enough to cause such a reaction. After all, it probably has some link to the Underworld, now, right?<br /> <br /> Or maybe it's those blokes over there.<br /> <br /> Bedecked in rime-frosted furs and with turbans made of seal leather, five newcomers trudge into the plaza out of the front gate. Steam wafts off them as the heat from the Labyrinth melts the ice off their cloaks. One drops their scarves to reveal a death-grin of white teeth and nary an inch of flesh in sight. The fellow lets out a frozen breath, and continues on with his fellows. They all exude an aura of unpleasantness that jangles your nerves unpleasantly, but also feels pleasant to your starved chakras. <br /> <br /> Then, a corpse lands, hitting a wall of a public house nearby. Today is surely a time of wonders.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:17:51-07:00","id":440462,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> &quot;Third coil? Mela is the Elemental Dragon of Air, but to be connected to her. Are you her servant or vassal? If so, then I am equally blessed to meet a fellow scholar of such renown,&quot; Sala says, straightening up,&quot; Oh, my scrolls&gt; I inherited these from a beloved ancestor some time ago, along with a sizable tract of land near here. Maybe you would like to see it sometime?&quot;<br /> <br /> with this, a trio of men in furs and silks, each bearing an iron badge embalzoned with a crown sit down at a table nearby. They mutter to one another in hushed tones, until a pale, elegant man in similar dress appears. He scowls at them and barks orders.<br /> <br /> &quot;Think you could just up and leave, eh? Back to work! Our quota isn't even close to being complete, you lazy louts!&quot; he growls, sitting down and ordering some tea.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:25:51-07:00","id":440465,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh? There was another of these books that you saw? I had no idea that one of my family was here. I'd like to think they'd stop by and tell me so, if that is the case,&quot; Zan says, visibly troubled, &quot;Because there are only about twenty five of these manuals in existence. I gained mine from my Great-Uncle, who in turn, was given it by his Sifu at the dawn of this dark era, the Exemplary Puma. Also, no, this rain is unusual, even here for this place. I think you might've done something to trouble the beasts of the Labyrinth, young lady,&quot; Zan tells Zarah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:27:29-07:00","id":440468,"title":"","content":"Zarah's face pales after the bloody...whatever...hits the window. For a moment, she was wistful for her little office on Peleps Estate. The only liquids split there were ink and tea. She closes her eyes and composes herself. In addition to the cold, she will have to get use to rotting dead corpses. Zarah did not really wish to return to the Blessed Isle. The Blessed Isle was suffocating. Always worried about being discovered, even before her exaltation by the Unconquered Sun.<br /> <br /> When Orca makes the table an impromptu foot rest, Zarah gives him a stern look. She then moves her wine glass away, in spite of the fact it was in no danger from his dirty boots.<br /> <br /> She leans in closer and asks, &quot;What did I do to cause that? I have heard others speak the name of ... the creature. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:32:02-07:00","id":440473,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=440468#post440468\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Zarah's face pales after the bloody...whatever...hits the window. For a moment, she was wistful for her little office on Peleps Estate. The only liquids split there were ink and tea. She closes her eyes and composes herself. In addition to the cold, she will have to get use to rotting dead corpses. Zarah did not really wish to return to the Blessed Isle. The Blessed Isle was suffocating. Always worried about being discovered, even before her exaltation by the Unconquered Sun.<br /> <br /> When Orca makes the table an impromptu foot rest, Zarah gives him a stern look. She then moves her wine glass away, in spite of the fact it was in no danger from his dirty boots.<br /> <br /> She leans in closer and asks, &quot;What did I do to cause that? I have heard others speak the name of ... the creature. &quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;You stated his name. His true name. It is a thing that people fail to realize, but names carry power. Re***hanz is from a time beyond the dawn of Time, a being that predates Humanity. He is not entirely happy, I'd imagine, and wished it to be known. The others refer to him as &quot;Rehhanz, &quot; a corruption of the term I use. I trust you have not been to the Wyld, then. Otherwise, you'd know this,&quot; Zan says, calling for another drink with a smirk.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T14:38:35-07:00","id":440484,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, we know each other,&quot; Joachim says, introducing Zan to the members of his circle and vice versa, &quot;They're some of those associates I told you about. &quot;<br /> <br /> Joachim hikes his thumb at Zan, &quot;He killed the beast's kid, and said it took him almost three days, even though he has the Dragon's blood. I think this beastie's just a tad out of my league. I'd want to take down one of it's kids before even thinking about aiming for it.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/155-noodle","name":"Noodle","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1415"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T15:24:35-07:00","id":440519,"title":"","content":"&quot;Interesting...&quot; How had Zarah known the creature's true name?<br /> <br /> &quot;Zan, has something changed recently? From what your book told us, Rehhanz, &quot; she was careful to use the pseudonym, &quot;has been around for a long time. Is he new to the Labyrinth? Has something made him more aggressive?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T19:57:32-07:00","id":440807,"title":"","content":"&quot;So out in the Labyrinth are ancient monsters from the beginning of time and their kids? Sounds like a fun time.&quot; Orca says, finishing off his drink in one gulp. &quot;I'm guessing Xa Borugo and Yrmanaea are also terrifying ancient monsters hidden somewhere out there?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T21:30:13-07:00","id":440861,"title":"","content":"Taking a seat at the table not touching his drink yet Unrestrained Lover listened to Orca and Zan speak about the beast of the labyrinth.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Then I guess you would like what I have to offer Mr. Zan I assume that these creature are hard to kill and you could use better weapon to hunt them down do you not ?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-14-2015, 12:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-14T07:53:01-07:00","id":441299,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=440462#post440462\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> &quot;Third coil? Mela is the Elemental Dragon of Air, but to be connected to her. Are you her servant or vassal? If so, then I am equally blessed to meet a fellow scholar of such renown,&quot; Sala says, straightening up,&quot; Oh, my scrolls&gt; I inherited these from a beloved ancestor some time ago, along with a sizable tract of land near here. Maybe you would like to see it sometime?&quot;<br /> <br /> with this, a trio of men in furs and silks, each bearing an iron badge embalzoned with a crown sit down at a table nearby. They mutter to one another in hushed tones, until a pale, elegant man in similar dress appears. He scowls at them and barks orders.<br /> <br /> &quot;Think you could just up and leave, eh? Back to work! Our quota isn't even close to being complete, you lazy louts!&quot; he growls, sitting down and ordering some tea.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;All our kind are connected to the Great Elemental Dragons, as their descendents.&quot; Xisa replied. &quot;As for being her vassal or servant-&quot;<br /> She took a moment to eye the strange men before going back to Sala.<br /> &quot;Now what could that all been about?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T08:48:48-07:00","id":442596,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=440276#post440276\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Nergui)<br /> <br /> The fishwife nods, and runs off, as Nergui follows her. On the opposite end of the plaza is a cottage with a pole with a spiraling red striped down the side. Inside is a man with impressive mutton chops, watery eyes and rather thick glasses. Upon seeing the Steward and the ill man in his grasp, the doctor sighs, and wipes his glasses.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, another one? I'm not sure what to do. My grandfather and my father tried to heal it, but nothing works. We can slow down its spread, but it doesn't ultimately cure it. It seems like the disease is the victim's flesh shaping itself into the plants. Gruesome and effective at killing. I think I have some of the salves that slow it down, though. Do you want to try?&quot; he asks, with a resigned look.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Yes.&quot; Nergui nodded. &quot;There is no crime in failure, Healer. Death comes to all.&quot; He smiled gently at the healer as he found a cot away from other patients and gingerly lowered the man onto it. &quot;Slowing Saturn is all any of us can hope to do. The only crime is not trying.&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-15T19:17:40-07:00","id":443548,"title":"","content":"Marian gives the body that slams into the pub the same amount of dispassionate interest he would a dead animal found in the road. This is not to say that he doesn't find it interesting, and he belies this part of his reaction to it when he strides purposefully over to it in order to inspect it. He analyzes it the same way one would an interesting new tome. The Daybreak turns it this way and that in an attempt to determine what it died of and if he could identify it at all. Perhaps more to the point, would he have a new hungry ghost to deal with soon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-16T21:48:10-07:00","id":445351,"title":"","content":"Smiling a secret smile Merciful leaned in close to Ironsong, as though to discuss something over the bustle of the crowd.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe treasures of the Labyrinth are not all of jade and treasures. There are secrets of alchemical-smithcraft to smelt tin from river rock until it is more common than copper, and to forge iron into steel as easily as pouring lead. I have seen it done, I know where the spells are graven and the forges wait. Trinkets make men wealthy, such secrets as this make them gods. You cannot take advantage of such things alone, the facilities and material required are too great. Yet the great family who backs my efforts has allowed me certain\u2026 discretion.\u201d The last word was half a promise of wealth and half a promise of something else.<br /> <br /> \u201cI need someone skilled in metalwork to oversee and direct this, someone who knows the area, someone with the talent to turn an opportunity into a reality. I think you are that someone. You would need to expand quickly, get more suppliers and increase what they bring, and expand your workforce, perhaps with your erstwhile competitors. I can help\u2026 if you\u2019re willing.\u201d<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Manipulation + Presence roll to convince him. My effective appearance is 8.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5492/view\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.rpnation.com/styles/rpnlogo12.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5492/view\" target=\"_blank\"> Oops! We ran into some problems. </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5492/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.rpnation.com/dice/5492/view </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 4 successes<br /> <br /> If he agrees, activate VEE to grant him a dot of Bureaucracy. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T18:15:21-07:00","id":446832,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;I hear that something has changed in the deeper parts of the Labyrinth. There are paths of flashing lights, new rivers appeared out of nowhere, and entire sections of bush have shifted position or disappeared. Some great upheaval is occurring, but I can't really say what it is,&quot; Zan shrugs, as the book's sprite adjusts itself and coughs, speakign once more.<br /> <br /> &quot;Xa Borugo, He who Dwells in Filth, the Toad Lord. He first appeared in the swamps of Metagaos, and has dwelt in the muck of bogs ever since. Not much is known of the Toad Lord, albeit, he apparently has a greater wisdom than one usually attributes to his kind. The other, Yrmanaea, the Serpent-Maiden, Storm-shepherd of Dreams, was created by Oramus to patrol the Celestial Vault. She befriended the Comet Maiden, and the two became fast friends. When the Comet Maiden died during the Primordial War, it is said that the Cloud of Dreams waits for her friend, even now. She appears in the sky as part cloud, part serpent, and part woman. Do not think on her too long at you, or she will devour portions of your hopes and dreams. Both are .4 DeciKukla-level threats to Creation,&quot; she says primly.<br /> <br /> Zan arches his brow at the Lover's suggestion, but folds his arms,&quot; I trust you have a proposition in mind, erm...Mr. Automaton?&quot; he asks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T18:19:02-07:00","id":446834,"title":"","content":"(Xisa) <br /> <br /> &quot;That is Zadro, not an entirely pleasant man. I understand he's some sort of enforcer for a rather shady bunch. I could not tell you much more, sadly. Interesting, though! We are all connected to the Dragons. That is true in a way! Oh, how I find you interesting! Dafar and the others aren't like you, Miss Ledaal! Oh, no, no, no, no!&quot; Sala says, her face crinkling up in sheer glee, even as she tells you about Zadro's unsavory doings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T18:32:12-07:00","id":446840,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> Adelheid nods, and wipes his head. Going to a cabinet on the side of the room, he returns with several vials of liquid. Opening them in order, they all possess pungent earhty odors that bring tears to the eyes. He pours one into the man's mouth, another is applied to the skin, and the other is daubed on the man's forehead. Adelheid mutters a chant, and while most of it is unintelligible, Nergui catches, &quot; Breath suffuse you,&quot; and ,&quot; Under the Blue Road.&quot;<br /> <br /> After wiping his brow once more and sighing, Adelheid returns, and says,&quot; That will hold him for a time longer, but this is just a temporary solution. Eventually, his flesh is going to overcome it and choke out his life with these vines. You can go now, sir, if you;d like. The salves ought to stay it for a few days, but after that, things will return to the way he was; dying. I must confess, though, sir, that I find your attitude refreshing. Most others would have left him to die. You, however, fought for him. That means a lot, especially in this town. I must know....Are you a god? Only one of the Ennead would have acted so,&quot; he says nervously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T18:38:20-07:00","id":446845,"title":"","content":"(Prodigal Marian)<br /> <br /> The cause of death was simple: the back half of the animal in question was missing. What it was, though, was another kettle of fish entirely. It was about the size of a dog, with fuzzy feathers, and a small, beady eyes. A beak suggested it being a bird, but the one attached limb had a hoof at the end of its limb. Curious.<br /> <br /> On the body, though, was a message in Old Realm who had a definite anachronistic twang to it. Not the harsh syllables of Malfeas or the flowy script of Heaven. No, this is clear, concise and almost blocky.<br /> <br /> &quot;I have been called. You forget. I will feast on your bones in one moon's passing. THE KING OF HOOF,&quot; it reads.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-17T19:39:49-07:00","id":446918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=446832#post446832\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;I hear that something has changed in the deeper parts of the Labyrinth. There are paths of flashing lights, new rivers appeared out of nowhere, and entire sections of bush have shifted position or disappeared. Some great upheaval is occurring, but I can't really say what it is,&quot; Zan shrugs, as the book's sprite adjusts itself and coughs, speakign once more.<br /> <br /> &quot;Xa Borugo, He who Dwells in Filth, the Toad Lord. He first appeared in the swamps of Metagaos, and has dwelt in the muck of bogs ever since. Not much is known of the Toad Lord, albeit, he apparently has a greater wisdom than one usually attributes to his kind. The other, Yrmanaea, the Serpent-Maiden, Storm-shepherd of Dreams, was created by Oramus to patrol the Celestial Vault. She befriended the Comet Maiden, and the two became fast friends. When the Comet Maiden died during the Primordial War, it is said that the Cloud of Dreams waits for her friend, even now. She appears in the sky as part cloud, part serpent, and part woman. Do not think on her too long at you, or she will devour portions of your hopes and dreams. Both are .4 DeciKukla-level threats to Creation,&quot; she says primly.<br /> <br /> Zan arches his brow at the Lover's suggestion, but folds his arms,&quot; I trust you have a proposition in mind, erm...Mr. Automaton?&quot; he asks.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unrestrained Lover chuckle at the mention of automaton yet the tone of his voice remain calm even amused a bit.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Please call me Eisen, I do have a proposal in mind you are a sharp one Mr. Zan. My companion and I wish to explore the labyrinth, we require a guide and you seem to be the one for the job in exchange for your expertise and time I will arm you and your hunting companion with advanced weapons and gear some will be simply mechanical but other can be much more powerful and if you ask how powerful well... You can see for yourself.</span><br /> <br /> True to his word unrestrained Lover lift his right arm puling back his sleeve to reveal the bronze like flesh of his forearm covered in intricate motonic circuits and metal plates. Before anyone can say anything his arm split open into four parts revealing the turning gears and piston inside it, his hand is pulled inside as the four part of his forearm extend other metal plates to connect to one another creating a large cylinder from which a cannon barrel extend instead of a hand. Taking aim at a lonely chair in the tavern a few yards away from their table the cannon begins to rotate becoming faster until it turn at several rotation per second before spitting a fiery ball of blue plasma in a thunderous boom that desintegrate most of the chair as steam vents from small tubes near his elbow before his arm retake it's original appearance. (Unrestrained Lover spends 6 motes of personnal essence: 5 to deploy the pulse cannon and one to fire)<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Is that enough to impress you ?&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-17-2015, 10:44 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T06:27:51-07:00","id":447619,"title":"","content":"Nergui grinned a little sheepishly.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am not a god, I just carry the moon on my head...tell me, Healer Adelheid, is this illness common here? Where does it come from?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T10:45:07-07:00","id":447949,"title":"","content":"Zarah grinned when she saw The Unrestrained Lover\u2019s demonstration. \u201cThat was wonderful!\u201d she exclaimed. <br /> <br /> Sipping her wine, she observed Zan after the demonstration. Even before her exaltation, she distrusted Dragon bloods. <i>The Pelpes destroyed everything my family took generations to build and they probably don\u2019t even remember our name.</i> <br /> <br /> <i>No, I need to stop thinking like that</i>. This man has never set foot on the Blessed Isle and has not been raised since birth in the Immaculate Order. The Dynasts would either send him off to the legions or the monks, if he dared claimed his birthright. <br /> <br /> <i>We do need a guide, at least until Joachim and the rest of us learn our way around the Labyrinth. </i><br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T17:51:23-07:00","id":448538,"title":"","content":"&quot; .4 Deci-what?&quot; Orca says as he takes his boots off the table, leaning in towards the book sprite. &quot;What the hell is it talking about? All I need to know is how to keep these monsters from stopping me as I explore the....&quot; He trails off as he watches The Unrestrained Lover's display.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, sink me to the depths....&quot; He says, tilting his hat back, &quot;That's a bit more fancy than a flame piece. Does your other arm dispense wine?&quot; He chuckles, taking a mental note to examine his new friend's &quot;toys&quot; a bit later.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T17:59:38-07:00","id":448542,"title":"","content":"(Plaza)<br /> <br /> Master Ironsong stares at Merciful for what seems like eons, but then slowly nods his head. <br /> <br /> &quot;Whatever I can do to assist, you only need say, Misstress,&quot; he says with a bow. The rest of the crows continues to press towards Merciful, ever hungry for his attention. He has them in his snare now, but especially master Ironsong, who took his bait willingly. <br /> <br /> However, while the rich tread on one another for Merciful's attentions, a growing crowd of the workers and yeomen start talking of another, new messiah. <br /> <br /> All the while, Marian continues his investigator routine, oblivious to the hubbub around him.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T18:07:04-07:00","id":448548,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> Zan looks on as the Lover destroys a perfectly good chair, as the bartender looks on in horror at the destruction of his property. When the weapon returned to its position, Zan chuckles.<br /> <br /> &quot;I took you all as extraordinary, but a magitech man. What wonders. Very well, Mr. Eisen, we have an accord,&quot; he says, extending his hand. <br /> <br /> &quot;Deci-Kukla. As per the Ochre Foundation's <i>Statute Against Anti-Creation Weaponry</i> due to the emergence and proliferation of Kerred'r Harmonicas in the wake of the Saigoth-Azorn Immolation, the metric of Kukla, named for the God of the Apocalyptic End of Creation, was coined in order to codify and instate limits on what weaponry the Chosen were allowed to bring to bear. This metric indicates the threat that a given entity or object has to destroying Creation, with 1 Kukla being a total eradication of all animal life, and 10 being the complete reversal of existence,&quot; the book-sprite states to no one in particular.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T18:10:57-07:00","id":448552,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> &quot;T-the disease? No one knows. Some say it's the Forest Folk, a nasty, brutish group of mosnters who live in the Deep Woods, near the Beesee Sen Towers, and have the aid of several ancient and evil forest spirits. They're secretive, but anyone who goes near them gets the disease. But...Moon on your head,&quot; the doctor says, his eyes widening and he falls to the floor. <br /> <br /> &quot;Is it true? The Stewards of Luna...They do exist?&quot; he says, looking on at the hulking form before him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:20:41-07:00","id":448737,"title":"","content":"It would appear that the message left in the carcass was meant for someone currently in the tavern. With that thought, the Prodigal of Ashen Remorse stands and purposely strides into the tavern. He takes in the smoldering remains of the chair and looks to those he remembers from the ship in. The Daybreak registers their new compatriot with a nod and gestures with his staff toward the smear on the window.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I take it you are all aware of the carcass that hit the wall?&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">His voice sounds not so much steeped in entropy as it does a voice that is straining to remain a living voice against an overwhelming tide of underworld pressure. </span>&quot;Apparently it is a message for the one who has called one known as the King of Hoof. He comes to eat your bones in the passing of one moon. I would be wary, whoever you are...&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">With that, he will pause and look expectantly around the common room. His intent is to ensure that the message sent by the King was received by its intended recipient.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:23:21-07:00","id":448741,"title":"","content":"Zarah heads over to the bartender and apologizes for the chair. She passes the man some coin and then sits back down at the table. Apparently, patrons destroying furniture was not as common in the North as it was in the Imperial City. <br /> <br /> &quot;&quot;Mr. Zan, what can you tell us about prepare for the Emerald Labyrinth? What is a good size group to go into the Labyrinth? What sort of gear will we need to bring? Are there any specialists we will need to hire? &quot; Zarah was already mentally creating list on what was needed to prepare for the trip.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T20:26:21-07:00","id":448745,"title":"","content":"And her mental listing came to a crashing halt when she heard the message. Very slowly, Zarah stood up from the table. She paused for a moment, trying to regain her composure and went over to the Prodigal of Ashen Remorse. She quietly asked, &quot;Can I see this message?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-18-2015, 11:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-18T23:48:39-07:00","id":448890,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well, if I'm understanding this correctly,&quot; Orca says as he takes another mug from a passing barmaid, &quot;None of the monsters in the Labyrinth have the capability to destroy Creation, not even the King of Hoof.&quot; He smirks, raising his mug, &quot;Here's to the Incarnae blessing us with small miracles.&quot; He says sarcastically.<br /> <br /> In mid-drink, Orca turns to see the man who had entered the tavern. He had met Prodigal before on the <i>Dancing Pelican</i>, and even then his presence had sent chills down his spine. Something about the man reminded him of his Second Breath nearly a year ago, when the ship he served on was attacked by the dreaded Ebon Siaka. The man's voice, presence, everything about him seemed to be a wellspring of the eerie energy that had become commonplace in Skullstone. Orca fought the urge to ready his flame pieces, smiling and raising his new mug to Prodigal.<br /> <br /> &quot;You sure that the corpse that hit the tavern wasn't you, friend?&quot; Orca asked in an almost-too-casual tone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 03-20-2015, 02:31 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T06:41:56-07:00","id":449125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=448548#post448548\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Tavern)<br /> <br /> Zan looks on as the Lover destroys a perfectly good chair, as the bartender looks on in horror at the destruction of his property. When the weapon returned to its position, Zan chuckles.<br /> <br /> &quot;I took you all as extraordinary, but a magitech man. What wonders. Very well, Mr. Eisen, we have an accord,&quot; he says, extending his hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;Deci-Kukla. As per the Ochre Foundation's <i>Statute Against Anti-Creation Weaponry</i> due to the emergence and proliferation of Kerred'r Harmonicas in the wake of the Saigoth-Azorn Immolation, the metric of Kukla, named for the God of the Apocalyptic End of Creation, was coined in order to codify and instate limits on what weaponry the Chosen were allowed to bring to bear. This metric indicates the threat that a given entity or object has to destroying Creation, with 1 Kukla being a total eradication of all animal life, and 10 being the complete reversal of existence,&quot; the book-sprite states to no one in particular.</div> </div> </div> </div>Unrestrained Lover extend his own hand to seal the deal with a smile.<br /> <br /> &quot;Indeed we do come see at mid day tomorrow I will show you the weapons I spoke about. It will not be like mine, I am afraid that making you these type of weapons will require more time and exotic components that I do not have along with a great amount of money and trust in you on my part.&quot;<br /> <br /> Yet as he was about to ask his comrade for a more private conversation the stranger with an eerie presence reminded him of the void back home which is not a pleasant feeling. Seeing Orca reach into his coat made Unrestrained Lover tense up a bit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 03-19-2015, 07:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-19T07:03:47-07:00","id":449171,"title":"","content":"Nergui bent over and extended a hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;You fell down. Are you alright?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T16:41:35-07:00","id":450992,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> As Sala mentions all about the pale man in the corner, another pale man enters the teahouse in a blast of wind. <br /> <br /> Tall, powerful, and in similar obsidian armor to the kind that Zadro is wearing, the man's thin frame is overshadowed by the massive black blade he is hefting on his back, just as black as his mane of hair, which seems to have its own thoughts about things like &quot;Gravity.&quot; <br /> <br /> &quot;So, this is where you are. You're a hard man to track down. Have you managed to locate him?&quot; the newcomer asks, as Zadro looks on coolly. <br /> <br /> &quot;So, she gave you one of those. I can't imagine my mistress being this generous. I haven't tracked him down, but I have narrowed him down to being in this region. I have also dispatched Kwei to look into it. Relax, sit, sit,&quot; Zadro says, patting a chair.<br /> <br /> &quot;Relax? Relax? Do you know how many people I've double-crossed to get here? How many favors and how much kowtowing I had to do to get this?&quot; He growls, scowling, before sitting down.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fine, but I want something strong,&quot; the man says,&quot; Nothing less for the Emissary,&quot; he tells to the waitress.<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T17:25:40-07:00","id":451098,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, you're going to need less clothing than you'd imagine: the Labyrinth is much warmer than the surrounding Tundra. It's more akin to my home in Coral, where I grew up. You'll need a lot of food, though. Something cheap, filling and lightweight. Pemmican or nuts are always good. I don't reccomend hunting, not yet, anyways. You all don't know what's edible and what's not, yet. You'll also need some tools to clear out the brush and collect samples, if you'd wish,&quot; Zan says, before turning to the Lover.<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, no worries, Mr. Eisen. I am curious, though, to see if you could make some power armor. I'd like to show off to my sister. That would be glorious,&quot; he says, smirking mischievously. However, as Prodigal enters, he narrows his eyes once more, and assumes an open stance.<br /> <br /> &quot;May I help you, sir?&quot; he asks the Deathknight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T17:29:52-07:00","id":451101,"title":"","content":"(Clinic)<br /> <br /> &quot;Oh, oh, thank you,&quot; Adelheid says,returning to his feet,&quot; I've decided. I shall find a way to cure this man. If you would assist me, sir, then we can ensure that others do not suffer from it!&quot; he says with firm resolution.<br /> <br /> &quot;My grandfather left me notes on his research. I will have to look them over. If you'd like, you may asist, sir. However, I must thank you. You've given me hope, something I, as a doctor, may have forgotten,&quot; he says, bowing.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-20T20:37:47-07:00","id":451254,"title":"","content":"The Prodigal will first address the humor that seems to pass him by, <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;As I still have my lower half, and do not have an ominous message carved into my hide I would say I am not the carcass that hit the wall.&quot; </span>A slight smirk appears on his face for a brief instant before he turns to Zan.<br /> <br /> He will appraise the man before him and nod respectfully. The Daybreak doesn't wish to cause a scuffle in this public house. Besides, Marian wasn't all that good in a fight. <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;Good Sir, unless you are the one that called the Hoofed monarch, I won't trouble you.&quot; </span>The Deathknight determines that the man should be appeased with that answer.<br /> <br /> Finally, he will address Zarah, <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I can certainly take you to see the message. It was left in the carcass of a most interesting creature. It seems to be a mix of a bird and a hoofed quadraped.&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">With that he will start for the door again. He doesn't wait to see if Zarah or anyone else will follow, he just decides that anyone that is interested will come and if they aren't, they won't. It's that simple. Besides, those gentlemen that gave off the aura of death could not have gone far...</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T00:29:47-07:00","id":451356,"title":"","content":"Orca shakes his head at the Abyssal before quickly turning towards his companions, &quot;Well, the way I see it, we have a month to explore the Labyrinth, find the King of Hoof and convince the beast to leave you alone one way or the other.&quot; He finishes off his mug in one gulp, &quot;Hell, I've worked with worse deadlines, and I don't leave my mates to their death. Even if they are being hunted by a beast older than mankind itself.&quot; With that, he stands up, flourishing his captain's jacket a bit and adjusting his hat, &quot;I'm gonna need my supplies off the ship, but I intend to be ready to go out there within the week.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Can we assume that since Orca has Resources 4, he has all the supplies to set up a decent alchemy lab in Zarah's warehouse? I know it costs money for such a lab, but I can't imagine it being more expensive than Resources 4. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T07:40:46-07:00","id":451508,"title":"","content":"Zarah smiles at Orca and says &quot;Thank you. It's good to not being alone anymore and have people you can depend on.&quot; Zarah found herself fortunate that she ran into both Orca and the Unrestrained Lover. <br /> <br /> Then Zarah follows Prodigal outside and looks over the message on the corpse. Her fear has lessened any nausea at the state of the corpse. <i>So it understand a language.... Hopefully, that means it is a reasonable being. </i><br /> <br /> \u201cDoes anyone have a bag?\u201d She tries to pick up the corpse, but it is too heavy. It feels more like meat than a living creature. Meat is something Zarah can deal with.<br /> <br /> <i>When in the North, do what the natives do.</i> Zarah thinks of the bloody copy of the Divination book. She was very far away from ink and tea leaves. It was time to accept that and get her hands dirty.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-21-2015, 11:07 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T10:11:57-07:00","id":451670,"title":"","content":"Unrestrained Lover smiles at Zen question about power armor but keep an eye on Prodigal they have not spoken often aboard the airship. Learning everything he could about te ship was enough to keep him occupied.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Of course I can but that is expensive and since my friend received a treat against her life I will make her one first should you provide with the material or a suitable payment I can build you one but first I need to construct myself a laboratory to build it. Now if you will excuse me I have other matter to attend to.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> Leaving the table to meet up with Zarah outside Unrestraind lover take in the corpes before gently touching Zarah shoulder to get her attention without startling her.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;We do not have much time Zarah I will head back to the warehouse to get things in order there before setting up a temporary workshop. I will need steel, a lot of it along with glass for now. We need to move fast if we are to be prepared for the Labyrinth.&quot;</span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T11:42:40-07:00","id":451831,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, of course. Steel and glass. How much of each do you need? Is there anything that you need, Orca? &quot; Her hand shakes as Zarah pulls out a pad of paper and makes note of all the items she needs to acquire for both of her companions. As she continues making her list, she seems to calm down. Being pulled back to her familiar world of commerce seems to steady Zarah. She is unsure how long it will take to acquire such items, but the sooner she can get started the better. <br /> <br /> Zarah heads back into the tavern to say good bye to both Joachim and Zan. &quot;How can we reach you, Zan?&quot; she asks, as she adds to her list the supplies needed for the expedition. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> Is there a Guild house around? That seems to be the best start to acquire the items needed. If the Guild doesn't have them, then she will hit up the market. Her first priority would be the materials need to repair the warehouse. <br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T12:23:51-07:00","id":451910,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;I will need 200 pounds of steel and 20 pounds of glass, see if you can find some form of explosive substance or toxin, I have a few things in mind that will bring us good business and stack the odds in our favor. For now this will be enough, I must get to work now we will talk about my origins another time.&quot; </span><br /> <br /> And with these words Unrestrained Lover depart for the warehouse his mind burning with rage at the thought that his friend's life was a stake if the creatures of the labyrinth came to claim it they would find the wrath of a chosen of the machine god waiting for them.<br /> <br /> (As soon as he gets to the warehouse Unrestrained Lover will activate incomparable efficiency upgarde for 6 motes of peripheral essence and 1 willpower to speed up his movement to clean the warehouse.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-21T18:46:49-07:00","id":452205,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hope is good.&quot; Nergui nodded. &quot;A plan is better. I'm, um. I'm not much of a healer. I can manage basic splints, maybe a little bit of herb lore at best. I do want to help...you said the Forest Folk are aided by spirits, and people who go near them get the disease? And they're secretive? Hm.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nergui stood and pondered for a moment, silent and imposing as your average mountain.<br /> <br /> The moment grew longer.<br /> <br /> The moment grew slightly awkward.<br /> <br /> The silence continued just long enough to go from slightly awkward to definitely awkward.<br /> <br /> Finally, Nergui cleared his throat. &quot;If I were a forest spirit, and my people were frightened of strangers and outsiders, and prayed to me for protection...I might curse foreigners who invaded their lands or came close to their homes. Probably with forest magic, like with plants or something...magic is hard to heal, too...healer Adelheid, I think I need to go talk to the Forest People, or to the spirits that protect them. If they are just frightened, we can make friends. If they are really evil, I can eat them. Do you know anyone who knows the way to their territory and is very brave?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-22T14:20:11-07:00","id":453146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=450992#post450992\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> As Sala mentions all about the pale man in the corner, another pale man enters the teahouse in a blast of wind.<br /> <br /> Tall, powerful, and in similar obsidian armor to the kind that Zadro is wearing, the man's thin frame is overshadowed by the massive black blade he is hefting on his back, just as black as his mane of hair, which seems to have its own thoughts about things like &quot;Gravity.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;So, this is where you are. You're a hard man to track down. Have you managed to locate him?&quot; the newcomer asks, as Zadro looks on coolly.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, she gave you one of those. I can't imagine my mistress being this generous. I haven't tracked him down, but I have narrowed him down to being in this region. I have also dispatched Kwei to look into it. Relax, sit, sit,&quot; Zadro says, patting a chair.<br /> <br /> &quot;Relax? Relax? Do you know how many people I've double-crossed to get here? How many favors and how much kowtowing I had to do to get this?&quot; He growls, scowling, before sitting down.<br /> <br /> &quot;Fine, but I want something strong,&quot; the man says,&quot; Nothing less for the Emissary,&quot; he tells to the waitress.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>Xisa pinched the bridge of her nose, she had no idea who &quot;the Emissary&quot; was, but nobody who referred to themselves like that could be anything trouble. Seems like she'd wandered into another complicated and dangerous situation again. She sighed and started reading one of Sala's scrolls, keeping an open ear on the two gentlemen. Somehow, though the jokes didn't make her laugh.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:51:18-07:00","id":456503,"title":"","content":"(Tavern)<br /> <br /> &quot;I live in a townhouse near here. If you find a home with white lanterns and a hyacinth planter in the fore, then I live there. of course, if I'm not there, then I'm usually here. Such is life in the Labyrinth,&quot; the Air Dragon shrugs, &quot;If you're looking for raw materials, then the Ironsong family ought to assist you. They run an excellent foundry and glassworks. There's also the Guild offices nearby this tavern, actually. They might have what you are looking for.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Warehouse)<br /> <br /> Very well, then. Roll Int+Investigation there, Magnusar. <br /> <br /> (@Dreamking: That's fine. That seems more than fair, if I remember Oedaneal's writings on such right.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T19:57:42-07:00","id":456506,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> &quot;You're right. Just, this place grinds you down so. I suppose you haven't seen it yet, but trust me, it has a way of testing mens' hearts. I suppose Rudolf the Razor would know. As would Storm Lord Zan. Those two are out right now, but there's also Alma of Asterberg. She's a bit...funny, though. You ought to find her at the Guild offices. She tends to do jobs for them,&quot; Adelheid says,&quot;They would be your best bet for assistance against the Forest Folk.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:29:29-07:00","id":456528,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> As Xisa tries to remain inconspicuous, the Emissary lounges back as the waitress delivers his drink. He then leans in towards her, and whispers to her a good while. She nods, looks towards your table, leaving for the kitchen. She returns a moment later with a steaming cup, presenting it to you.<br /> <br /> &quot;Compliments of the gentlemen with the black sword, and he asked that I say this. &quot;I hope that your oaths don't prevent such a charming girl with such refined tastes from partaking of hot butter-liquour. Regards, the Hateful Emissary of Regret Who (Sigh) Launders the Depredations of Pontifex, Paramour, and Princeps,&quot; Enjoy, Miss,&quot; the waitress says, placing the steaming glass on your table, bowing, and walking off. <br /> <br /> With that, the Emissary turns towards Xisa and winks smugly, before returning to his grumbling at Zadro.<br /> <br /> &quot;My! It seems you have an admirer!&quot; Sala says,&quot; I'm a little jealous. That man looks like he's quite the strong specimen. I wonder if he has a bumps on his skull,&quot; she says, her eyes narrowing as she begins to smile widely. Clearly, Sala has her own..unique tastes. <br /> <br /> (Meanwhile, in a faraway land)<br /> <br /> Five people sat around a table. One, very large, with exquisite robes and brass rings he called 'The Persuader&quot;, another was a fair young man who also had a baby head under his arm, cooing softly, a beastman with the face of an irritable pug dog, the words &quot;BUTCH&quot; tattooed into his forehead, and a man in a golden mask and impeccable robes. The last was a woman with hair the color of roses, robes the color of a cloudy sky, and a long, broad, elegant blade made of what looked like fine steel. <br /> <br /> &quot;Boss, I hearz there's another guy taking your name, yeah?&quot; the large man with the brass rings said in a crisp baritone voice.<br /> &quot;Don't worry, Tiny. It's fine. There is bound to be numerous other Emissaries. Besides, why bother, when we can co-opt him? Find out his price and buy him into our services,&quot; the masked man says, as the others all clap.<br /> &quot;Byoo-tiful, boss, Byoo-tiful,&quot; the young man with the baby head said, as the beastman looks behind him, and begins to growl.<br /> &quot;Oi, boss, y'know those brats from before, yeah? The one brat with the Tyrant lizard and the one boy who looked kinda like a hot girl if you squinted? They're here,&quot; he says.<br /> &quot;Oh? Let them in,&quot; the masked man says, as the woman narrows her eyes and grabs her sword. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-24T20:39:44-07:00","id":456534,"title":"","content":"(Merciful)<br /> <br /> Master Ironsong took the bait hook, line, and sinker. Even thought he'd never recall making such a deal with any devil, he longed for everything that Merciful stood for in his eyes. Wealth. Fame. Prestige. Moving up and beyond from this hellish ghost town. Even as the others clamored for their attention, Merciful's Verdant Empitness Endowment let him see how truly hungry the elite of the artisanry were: Greed, Hunger, Needs, they all were there and on full display. <br /> <br /> However, this triumph was mired by two new discoveries. Several townsfolk, especially of the poorer callings, he could hear speaking of a newcomer who had a pure heart. Some new hero, it seemed. The other was a procession of robed figures. Nothing too out of the ordinary, but when one of them leaned over to a nearby wall and nailed a flyer declaring that a Twenty-Fifth Merciful was wanted by the &quot;Glacial Tyrant of Unfettered Disaster&quot; and that &quot;Cash would be handed over to those who have him alive or a bound ghost,&quot; then things get a little unnerving. Truly, that procession knows more than they're letting on. <br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T14:14:55-07:00","id":457278,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=456506#post456506\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Nergui)<br /> <br /> &quot;You're right. Just, this place grinds you down so. I suppose you haven't seen it yet, but trust me, it has a way of testing mens' hearts. I suppose Rudolf the Razor would know. As would Storm Lord Zan. Those two are out right now, but there's also Alma of Asterberg. She's a bit...funny, though. You ought to find her at the Guild offices. She tends to do jobs for them,&quot; Adelheid says,&quot;They would be your best bet for assistance against the Forest Folk.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Hm. The Guild.&quot; Nergui wrinkled his nose. &quot;They have good noses. Always they show up as soon as there is a carcass to pick...still, best to get to know the shape of them quickly, and one who does jobs for them will know that shape well. Which way are the Guild Offices?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T15:50:44-07:00","id":457374,"title":"","content":"Zarah was going to head over to the Ironsong Foundry first, but as she past the Guildhall, she decided to stop in. A long walk would give her time to think about the death threat and that was something she did not want to dwell on. At least until she had time to put things in motion for the expedition and the warehouse. <br /> <br /> \u201cHello!\u201d she greeted the clerk at the front desk. \u201cMy companions and I are about to embark on an expedition into the Labyrinth and need supplies. Is there someone I can talk to about acquiring the items on my list?\u201d<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> How much time has passed in the game so far? Trying to figure out how much essence Zarah has regenerated (if any).<br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T16:57:21-07:00","id":457440,"title":"","content":"(Nergui)<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, of course. The Guild has its offices near here, by the bazaar. Be careful, though, Steward. They are a mercenary lot, and they'll sell you out if it means they can earn even a few Sesterces. And be careful of Alma. Not only is she a foreigner, they say she was chased out of the Hundred Kingdoms by the Wyld Hunt of the Confederation of Rivers. She is Anathema according to them, and its easy to see why. She is a ruthless slayer, without honor or decorum,&quot; Adelheid says, wiping his glasses nervously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T17:14:48-07:00","id":457481,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> You enter the building without aplomb or gusto, and people are entering, leaving, and milling about in great numbers. There is a person sized statue of a masked figure in robes with a scale and a scroll declaring, &quot;The only true Immaculate Doctrine is the Rule of Silver,&quot; while there are several boards with various parchments tacked on at the far end of the hall. Near these boards are a series of tables, with various heavily armed thugs, bandits and ne'er-do-wells. Out of them, though, the one that stands out the most is an unnaturally pale woman with platinum hair given wide berth by the other mercenaries. Wearing heavy chain and armed with a large jade blade, she is eating a living partridge the way one might normally eat an apple. <br /> <br /> &quot;The guts really are the best part,&quot; she grunts between bites, as her compatriots shudder.<br /> <br /> The clerk, wincing at this, bows to you. <br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, yes. This looks like it can easily be achieved. We will have the cargo transfered to whatever warehouse you wish at once. Now, just sign here, and, of course, how will you pay for this, madam?&quot; the clerk says, handing you several parchments to sign. <br /> <br /> (It is now mid-afternoon. About six or so hours have passed. I don't think any of you have done any heavy work thus far, at least for terms of essence recovery, so, hopefully that helps.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T19:41:43-07:00","id":457638,"title":"","content":"&quot;Thank you for the warning.&quot; Nergui nodded solemnly. &quot;My goddess loves outcasts and exiles, so hopefully we will be able to get along. I will see you again, Healer. Please continue to work toward your own answer to the problem. I may die without bringing you an answer, but the gods favor those who help themselves.&quot;<br /> <br /> With that, Nergui departed and headed back to he bazaar, towards the Guild's local offices. He pressed past the crowd, and he gave the place a wary look before entering. Looming in the doorway, he took in the tables and thugs, as well as the pale woman. He disliked this place instantly. Too much parchment and ink, too many scrolls...and, of course, too many unpleasant looking men with weapons. The place made him nervous. Still...there was at least one friend here, Lin Zarah, which calmed hims lightly.<br /> <br /> He stood straight in the doorway, and in a deep confident voice, he boomed, &quot;I am l-looking for Alma of Ast-ast-ast...t-terberg.&quot;<br /> <br /> ...that didn't come out as deep and confident as he had been going for.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":512,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","user":"Wise Old Guru","date":". 03-25-2015, 10:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-25T20:47:16-07:00","id":457690,"title":"","content":"Marian begins to head in the direction the deathly figures from before had went. They were interesting to him in only a way he was sure he could appreciate. He had to know from where they were from and if they were going to cause him problems. If they were allied with or servants of the bishop, he would have to deal with them quietly. Were they independent he could hope to have allies. On the other hand, were they allied to or servants of another Deathlord, they would then be possibly more complicated to deal with. There was no telling if they would want to eliminate, control, or ally with him, an outcast. Approaching them very carefully would be the only option. It was almost certain they would be able to tell his nature right away. His only hope would be that they didn't know him by reputation and that he could attempt to pass himself off as whatever could be the most beneficial to them until he was able to discern their origins and intent.<br /> <br /> <i>Wait...What is this? </i>the Prodigal thinks to himself as he notices one of the Tyrant's notices promising cash for Merciful. <i>Perhaps I can repay a favor during the duration of my stay here. Of course, if the Tyrant is active here, I might be able to act like I am helping the Bishop while furthering my ultimate goal. </i>With this he steps into the tea house. He can talk with Merciful later. The Daybreak also makes a mental note to chat with Zarah about the possibilities of helping her get an oracle from that carcass. She seemed squeamish about the endeavor. He is not so quick to shy from any source of potential knowledge. Not anymore...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-27T00:33:08-07:00","id":458732,"title":"","content":"Orca had returned to the warehouse and begun to carve out a small area for himself. The dockworkers had already brought his belongings from the <i>Pelican, </i>so it was merely a matter of setting everything where he wanted it. Finding a relatively unoccupied corner, he set up a simple shelf for the few dozen books he brought from the West, a table for his alchemy equipment, a hammock for sleeping and an ornamental shark jaw bone from his quarters on his old ship, the <i>Storm's Saber.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;Well, it's not Plentimon's gambling dens, but I suppose it'll do.&quot; With that, the pirate heads over to his alchemy lab, removing his coat and hanging it up on a peg. &quot;Now, what can a master alchemist whip up for an expedition into one of the most deadly areas in the North.....&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> So to start, I'd like to make an Intelligence+Occult roll (with my Alchemy specialty, of course) to create a supply of Blood Staunching Compress (found in Oadenol's Codex, page 130). I imagine a substance for stopping bleeding would be useful in dangerous wilderness.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4807025/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4807025/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4807025/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4807025/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> If I remember the rules of Thatamurgy correctly, that should be more than enough successes to make Blood-Staunching Compress. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 03-27-2015, 03:48 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-28T10:14:42-07:00","id":460136,"title":"","content":"At Sala's comment, Xisa pinched her nose. Did people commonly have such long and bizarre sounding names up in the North? She'd have to ask Uncle Hayama later. She glanced at the drink This Emissary of Various Things that Start with P had ordered her. She could say for sure it wasn't her Oaths that prevented her from enjoying it. It was the fact that he was a complete stranger, who dressed like that, and ordered random devout women drinks. There was nothing about it that wasn't off putting.<br /> <br /> The glance metamorphosed into a drawn out stare, before she reached for it and took a pretend sip. If it was drugged, he'd try something in a few minutes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-29T13:11:21-07:00","id":461376,"title":"","content":"&quot;Yes, that would fine. If you could deliver it to my warehouse in two days, that would be wonderful.&quot; Zarah knew not to push the pricing when she was new in town. Better to build a relationship with the local guild members and then try to get a discount.<br /> <br /> Upon hearing a familiar voice, she turns around and sees Captain Nergui in the doorway. Apparently, he was looking for someone. Zarah quickly thanked the guild clerk and hurried over to the Lunar in the doorway.<br /> <br /> &quot;Good Afternoon, Captain. Were you looking for someone? Perhaps we can ask the clerk for assistance.&quot; She nods over to the clerk she just left. One does not simply barge into the Guildhall and make a scene if you want good service.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <br /> I'm assuming the Guild isn't going to rip Zarah off, since she had connections. Also, if the supplies are more than 2 or 3 resources, Zarah will have Orca pay for it. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 03-29-2015, 10:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T17:46:39-07:00","id":462892,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> The office grows quiet at Nergui's call, as the pale woman gets up and walks to him. The clerk shrinks behind his desk as she draws near, not heeding Zarah's request, seemingly to avoid the newcomer's ire.<br /> <br /> &quot;I am Alma of Asterberg. What do you want?&quot; she says, sleepily looking the Steward over,&quot; if it's company for the night you want, I charge 35 Sesterces up front, 35 afterwards. I also don't do cuddling, roleplay or pillow talk. If it's someone dead you want, It'll be double that, up front. I'll also need a picture or a scrap of their clothing.&quot;<br /> <br /> Well, what will you say?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T17:58:19-07:00","id":462918,"title":"","content":"(Marian)<br /> <br /> The deathly figures continue their papering trail, some splitting off and entering various public buildings, but soon returning to the group. However, they all stopped in an alleyway on the edge of town. There, a figure with a unhealthy, bluish complexion is waiting. <br /> <br /> &quot;Well? Did you do what I asked?&quot; he demands.<br /> <br /> &quot;Master, huuuuuuuuuuuuuUUuuuuUuunger,&quot; one of them wails, until the blue man kicks them in the leg. It reels back, screeching in an unearthly tone.<br /> <br /> &quot;Shut up, shut up! You can eat later! Did you deliver the flyers?&quot; the man demanded once more, as the others all affirm his question in exaggerated nods and bows. <br /> <br /> 'Good, good,&quot; the man cackles,&quot; The Tyrant cannot deny my usefulness now, and if I deliver her that foolish Deathknight's nemesis, then he'll be sure to come yapping, the wild dog that he is. And that means...That means. I can get a promotion, and...and...ahahahaha! My own soulsteel! My own soulsteel!&quot; he laughs, wringing his hands, an entirely unpleasant expression of manic glee on his face. <br /> <br /> He doesn't seem to have noticed you. What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T18:03:14-07:00","id":462919,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> After a few hours of work, Orca is able to expertly produce a batch of magic compresses, able to relieve injury, all the while the Lover is zipping around, placing boxes, rubbish and various tools into mechanically precise piles. It looks like at this rate, he may have about a quarter of the warehouse cleared and sorted by the end of the day. <br /> <br /> You hear several unearthly screeches, but then the normal hubbub of outside, alongside the whooshing of the Lover.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-30T18:15:00-07:00","id":462945,"title":"","content":"(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The Emissary doesn't seem to notice or even look back at you for some time, content to rant at Zadro, who just rolls his eyes at him, saying nothing.<br /> <br /> &quot;..And he's there, and he has the gall, the AUDACITY, to leave me high and dry! There I am, face down in the mud, me, a noble of the Holy City, and here he is, walks off, without so much as a scratch! It's only thanks to my good luck that the Good Pilgrim is there, and he graces me with this shard of the Black Sun. Still, this is such a dubious honor. I can't stand the Sun's rays now, and I must feed on blood? What sort of life is tha--: he manages before his drink, and indeed, every drink within the teahouse, freezes. <br /> <br /> &quot;Curses upon this! This is what I'm talking about!&quot; the man says, getting up. At that, a robed figure enters, tacks a flyer to the wall, and leaves. The Emissary glances at it, and laughs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is this the extent of the Tyrant's pull?&quot; he asks, as Zadro frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;I wouldn't use that name so lightly, &quot; Zadro growls,&quot; Why bother exerting resources when bounty hunters can achieve the same result? Besides, you aren't our only goal, Emissary.&quot;<br /> <br /> At that, the Emissary scowls and walks towards the door.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm going. I need to kill something to let off some steam. If you want to see me, look in the Forest,&quot; he says, hefting his sword, and walking off, leaving the patrons, Zadro, Sala, and Xisa in silence.<br /> <br /> &quot;That man. He seems troubled. I wonder what sad past this and his friend had?&quot; Sala says, not looking up from her scroll.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-31T00:44:04-07:00","id":463185,"title":"","content":"&quot;Perfect!&quot; Orca says, wrapping the last of the strange paste in a cloth and carefully setting it with the rest of the substance on his table. &quot;We're gonna need to have an edge, so maybe-&quot;<br /> <br /> He freezes, hearing the unearthly moans over the din of the crowd. He gestures for Lover to stop moving around, turning away from the lab he brought with him.<br /> <br /> &quot;Did you hear that?&quot; he asks aloud, &quot;That's the fifth time I've heard that screaming.&quot; He looks over towards Lover, but not before double checking that he had his flame pieces on him, &quot;You don't think this town is haunted, do you?&quot; He looks back at his lab, &quot;I can keep them away, but I don't think I should be wasting my time on Deathlord's Breath considering Miss Zarah's deadline.&quot; He leaves the warehouse through the main door, stepping out into the street to try and find a source of the sound.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Orca is gonna take a listen to try and find the source of the unearthly screams, using Perception+Investigation<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4810610/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4810610/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4810610/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4810610/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Eh, one success is better than nothing. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-01T20:09:05-07:00","id":465541,"title":"","content":"After but a moment's thought and deliberation, Marian will adjust his robe to cover his soulsteel bracers and amulet. He will then step from his place out of sight of the group and announce himself.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I don't mean to intrude, but I noticed the flyers you were placing around Last Chance.&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Deathknight will display the flyer he took from a wall to emphasize the point. </span><span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I am interested in discovering more about this person you are looking for and how one would go about obtaining the reward for it.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">He advances into the group, but not so far that he can't make a hasty exit if needed.</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">Exuding confidence and an air of mystery and danger seemed to be the best way to avoid any difficulties, at least for the immediate future. The Daybreak strode confidently and with purpose. He gave meaningful and deliberate looks at anyone that gave him a look of appraisal. If he was going to convince this group that he would at least be someone they didn't want to mess with, he would have to give them that impression from the start.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T05:53:36-07:00","id":465984,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=462892#post462892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> The office grows quiet at Nergui's call, as the pale woman gets up and walks to him. The clerk shrinks behind his desk as she draws near, not heeding Zarah's request, seemingly to avoid the newcomer's ire.<br /> <br /> &amp;quot;I am Alma of Asterberg. What do you want?&amp;quot; she says, sleepily looking the Steward over,&amp;quot; if it's company for the night you want, I charge 35 Sesterces up front, 35 afterwards. I also don't do cuddling, roleplay or pillow talk. If it's someone dead you want, It'll be double that, up front. I'll also need a picture or a scrap of their clothing.&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Well, what will you say?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Actually, I was planning to hire you to serve as a guide for a trip out to talk to the forest folk. I am told you know the region better than most. I would prefer that you not do any killing unless I ask it of you. I do not need a bodyguard or a hired sword, just a decent navigator who does not fear death or disease or the will of angry gods.&quot;<br /> <br /> Nergui smiled. Guild scum or no, he appreciated directness in people. &quot;I, um. Will take your other offer into consideration.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T06:36:20-07:00","id":466013,"title":"","content":"<i>No, no, no. We are NOT bringing the creepy lady who eat raw birds whole with us.</i> Zan might be a dragonblooded, but he at least seemed sane.<br /> <br /> \u201cCaptain, a moment, if you please.\u201d She takes the Lunar aside. \u201cMy colleagues and I are preparing an expedition into the Labyrinth within the next week. We have already acquired a guide and are stock piling supplies for the trip. We would hoping to have you come with us on the trip. A man of your skills would be quite valuable for the success of the trip. No need to duplicate our efforts and hire two guides when we can share one. \u201c","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T17:17:42-07:00","id":466703,"title":"","content":"&quot;You are kind, friend.&quot; Nergui spoke, smiling, easily loud enough to be within earshot of all. &quot;But I will be traveling to the deep woods near the Beesee Sen Towers, to treat with the forest folk and with their gods. There is a local curse I need to break. Men without the blessings of the gods who come with me may sicken and die miserably, and I cannot see much chance of profit for them to share in. I hope to leave soon, with a small band. A woman who eats animals raw and sells love does not fear disease, and a woman who sells death does not fear spirits. I will leave tomorrow morning, guide or no...it would be earlier, but I have promised a new friend dinner and a night of stories.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T18:14:32-07:00","id":466758,"title":"","content":"&quot;I see... Well, I wish you luck on your venture. &quot; Zarah was disappointed that Nergui would not be coming with them. She did wonder at his insistence on going into the Labyrinth so quickly, with or without a guide. <i>He is a Lunar and more adaptable to whatever dangers the Labyrinth can throw at him</i>, Zarah thought. <br /> <br /> At the mention of dinner, Zarah says &quot;Dinner? Is it already that late? I've been so busy today, I haven't even thought about dinner. &quot; She pretends to consider what to do about dinner tonight. &quot;I doubt the warehouse's stove is in working order... I wonder if there are any cafes near by....&quot; She mumbles to herself.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T21:07:31-07:00","id":466980,"title":"","content":"The hopelessly obvious procession, <i>putting up fliers</i> of all the stupendous idiocy, had to be a trap. Or at the very least a creative way to get rid of undesirables. He could kill them, it wouldn't even be difficult, but that would attract exactly the kind of attention disposable lightning rods were for. After a moment of frustrated contemplation it occurred to him that he couldn't even pluck the few strings that would cause the whole group to collapse. <i>That</i> was exactly the sort of story he didn't want getting back to their master. Although...<br /> <br /> The northern woman smiled a most unpleasant smile, when &quot;she&quot; was certain no one was looking. Once the mask of emotion was back on her face she nodded to master Ironsong and said, &quot;I will be in touch.&quot;<br /> <br /> Out in the market she made her way to the cloth merchant, having already altered the speech she gave the metalworker. Some things stopped being fun if you won too much.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Do you want me to rp all of this, or should I just assume I go them all to believe in the future and agree to support my expedition on credit?</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T15:44:33-07:00","id":467919,"title":"","content":"(Warehouse)<br /> <br /> Orca manages to discern that the noise came from the east. But its proximity beyond that? Not much else can be determined. <br /> <br /> What will you and Lover do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T15:58:25-07:00","id":467926,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> Alma stood like a statue, as Nergui and Zarah conspire together in their own way. When Nergui announces his intentions, Alma breaks out in a great, husky laugh.<br /> <br /> &quot;Such honesty. That is what I can appreciate from this land. You don't mince words. Very well. I will assist you. You're correct, though. I do not fear sickness or spirits. Such things cannot kill me. Not anymore, anyways. It would be wise for you to have fear, though. Where you wish to go is a dangerous place. I would get your affairs in order if I were you.,&quot; she says, hefting her daiklaive.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will meet you at the eastern gates at dawn. Farewell, air captain,&quot; she says, leaving. <br /> <br /> &quot;I will get your order processed posthaste, madam,&quot; the clerk says, returning from his hiding place,&quot; Don't worry about the charge. You and your comrade are getting rid of that woman for us for a few days. That alone ought to drive sales up. Just, erm, don't spread this around. I don't want the Jarl to kick us out for potentially feeding people to that witch,&quot; he says nervously.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:07:54-07:00","id":467933,"title":"","content":"(Merciful)<br /> <br /> (OoC: I'll let you move on, but FYI, Zadro, the cloth merchant left already. He's currently in a nearby teahouse with Xisa, sulking at being seemingly snubbed)<br /> <br /> You manage to ensnare two more merchants, each of their wishes for greater affinity with numbers and better intelligence were easy to fulfill. However, Zadro the Icecrowner, who had just before offered you a gown fit for a princess, was nowhere to be found. His was a powerful wish, one so strong and deep that you are unsure if the law of the Endless Desert could fulfill it, but who's to say that you can't if you don't try?<br /> <br /> You can still feel his emotions bubbling up nearby. He couldn't have gone far.<br /> <br /> Will you pursue him, or will you let him pass for your new allies?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:24:29-07:00","id":467940,"title":"","content":"&quot;Who is she?&quot; Zarah asks the clerk.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:27:58-07:00","id":467945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=462945#post462945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Xisa)<br /> <br /> The Emissary doesn't seem to notice or even look back at you for some time, content to rant at Zadro, who just rolls his eyes at him, saying nothing.<br /> <br /> &quot;..And he's there, and he has the gall, the AUDACITY, to leave me high and dry! There I am, face down in the mud, me, a noble of the Holy City, and here he is, walks off, without so much as a scratch! It's only thanks to my good luck that the Good Pilgrim is there, and he graces me with this shard of the Black Sun. Still, this is such a dubious honor. I can't stand the Sun's rays now, and I must feed on blood? What sort of life is tha--: he manages before his drink, and indeed, every drink within the teahouse, freezes.<br /> <br /> &quot;Curses upon this! This is what I'm talking about!&quot; the man says, getting up. At that, a robed figure enters, tacks a flyer to the wall, and leaves. The Emissary glances at it, and laughs.<br /> <br /> &quot;Is this the extent of the Tyrant's pull?&quot; he asks, as Zadro frowns.<br /> <br /> &quot;I wouldn't use that name so lightly, &quot; Zadro growls,&quot; Why bother exerting resources when bounty hunters can achieve the same result? Besides, you aren't our only goal, Emissary.&quot;<br /> <br /> At that, the Emissary scowls and walks towards the door.<br /> <br /> &quot;I'm going. I need to kill something to let off some steam. If you want to see me, look in the Forest,&quot; he says, hefting his sword, and walking off, leaving the patrons, Zadro, Sala, and Xisa in silence.<br /> <br /> &quot;That man. He seems troubled. I wonder what sad past this and his friend had?&quot; Sala says, not looking up from her scroll.<br /> <br /> What will you do?</div> </div> </div> </div>The cup fell out of Xisa's hands, shattering on the floor, leaving a lump of brown ice.<br /> &quot;An unpleasant one, to be sure.&quot; she said to Sala while trying to make sense of what just happened. She immediately thought it was sorcery and discounted, the scale was wrong, and she had never heard of a working going off <i>by accident</i>. This was something else. Something very <i>wrong</i>.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sala, I haven't been in Last Chance very long, would you happen to know how long those two have been here?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:29:29-07:00","id":467946,"title":"","content":"(Prodigal)<br /> <br /> The man looks at you for a good long while, while his minions pant to one another. They seem to be sniffing the air, even if their diaphragms are not visibly moving. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, yes, hehe, of course,&quot; he says, &quot;The man in question is a native of Whitewall. He has the features of the well-to-do of that city, and was last seen outside, in the Ice. Some say he was in the battle of Zessa Heights. Other say he was outcast from his homeland and still bears the blue kiss of the cold exile he had to bear. I have not been able to divine his movements through the Sky or through...other methods, so I cannot tell you where he is or what his motives are, merely that my Mistress has great...interest in his return. Deliver him alive or as a bound ghost, to the seven pillars five miles west of Last Chance. I believe the natives call that place the Crown of Demons. We will find you, if your search proves fruitful. Is there anything else, erm...I never caught your name, sire. You seem familiar, though, somehow. Are you in the employ of Sijan, perhaps?&quot;<br /> <br /> What will yo usay?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:37:14-07:00","id":467963,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> &quot;i don't know the specifics, but I hear she's from the Hundred Kingdoms, and that she got the Lookshan Wyld Hunt set on her for being what do they call it? An Anathema? She left that area because of them, and I hear she killed one of their Taichou in battle, which is where her blade comes from. She's been on several suicide missions, and out of more than one hundred, she alone survived them all. She's been stabbed, poisoned, and even had her neck broken, and she always gets up. Always. The local foreman tolerates her because she is one of the few who doesn't mind going deep into the forest, but she just gets me scared. Anyone who demands &quot;Living game birds so I can eat their guts,&quot; is a little too much, even for me, and I come from Great Forks. I've seen some strange things,&quot; the clerk says.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T16:41:53-07:00","id":467968,"title":"","content":"(Teahouse)<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize. I'm not sure myself. At least for the handsome one in the obsidian armor. The other is Zadro. He works with the Icecrowners, an unsavory lot who get the pickings of the Labyrinth and pretty it up for the well-to-do of Whitewall, Gethemane, Iceholm and even Halta. He may look like a gentleman, but his heart is an evil thing,&quot; Sala says, putting down her scroll, &quot; I wouldn't recommend pursuing him if I were you.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-04T22:30:24-07:00","id":469177,"title":"","content":"Orca takes another look around the immediate area in front of the warehouse, casually looking over his shoulder. &quot;Well, I suppose a stroll wouldn't hurt me.&quot; He adjusts his coat and pokes his head back into the warehouse. &quot;I'm gonna go for a walk,&quot; he told Lover, &quot;Come on with if you want. I'd love to hear more about this place you're from.&quot; With that, he turns to set off towards the direction he heard the noise come from.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T15:31:53-07:00","id":471744,"title":"","content":"&quot;Are you sure I don't need to pay you for the goods?&quot; Zarah was suspicious about the Guild's sudden bout of generosity. But, if the Guild wanted to give away their goods, that is fine with her. She can use the money for other investments. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I've been waiting for Nergui's response to Zarah's not so subtle hints about a dinner invite. I realize that Wise Old Guru has some real life stuff to take care of, so I'd figure I'd go ahead and post a response to the Guild Clerk. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T17:41:01-07:00","id":471882,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I go by many a name,&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#000000\"> The Daybreak begins. </span><span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;For our purposes 'Ash' will suffice.&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">He almost has to stifle a chuckle.</span> <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I am independent of Sijan or any other realm of Creation. I mostly travel from place to place dealing with unruly spirits. It's not the most glamorous or honored life, but it does have it's rewards.&quot;</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">He pauses as if considering the arrangement, </span><span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;The seven pillars five miles west of Last Chance. Alive or as a bound ghost. Agreed. I will be there and Twenty Fifth Merciful will be with me.&quot;</span><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T08:45:57-07:00","id":474338,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=469177#post469177\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Orca takes another look around the immediate area in front of the warehouse, casually looking over his shoulder. &quot;Well, I suppose a stroll wouldn't hurt me.&quot; He adjusts his coat and pokes his head back into the warehouse. &quot;I'm gonna go for a walk,&quot; he told Lover, &quot;Come on with if you want. I'd love to hear more about this place you're from.&quot; With that, he turns to set off towards the direction he heard the noise come from.</div> </div> </div> </div>It didn't even take a second that Unrestrained Lover already have his coat on and leave with Orca while still being under the influence of his charm.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;Yesitwouldbegoodtoseewhatthelocalfaunaiscapableof beforeleavingforthelabyrinth&quot;<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-family:arial\">The words came out so fast out of his mouth that they sounds like one big word as he walks beside Orca.<br /> <br /> (Dietaku here is the Int+Inves roll </span></span><span style=\"color:#111111\"><span style=\"font-family:Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">1 - 9 - 1 - 7 - 8 - 6 can't seem to find a site like Invisible castle feel free to reroll if you wish</span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:courier new\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">)</span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 04-09-2015, 11:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T21:18:26-07:00","id":475348,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=467968#post467968\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Teahouse)<br /> <br /> &quot;I apologize. I'm not sure myself. At least for the handsome one in the obsidian armor. The other is Zadro. He works with the Icecrowners, an unsavory lot who get the pickings of the Labyrinth and pretty it up for the well-to-do of Whitewall, Gethemane, Iceholm and even Halta. He may look like a gentleman, but his heart is an evil thing,&quot; Sala says, putting down her scroll, &quot; I wouldn't recommend pursuing him if I were you.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;No need to worry about that. These days Romance is the last thing on my-&quot; She heard the wail and gave the bridge of her nose another pinch. &quot;-Sala, you've been most hospitable but I'm afraid I have to take my leave, now. Take care, perhaps we will meet once more.&quot; She said as she scrambled to her feet, gave a quick bow and rushed out of the teahouse, tearing towards the bizarre sound.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T17:19:06-07:00","id":476458,"title":"","content":"&quot;Unusually generous.&quot; Nergui raised an eyebrow at the Guild Clerk. &quot;Not what I expected. Hrm.&quot;<br /> <br /> He paused, as he sometimes did, and thought.<br /> <br /> &quot;Friend Zarah, you are welcome to dine again aboard my ship. I promise no live animals tonight...say, you haven't found a good blacksmith in the area, have you? I want to patch my boiler before we take off again.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T20:57:33-07:00","id":476583,"title":"","content":"Zarah looks pleased and says, &quot;Oh, I don't meant to impose, but we appreciate the offer. What time do you want Orca, the Unrestrained Lover, and I there this evening? Do you want us to bring anything?&quot; Perhaps she can find a place to buy some wine.<br /> <br /> &quot;A blacksmith,&quot; Zarah taps her finger against her lips and thinks. &quot;I was directed to a Foundry here in town, run by the Ironsong Family. There should be blacksmiths there that can help you with your boiler.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I was headed there to acquired materials for renovating the warehouse. If you have time right now, you can accompany me to the Ironsong Foundry. &quot;<br /> <br /> She thinks to the Lover's other request. To acquire materials such as poisons and explosives, she would have to find a less savory merchant. Though such items might be legal to acquire her in the North. Zarah considers asking the guild and decides not too. Better not to risk detection.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-12-2015, 01:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T07:49:42-07:00","id":477918,"title":"","content":"&quot;I do have time.&quot;Nergui nodded. &quot;And I would enjoy your company.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T11:30:14-07:00","id":478140,"title":"","content":"Smiling, Zarah leads the way out of the Guildhall and out into the snowy streets. She shivers as the wind picks up. <i>Thank the dragons that the Labyrinth is warmer than here. </i><br /> <br /> &quot;Why are you in such a rush to head out into the Labyrinth?&quot; she asks, as she adjusts the sleeves of her coat. Zarah's own life was in danger, but she was in no great rush to head out into the Labyrinth unprepared. <i>I promised the boys that I'd set them up in the warehouse. I need to do that before I go court with the King of Hoof.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T11:53:27-07:00","id":478154,"title":"","content":"&quot;There is a disease that is killing people here.&quot; Nergui frowned. &quot;The healers have studied it for generations, but have not found a cure, only ways to ease the pain of passing. It turns the flesh to brackish water and plants sprout as you die. They say it comes from the lands of the Forest Folk. I suspect some spirit or curse is at the root of it. A day wasted may be a life lost, and I have no urgent business over the next few days to keep me from going out.&quot;<br /> <br /> He shrugged.<br /> <br /> &quot;I owe the people of the League a great debt. If I did not help when they were dying, what kind of man would I be?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-12T12:24:33-07:00","id":478223,"title":"","content":"&quot;What kind of man would you be? Probably just like everyone else who would live their little lives without a thought of changing from the way things have always been. Though you are far from a common man, Captain.&quot; Zarah stops in the street and turns to face the Lunar.<br /> <br /> &quot;I know you think me a greedy woman, Captain, but I have other reasons besides profit as to why I need to go out in the Labyrinth and reasons why I can not go soon.&quot; Zarah takes a deep breath. &quot;In my first day here, I am somehow managed to offend one of the great creatures of the Labyrinth. Not only that, but this beast, Rehhanz, has been devastating the local economy, even before our arrival. It is the flow of the resources out of the Emerald Labyrinth that keep this town alive and Rehhanz sends his children to kill any adventures who enter the Labyrinth. &quot;<br /> <br /> Zarah continues with steel in her voice, &quot;This beast will not keep me from my responsibilities. I promised Orca and the Unrestrained Lover that I would help them set up shop here. If my daughter does somehow reach me here, I want there to be something for her here... even if I am no longer in this life &quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I might not live until the end of the month, but I have been living in the shadow of death for the past year. &quot; <i>Why would I expect it to change, </i>Zarah thinks to herself.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will not let this creature cower me into abandoning what I came here to do. And I will not let this creature destroy this town. &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T16:29:22-07:00","id":479603,"title":"","content":"&quot;Hm. A great beast is offended, hm?&quot; Nergui smiled. &quot;I will help you with this once I have helped with this disease. Perhaps the beast can be reasoned with, and if not...well, we apparently have more than one warrior around here who enjoys feasting on raw flesh. I would help you first, friend, but I know you can take care of yourself, and sadly the sick cannot do the same.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-13T20:23:25-07:00","id":479814,"title":"","content":"The idea of the bird eating woman and the Rehhanz facing off brings a smile to Zarah's face. <i>Let's see her eat the King of Hoofs alive. </i> <br /> <br /> &quot;Perhaps we can rendezvous somewhere within the Labyrinth after you are finished with your business,&quot; Zarah said, not really sure how she will accomplish this. &quot;It is not my intention to delay you from your task. If you have an opportunity to cure a terminal disease, then you should take it. &quot; She continues walking down the street, looking for a building that fits the description of the Ironworks. <i>This place desperately needs street names and numbers.</i><br /> <br /> &quot;The beast does read and write. He sent his message via Old Realm. I do hope it is a reasoning creature. Though I suppose I better not refer to him as beast or creature. Though perhaps he likes being called that.&quot;<br /> <br /> Zarah gets a mischievous twinkle in her eye. &quot;Tell me, Captain, how would you think the King of Hoofs holds court? Would he be surrounded by his bleating couriers?&quot; Remembering all the courtiers that inhabited the Imperial Court, she imitates the baa of sheep.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:36:25-07:00","id":480270,"title":"","content":"<br /> (Xisa)<br /> Sala waves to you as you dash off towards the loud noise. You see a crowd gsathering around a sharply dressed young woman, but pay it no mind. Your mission is at hand. You track the disturbance to an alleyway, where a small gathering seems to be happening. Surely, these gentlemen would know what was going on.<br /> <br /> (Prodigal/ Alleyway with the Loud Noise)<br /> <br /> &quot;Ash, eh? Very well, then. Mr. Ash. I look forward to your successful hunt,&quot; the unhealthy-looking man bows, until a whole parade of new characters burst in: A pirate ripped seemingly from the Western Seas, an exotic man seemingly made of gold and iron, and an immaculate monk in the disheveled robes of a mendicant. Prodigal recognizes the pirate and golden man as Orca and the Lover, but the Immaculate is unfamiliar. The unhealthy man looks at you with fear and surprise.<br /> <br /> &quot;What is the meaning of this? Ash, are these people with you?&quot; he asks, as his followers all begin to hoot to one another in wailing voices. <br /> <br /> (@Magnusar: You find a series of books. Some are part of the long-running &quot;Sweet Snake&quot; series that romanticized the Outer Sanctuary Conflicts, a series of bloody wars in the threshold nation of Outer Sanctuary, a notorious hotbed in the Summer Mountains where for over a thousand years, the Anathema Joyous Cobra and her notorious &quot;Kobra Unit&quot; bedeviled the Shogunate with their beastman armies and series of siege striders. Even with Joyous Cobra's death, the place was notorious for revolt, resulting in several other Anathema taking up Cobra's cause. Others are part of the 'Scarlet&quot; series of young adult novels, a retelling of the emergence of the Scarlet Empress as the ruler of the Realm in the early days of the Dynasty. Steamy romance and intrigue are marks of the series, as is the unparalleled sexual tension between Scarlet and her main antagonist, Raija, the Dragon-Wolf Princess, a powerful Fae aristocrat that sought to finish what Balor started using her experiences along the Time Stream, as her narrative denoted her as being her own mother, sister, and daughter, granting her eons of experience to draw on. Literature is a strange thing, even in Creation, it seems.)<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T08:48:28-07:00","id":480278,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> &quot;Hohoho! What a lively group this one is!&quot; a creaky voice, filled with the wisodm of ages and the pep to ignore it, boomed. With that, an unassuming old man wearing a series of blue vests bedecked with brolnze bells appeared seemingly out of nowhere.<br /> <br /> &quot;Hello, hello, pleased to make your acquaintance. I am Eztoro of the Blue Bell, third ranking terrestrial god of both the Yellow Barque and of the Bureau of Humanity. I am also the master of this Guild franchise. I had heard a certain young lady questioning the charity of my house, and a young man foolishly declaring to jump into the Labyrinth. Of course I must see this courageous, brilliantly foolish people. What may I know you as?&quot; he asks, bowing with a flourish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-14T16:24:49-07:00","id":480855,"title":"","content":"Zarah was surprised by the god's sudden appearance, but hid it well. Facing the god, she bowed deeply. &quot;You may call me Lin Zarah. I did not meant any offence back in the Guildhall. I am a newcomer in this town and was not expecting such a welcome.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 04-15-2015, 03:41 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-16T18:46:54-07:00","id":483062,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;The one that looks like a sailor and his companion booked passage on the same sky-ship that brought me here. I wouldn't say they are companions of mine.&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">Prodigal glances at Orca and Lover in turn as he mentions them. He purposely attempts to look like he is annoyed that they have arrived. </span><span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;The Immaculate I haven't seen before. Not the kind of person I would care to make angry if I were you, though.&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Abyssal nods respectfully in the direction of the monk in question.</span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\">With this he will casually begin to step away from the group that has gathered. It could be possible that he could get the Lunar and the other to help with a plan that was beginning to form in his mind if he could talk with them later away from this lot. He had to be ready for them to do anything from questioning to attacking the ones looking for Merciful or even him. The Daybreak was not a fan of the last option. Not one bit.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-19T23:54:54-07:00","id":486056,"title":"","content":"&quot;By the Sun, deathknight!&quot; Orca says to Prodigal as he looks at the horde of creatures in the alley, &quot;Not even in the city for a day and you already manage to make friends with the walking corpses here?&quot; The usually friendly pirate scowled. If he had wanted to deal with the undead shambling about, he would have kept pirating in Skullstone. &quot;They better not be staying at the warehouse....&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-20T08:38:09-07:00","id":486425,"title":"","content":"Unrestrained Lover look at Orca with a puzzled look on his face. <span style=\"font-family:courier new\">&quot;A walking Corpse ?! What in the great maker are you talking about ? Corpse don't walk on their own when they are dead !!!&quot;</span> Unrestrained Lover look at the creatures in the alley with a strange look of disgust and interrest.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-22T16:47:29-07:00","id":488834,"title":"","content":"There's a long silence as Orca gives Lover a look as if he suddenly sprouted three heads.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Nothing really to add, I just like playing up how baffled Orca is by Lover's lack of basic knowledge about Creation. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-25T01:18:36-07:00","id":491442,"title":"","content":"Cautiously Xisa returned the nod. &quot;I heard the...wailing I apologize, am I interrupting something?&quot; Between the strangely familiar pirate, the man in gold and the dozens of walking dead people, even the seasoned Monk was at a loss for how precisely to proceed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T17:43:15-07:00","id":494127,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> &quot;Well-met, Lin Zarah. Few expect my appearance, but such is the way of things, Who can predict the whims of the gods, after all, eh? Eh? A little Divine Humor. Anyways, what brings you to my offices, Zarah? of the Lin clan?&quot; Extoro asks, scratching his nose absentmindedly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T17:56:00-07:00","id":494143,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> &quot;is that right? Well, that's a shame, then. I'll see you, Ash, if you survive,&quot; the man cackles, and disappears in a haze of blue. You all feel an unsettling wave wash over you, which while uncomfortable, also invigorates you, like a bath of cool water. <br /> <br /> &quot;You may eat them, minions,&quot; you hear the man's voice echo throughout the alley, as the robed figures all begin to stand up and hoot excitedly. They all tear off their scarves, revealing yellowed, distended teeth, advancing like a pack of wolves.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-27T18:12:09-07:00","id":494181,"title":"","content":"&quot;There hasn't been a Lin Clan for a great many years,&quot; Zarah said softly. Most of her family fled to the Threshold after her wedding and married into other families or took other names. All she has left is her dear daughter, but even she bears the another name. She shakes her head to clear her thoughts and continues more briskly. &quot;I was gathering supplies for an expedition into the Labyrinth. The Guild seemed to be the best and most efficient place to acquire those supplies.&quot; <br /> <br /> Pausing for a moment, Zarah considers her next words carefully. &quot;Master Extoro, forgive me if I am being too forward, but how does a god become Guildmaster? Isn't that usually a mortal position? &quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-30T14:27:12-07:00","id":497882,"title":"","content":"&quot;Of course they may.&quot; She said giving her temples a rub and smiling wryly. Her boots began glowing a brightly, along with the rest of her body.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">-2 Motes from her Personal pool to grant her God Kicking Boots Dragon Graced weapons.<br /> Rolling Join Battle, Wits+Awareness wasn't it?<a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/6569/view\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.rpnation.com/dice/6569/view</a></div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 04-30-2015, 05:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-01T15:31:57-07:00","id":499447,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;Captain, those flame pieces might get some use this day and you might get to take out your aggression toward all things underworld as well,&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">the Deathknight jests. He hefts his staff in a defensive posture and continues his measured withdrawal. He wasn't suited to combat. Sure, he had abilities that helped him deal with spirits, but these creatures in front of him seemed to be flesh and bone even if it was undead flesh.<br /> <br /> Prodigal, or &quot;Ash&quot; as he had told the master his name was, did have some minor abilities for defending himself. He realized his current path would be one that would be dangerous, so he made sure he wasn't completely defenseless if he got into a dust-up, which it seems he now found himself in.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Doing the join battle thing as well. I have Wits of three (3) and Awareness of (3) = six (6) dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4815941/\" target=\"_blank\">six (!) successes</a>. Yeah, I'mma start to back away. Should one of the walking corpses engage me, I will try to defend like someone that doubts their ability to deal with these fools. Also, do these guys seem to be animated by ghosts? Would I roll anything for that and what would I roll?</div></div> </div> </div></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 05-01-2015, 11:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T21:09:22-07:00","id":502463,"title":"","content":"&quot;HA! I've seen scarier things walking the streets of Onyx!&quot; Orca grins at the monsters, &quot;Tell me, friend,&quot; He asks Lover as the undead advance towards them, &quot;You up for a wager? Twenty silver to whoever brings down the most of these ugly bastards.&quot; There's a flourish of Orca's hands, and suddenly a pair of flame pieces are spinning in his hands.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> My Join Battle Roll: <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4816874/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4816874/</a><br /> <br /> So that'd be two! </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-05T11:04:40-07:00","id":504384,"title":"","content":"&quot;You're on captain !!! Thought I will have to ask Zarah about how much that is later.&quot; Unrestrained lover says with a grin before his arm deploy itself like in the bar as the lover takes aim at the monsters coming at them. (Roll Join battle 5 dice got 3 (<a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4817507/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4817507/</a> can't link for some reason) also Lover spends five motes to deploy his arm cannon)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-10T11:32:13-07:00","id":510066,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> Nergui frowned at the deity as it introduced itself, and as Zarah asked about the reason it occupied its position the frown deepened.<br /> <br /> The gods were supposed to be guardians and protectors of the people, and to guide mortal men and women towards righteous living. The Guild was...well, it was sort of the opposite of doing that. If indeed this deity had fallen to the ways of blind greed and cruel profit, then something would have to be done about it.<br /> <br /> He did not yet speak, however. The god's answer would decide its fate.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>So I'm making <a href=\"http://godkickingboot.smackjeeves.com/\" target=\"_blank\">God-Kicking Boot</a>, an Exalted webcomic, now. Updates on Sundays. Full-color, mediocre but slowly improving art. It's a thing.<br /> <br /> The absence of a monument can, in its own way, be something of a monument also.</i> -Roger Zelazny","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/512-wise-old-guru","name":"Wise Old Guru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar512_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T07:19:33-07:00","id":511978,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> &quot;Truth be told,&quot; Eztoro says, his eyes narrowing,&quot; You'd be correct. I was but a minor god of a trade road between Chiarusco and Nexus until an enterprising godblooded factor bound me to service. I performed admirably, and when the factor gained the mantle of Exaltation, they in turn, elevated me to the esteemed position I have now. However, after an unforeseen incident, whereby I could not dissuade a band of storm mothers from sinking a ship containing important cargoes, I was banished to this backwater. Away from the lifeblood of trade in the East, I am stuck here to rot. Telll me, is this any way to live? I don't even have a concrete purview anymore, merely a &quot;God of Trade.&quot; What does that even MEAN?&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T07:36:15-07:00","id":511987,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> The figures all continue their feral hooting, hollering, and slowly edge closer to you, becoming more rabid and animalistic, beginning to gnaw on themselves in anticipation.<br /> <br /> They roll <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/6843/view\" target=\"_blank\"> a botch</a> So! The initiative order is Prodigal, Lover, Orca, Xisa and finally, the enemies.<br /> <br /> What will you do, Prodigal?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-12T11:07:13-07:00","id":512146,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> Zarah looks embarrassed for the Master Eztoro after the god finishes his rant. Did the guild master really mean to let so much information out? A trade god dissatisfied with his position might be useful to Zarah\u2019s interests in the area. And perhaps, if the economy at Last Chance picks up, there may be an open position for a God of Eztoro\u2019s skills. Of course, this might be exactly what Eztoro wants in the first place. The beginnings of a strong business relationships are founded on both parties fulfilling the other\u2019s needs.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhile others may dismiss this area as a backwater, I find such places are filled with opportunity if you know where to look. \u201c Zarah had not missed Nergui\u2019s frown. <i>He does not like something about this god</i>, Zarah thinks. <i>Perhaps Nergui knows Eztoro from his travels?</i><br /> <br /> \u201cMaster Eztoro, who is this factor that holds you to the position of Guildmaster? Are there any agreements that bind you to this position? \u201c","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 05-12-2015, 02:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-13T21:20:47-07:00","id":513764,"title":"","content":"Prodigal moves briskly, yet cautiously in the direction of Xisa. His intention is simple: Be near the one who appears to have the best chance of allying with him for the time being. The captain has expressed dislike for him and the metallic one seems to be friendly with him. It would be simple for either to arrange an accident. So, desperate times call for him to work with a religious zealot that would most likely attack him anyway if she knew the nature of what he was. Here's hoping he didn't have to expend too much power and give himself away.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">This is pretty much a fancy way of saying that he is going to move in the direction of Xisa and if there is time after he gets there, he will guard until something else happens. Not all that exciting, I know, but this guy is an intellectual and if he does do any swording it will be a long way off and he will have to purchase the charms for it.<br /> <br /> Question for the Ess'Tee: I expended ten motes of personal earlier. Have any of those came back. I only get three motes per hour as I am a Deathknight in Creation, with a Soulsteel Hearthstone Necklace. I also have not drained motes from anything living.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":".  Grammar! 05-15-2015, 09:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-15T17:47:27-07:00","id":515646,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> &quot;I am beholden to a witch of a woman; a factor by the name of Sky Orchid. This woman was related to a powerful factor within the Guild, and was able to co-opt me for her own purposes, using her father's influence. Now, I am bound by oaths under Heaven and Earth, to her service, lest Fate itself turn against me,&quot; Eztoro narrows his eyes, and looks around,&quot; I wouldn't move against her, not openly, at least. She has spies everywhere,&quot; <br /> <br /> (Meanwhile, in the Alleys)<br /> <br /> That'll be a 2 die stunt, Belkra Also, I'm assuming your essence pools are filled. No one has used that . It's now Lover's turn. Magnusar, you're up!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-17T06:20:49-07:00","id":516982,"title":"","content":"&quot;I just arrived in town this day. I wouldn't dream of moving against anyone.&quot; <i>Not yet</i>, Zarah thinks. First the King of Hoofs. If she survives that, then Zarah might help out Eztoro. <br /> <br /> &quot;Speaking of which, who else in Last Chance should I be wary of? &quot; The Guildhall was always the best place to pick up some rumors.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-18T16:50:27-07:00","id":518571,"title":"","content":"(Guild Hall)<br /> <br /> &quot;Be wary of the Icecrowners. They are a grim lot, and there is not one of them with good intentions. I hear they have dealings with the Underworld, but my powers do not extend that far, so I can only guess to their intentions. Apart from that. I would be careful around the little girl the Burgermeister employs as well. She is a shaman who holds sway over two of the Beast Knights, powerful Fae whose fell leader swore fealtty to Balor during that dark time. All in all, I would be wary in general, Lin Zarah. Hohoho, what assurance do you have that I am not misleading you? I kid, I kid. But that is the way here. Honor is strong with the Haslan, but this place makes beasts of even honorable men and women,&quot; the god says, frowning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-20T13:42:06-07:00","id":522419,"title":"","content":"The Lover takes aim with is arm cannon the sound of spinning gears and the buzzing sound of essence being channel through his charms motonic circuitry can be heard as a yelllow light shines through his fur coat on his back along his spine. In a split second his arm cannon spit three fiery plasma bolts, each at a different undead. ( Unrestrained lover activate Transcendant Efficiency Relay and spends 6 motes of personal essence, 1 wp to gain a flurry of three attacks and spend three additionnal personal motes to fire the cannon three times for a total of 9 Personal motes and 1 willpower)<br /> <br /> (Each attack roll 9 dice for accuracy and a base damage of 10L piercing here they are <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7011/view\" target=\"_blank\">First</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7012/view\" target=\"_blank\">second</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/7013/view\" target=\"_blank\">third</a>)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 05-21-2015, 06:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-23T11:11:46-07:00","id":525631,"title":"","content":"One more... Did one more caught in the azure web really matter?<br /> <br /> <i>Do I feign, even to myself, that this is for the best in the long run? If that was true there should be no question. And yet...</i><br /> <br /> To himself he whispered, &quot;Greed is good.&quot; That was the message he was sending wasn't it? Not that compassion would ease your own suffering. Not that earnest striving would bring reward. Greed, the quick fix and the easy scheme, was the path to flourishing. The riches he would honestly provide were not a fair trade for the corruption this lesson would engender.<br /> <br /> That settled it then. Adorjan would have her price, for all that she would not care a whit for it. With the smile he had once seen worn by a neomah on a scarlet mount he turned toward the teahouse.<br /> <br /> Adorjan would have her price, and perhaps he could see that she choked on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-27T17:41:00-07:00","id":530442,"title":"","content":"(Alleyways)<br /> <br /> The Lover's shots burn their target into a flaming skeleton which collapses onto itself, howling as it is devoured by the flames. Its fellows don't seem to notice, continuing their advance. <br /> <br /> It is now Orca's turn. <br /> <br /> (Teahouse)<br /> <br /> As Merciful approached the teahouse, his blood turned to ice. Well, more ice than usual, as he saw a face he thought he would never see again. The Emissary glowers at him, then sneers. <br /> <br /> &quot;Nice dress. A shame it's wasted by you wearing it, and not on my floor,&quot; he sneers, and stomps off. <br /> <br /> Well, that was...not what you imagined would happen. You sit down at Zadro's table as he looks cooly at you, sipping his drink.<br /> <br /> &quot;Well, if it isn't the princess. Is your adoring public not as amnible to you? What has it been? Five minutes? I know the public is fickle, but that has to be a new record. Anyways, what do you want?&quot; he asks, coyly. <br /> <br /> What will you do? <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-31T12:38:36-07:00","id":534724,"title":"","content":"Zarah considers the god's warning and says &quot;Thank you for your time and your goods, Master Extoro, but we must be heading along. Perhaps we will meet again sometime.&quot;<br /> <br /> Zarah is silent as she leads the Lunar to the Ironworks. <i>I am a long way from home,</i> she thinks, <i>and these Northerners are much less guarded than the Courtiers on the Blessed Isle. Unless that is what they want me to think.</i> She will have to be careful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-01T23:10:09-07:00","id":536561,"title":"","content":"Orca leaps off a barrel and over the undead horde. In midair, two fireballs launch from the weapons in his hands, engulfing two of the creatures in flame. He lands on the opposite end of the alley, dropping his spent flame pieces to the ground as he lands. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Ok, it's been a while since I played a character who dual-wielded anything, but if I remember correctly I can basically add the Rate of the two weapons together. So with normal flurry penalties, the first attack should be worth 8 die and the second 7 die.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90286\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90286\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90286\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90286 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> And<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90287\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/images/logo.gif\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90287\" target=\"_blank\"> CoyoteCode Dice Roller </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90287\" target=\"_blank\"> http://www.coyotecode.net/roll/lookup.php?rollid=90287 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Each shot got 3 successes, and the damage of the weapons is 8L each. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T19:40:50-07:00","id":553663,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Once more, shots ring out, and another of the groaning shamblers collapses, felled by spurts of fire. The others are beginning to get agitated. Perhaps whatever spark of self-defense they have is becoming agitated, perhaps the deaths of their fellows is spurring them to further predation. Who knows?<br /> <br /> Xisa's turn.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-13T19:50:22-07:00","id":553667,"title":"","content":"(Guild Offices)<br /> <br /> The Guild continues its work, serlling, buying, and shipping goods. The hustle and bustle of the markets is now buffeted by gathered prayers to a new princess who promises propserity and future ease from the constant threats of the Labyrinth. More surprising, though, are gaggles, who whisper of a &quot;Bear-man&quot; who seems to actually care about those sick with Leaf-Leprosy, and many utter hushed prayers, looking about. It seems the atmosphere has changed, ever so slightly, by the Circle's arrival. <br /> <br /> What will you do now?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-14T15:11:23-07:00","id":554909,"title":"","content":"The woman did not bring her coquettish smile to bear. It might work, enough pepper could make any meat bearable, but it was not the best way. No, the best way was something far more direct.<br /> <br /> Seating herself primly the she regarded Zadro soberly and seriously. &quot;I want exactly want you might expect, your assistance in the expedition I am putting together. There are many fair sounding words I could give you, bits of flattery such as, 'you must chip away the surface ice before you reach the clean block' but we both know such things are general enough to always apply. No, I waited until last to speak to you because someone had to be last and I sensed you would understand that the I had to secure those who questioned their importance before their enthusiasm waned. You <i>know</i> that you are more necessary than any other sole merchant and so you know that I am willing to give up the most in negotiation to secure your aid. You understand business.<br /> <br /> So let us get to business. I need clothing, sacks, material for tenting, and myriad other things. But I am forgetting my manners. You offered me a gift did you not? Let me recompense your offer. In the Labyrinth I know how to find those who have the secret of drawing the threads of time. From that thread the gods have woven great scrolls to record the passing of the ages, and some say the future may be read in any loom on which the thread is set. I do not know if that is true, but even that is of less value than what I hope to find there.&quot;<br /> <br /> Now &quot;she&quot; smiled. <br /> <br /> &quot;There are secrets greater and more wondrous still within the Labyrinth and I know how they might be gained. The great family who sent me would not waste my time with scavenged trinkets. Yet I have my own mission. Contacts, connections, friends who have access to such secrets. My secret, sir, is that I want to make you rich. I want to make this town prosperous beyond the dreams of any who live here; and when it is I will be perfectly poised to negotiate trade contracts and set up distribution across half the North. Scavenger Lords grow rich from treasures. Guild Factors grow richer. I am not with the Guild, but I know where real fortunes come from.<br /> <br /> So, speaking of business, would like to be a part of this?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Totally not lying, there is totally a first circle demon species known as Heranhal who can do that. </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T12:13:16-07:00","id":561033,"title":"","content":"(Teahouse)<br /> <br /> Zadro looks coolly at Merciful as he lays out his plans and his promises.<br /> <br /> &quot;You can get me such a thing. I know that there are powerful, dangerous beasts in the Labyrinth, but such a thing,&quot; he says, stroking his chin.<br /> <br /> &quot;So, tell me thi,s then, madam. If you are not a guilder, then what is your affiliation. Surely you cannot be a freelance entrepreneur. You couldn't have such &quot;Connections&quot; is you were, so tell me, who are these allies you profess to have?&quot; he asks, looking over his spindled fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-19T13:40:15-07:00","id":561125,"title":"","content":"After taking care of her business at the Ironworks and biding the Lunar Captain farewell, Zarah searched the streets of Last Chance for the tavern she was at earlier. <i>This town desperately needs street signs</i>, she thinks. Zarah gives up and heads into the nearest tea house for directions.<br /> <br /> &quot;Excuse me. Can you direct me to the Tavern?&quot; Surely a town so small doesn't have more than one tavern.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-21T18:20:17-07:00","id":563597,"title":"","content":"(Zarah)<br /> <br /> Zarah is directed to the tavern by a rosy-cheeked lad with a gigantic sled dog in tow. She finds Zan there, conversing with a pale woman in bleached armor. <br /> <br /> The pair seems to be slightly inebriated, and the woman's mouth seems to be stretching far wider for a few moments than it ought to. Well, that's a mite off.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-22T18:42:30-07:00","id":564818,"title":"","content":"&quot;Good afternoon! Do you have a couple of bottles of red and white wine I can procure? I neglected to inquire what my host is serving for dinner tonight, so I want to be prepared.&quot; Zarah keeps an eye on Zan and his companion. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> The woman's mouth is unnaturally wider? <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-24T21:47:28-07:00","id":567381,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> The bartender eyes narrow, and he looks at Zarah sternly.<br /> <br /> &quot;We don't have that Southern fizz-water here, Miss. We have mead, rotgut, and cleanser. I'd recommend not drinking too much of the latter, though. You'd go blind if you do,&quot; he says, taking out a dark bottle and placing it next to her on the bar. The bottle has a label in Skytongue labeling it as Rackhnar's River-Rot, brewed from lichen and mushrooms in the fine year of 733. <br /> <br /> Zan is laughing and chatting with the woman, discussing prior exploits in the Labyrinth, while the woman nods and smiles sleepily. <br /> <br /> &quot;Ah, see. that's the thing, y-y-y-ya get a Humba on yer arse, that's a whole weekend of trouble just waiting for yeh,&quot; he slurs, downing another drink, while the woman laughs at his non-joke. <br /> <br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br /> [OoC: Yes, her mouth is stretching out far longer than normal, even if only for moments at a time.]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-25T07:58:27-07:00","id":567938,"title":"","content":"<i>Mushrooms?</i> Zarah recently picks up the bottle of Rotgut and pulls the cork and takes a wiff. The nauseated stench from the cork makes her eyes water. <i>Did the bartender give me the cleaner instead?</i> She quickly recorks the rotgut. <i>I bet Orca would drink this</i>. <br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019ll take this bottle and one of the mead,\u201d Zarah says in a brisk manner. She glances over at Zan and the woman at the table. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Activating Consumer \u2013 Evaluating Glance on the big mouth woman \u2013 Perception 3 + Investigation 3 = 6 Dice (2 Successes)<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=WB4EB2H6\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=WB4EB2H6\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=WB4EB2H6\" target=\"_blank\"> http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=WB4EB2H6 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T03:35:31-07:00","id":568968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=553663#post553663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Once more, shots ring out, and another of the groaning shamblers collapses, felled by spurts of fire. The others are beginning to get agitated. Perhaps whatever spark of self-defense they have is becoming agitated, perhaps the deaths of their fellows is spurring them to further predation. Who knows?<br /> <br /> Xisa's turn.</div> </div> </div> </div>((Blehh, sorry for the delay, work had me going in circles))<br /> <br /> Xisa glanced around at her erstwhile allies before leaping high into the air. Complete unknowns, though there was something strangely familiar about the one with the flamepieces. Unimportant, she focused on her enemies. From the look of things they were pack hunters, the absolute worst thing was let them get organized or disperse to predate upon the unprepared civillians. She knew of one fairly idiot proof method of preventing both.<br /> <br /> She (quite literally leapt) into the fray, kicking one shambler in the head, aiming to send it flying into it's allies by way of the wind rushing from her now glowing boots. Around that moment, it occurred to her that it might help to ascertain just what exactly she was kicking.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Dex+Melee, 7d10, <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4822074/\" target=\"_blank\">http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4822074/</a>, 5 Hits. Also Dragon Graced Weapon takes two dice away from the the Shamblers next action.</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T11:19:46-07:00","id":577544,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> The bartender nods gruffly, producing several bottles, and then holding out a thick hand for payment. When he is paid, his face lightens, and he grunts a &quot;Pleasure d'ing businss, Miss,&quot; tapping his brow in a sort of salute.<br /> <br /> (The woman's intentions in the scene are to merely enjoy herself, she seems to be under a great deal of stress and she is presently enjoying herself with the inebriated Zan.)<br /> <br /> (Alleyway)<br /> <br /> (Nice, that's a 2 die stunt, Revenge)<br /> <br /> Xisa clocks the shambler in the chest, smashing a hole in the person with a sickly crunching sound, and a roaring shockwave of wind blew off the turbans of the remaining shamblers while putting out the fires of the other casualties. What Xisa saw was horrifying: Rotten, green flesh, sunken, yellow eyes, flesh drawn back with disease and age, revealing long, fang-like teeth and long, grasping fingers, ready to grab and eat to satiate their endless hunger.<br /> <br /> They lunge at Xisa, hititng for <a href=\"https://www.rpnation.com/dice/8566/view\" target=\"_blank\"> 6 suxx</a>. The other tries to o the same, but fails, only rolling 4 suxx. What will you do, Xisa?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T20:35:52-07:00","id":578093,"title":"","content":"Desperately reminding herself that it is unbecoming of a Monk (even a defrocked one!) to panic in the face of pus engorged, maggot infested, presumably undead monstrosities, Xisa proceeded to roll and dip around the horrid, spidery long hands.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I am not going to miss this confusing ass combat system, come Ex3. Okay to start out I can use the stunt dies to up my Dodge DV up to either six or seven, whichever one beats the 6 Success attack.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-03T20:57:30-07:00","id":578124,"title":"","content":"It would be seven, as the dice are added to the DV itself, so, yes, your DV is increased to the point that you'd not be hit. <br /> <br /> \u200bIt is now Prodigal's turn once more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-04T20:46:27-07:00","id":579413,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> Since she had some time to kill before dinner, Zarah sits at the bar and order herself a drink. She tells the bartender, &quot;Send a round to the couple sitting at the table over there.&quot; She nods in the direction of Zan.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T16:52:31-07:00","id":580342,"title":"","content":"Marian's internal monologue was a buzz of activity. It seemed that he was surrounded by those that are more adept at combat than he. Of course, those more adept at combat were exactly what he would need if he were ever to accomplish his goals. It wasn't that he would manipulate them or trick them into doing things that would benefit him, but if he could get the forces of this other Deathlord to fight with those of the Bishop by playing his origins as a Deathknight true, then he could have the both of them pound each other into the ground. Picking up the pieces wouldn't be a simple matter, but that was a bridge he would have to cross when he got there. For the meantime, though...<br /> <br /> The Captain's flame pieces were not quite as deadly as he had feared, though they were still deadly enough to end his existence should the Captain will it. The metal man was surprisingly capable of turning his arm into a weapon of some sort. That would come in handy if turned to the purpose The Prodigal now found himself pursuing. Finally the Immaculate was just as deadly as he could have hoped. He would have to tread carefully with all of them because any of them could defeat him almost as easily as they were defeating these creatures.<br /> <br /> As his thoughts whir through his head, the Daybreak will back slowly away from the fight with his staff at the ready. He is prepared to attempt to deflect blows that come his way, but he is not going to attempt to attack the creatures. He was first and foremost a scholar and scholars were unsuited to combat. That was something he might have to change...<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Yeah, I really didn't do anything for combat with this guy. I have Melee Essence Triumphant and Elegant Flowing Deflection only for the purpose of making sure he doesn't get wrecked. He could use the excellency to attack, but I do not think that is his style. Guard and Move, or Move and Guard. Whatever order works best at this point.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-16T16:45:09-07:00","id":593280,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Very well, it is now Orca's turn once more.<br /> <br /> (The Bar)<br /> <br /> Zan and the woman both look on as the bartender leaves his comfortable haunt and saunters over to their table, delivering a set of drinks with a gruff explanation. Zan stares in a slittly inebriated way at Zarah, chuckles, and pats a nearby chair.<br /> <br /> &quot;Sit, sit, Zarah! I didn't see you. I'll be going into the Labyrinth tomorrow with Alma here, I'm just enjoying myself. You never know how things are going to go out there, so we gottam kae the most out of what time we have. Still, your friend seems very, very interested in the Forest Folk. This is pretty dangerous. Very dangerous. Oh well, as long as he pays well. What are you up to?&quot; <br /> <br /> (Nergui)<br /> <br /> Are you going to do anything or join in anywhere?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T17:52:57-07:00","id":597564,"title":"","content":"As Orca's spent flame piece's clatter to the ground, he reaches to his belt, drawing two more as quick as lightning. As one of the undead monsters rush him, he begins to concentrate. Time seems to slow as he raises the firearm to the bloodthirsty creature. He swings the flame piece into an aiming position, nothing existing save himself and his target. <br /> <br /> Time returns to normal.....<br /> <br /> FWOOOSH!!! The fireball flies straight for the zombie's head!<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Orca is going to use Lightning Draw Stance in order to instantly draw two more flame pieces. He's then going to use two motes of Kiss of the Sun Concentration in order to reduce the time it takes to aim to one tick before his shot.<br /> <br /> So the shot would have 13 dice (unless you wanna give stunt points, which I'm unsure on how those work in a PbP game)<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4833778/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4833778/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4833778/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4833778/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> That should be....eight successes. </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-23T10:28:04-07:00","id":600695,"title":"","content":"Alma? Zarah looks the woman over more carefully. In the dark bar, she did not recognize the bird eating woman. \u201cOh! I did not know you knew Alma, Zan. Alma and I have already met at the Guildhall.\u201d <i>Did I really just buy a drink for the bird eating woman?</i> Zarah thought in horror.<br /> <br /> Zarah worried about Zan\u2019s comment. Did people really just jump into the Labyrinth without any preparation? No wonder everyone thought it was dangerous. Or perhaps, they knew something she didn\u2019t. <br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> Poor Zarah, things are happening rather fast for her Ten Thousand Scales sensibilities. <br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-31T17:36:49-07:00","id":610188,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Orca's flame blasts burn away their target, while the last zombie collapses into a burning pile. Success! Everyone gains 300 levels and a small bag of flaming corpse pieces! Sadly, since Exalted doesn't use levels, you only get the satisfaction of a job well done. You can all have flaming corpse parts, though, if you'd wish.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?<br /> <br /> (Pub) <br /> <br /> &quot;It's....It's not that w-we're not propaned, Zala. It's that we're professionals. W-we have the tools and skills to go out. W-we also have seen a lot of-of....of....&quot; Zan slumps over, asleep, as Alma strokes his back.<br /> <br /> &quot;He means we've seen the horrors the Labyrinth will throw out at us, &quot; she replies,&quot; Besides, the sooner you begin to work on acquainting yourself, the easier ti will be to go out yourself,&quot; she says, looking at Zarah coolly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T07:11:39-07:00","id":610778,"title":"","content":"&quot;So I see.&quot; Zarah is silent for a moment. <i>I will most likely be dead in a month, so why not? </i> Under the table, Zarah slips her hand into her sleeve to grab the handle of one of her throwing knives. She wants to be prepared in case Alma responds badly to her next question.<br /> <br /> In a low voice, not to disturb the slumbering Zan, Zarah asks, &quot;I heard a rumor that you were 'Anathema'. Now, I have never been particularly devout follower of the Immaculate Dragons and I always thought the Anathema were a bed time story the Scarlet Empress used to keep the Dragonblooded in line. So what are you really?&quot;<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I hope I read Alma's character correctly, otherwise I'll need to make a new one myself. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T18:36:08-07:00","id":611576,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;That went in a direction I didn't want it to,&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Prodigal starts as he gazes around at the devastation wrought by his </span>unlikely companions. <span style=\"color:#696969\">&quot;I would like to thank all of you for ensuring that these beasts didn't get to sup on my remains.&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">The Daybreak lowers his staff from it's defensive position and any cracks that may have shown in his mask of composure have disappeared. He nods once, more to himself than the others and starts to head out the alley.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T19:51:06-07:00","id":611702,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> Alma sighs, then in a flash, a giant appears where she stood. Easily nine feet tall, with red-bronze skin, several horns jutting from her temples, as reddish-brown fur rustles here and there on her figure. She flexes taloned fingers, and he looks down at Zarah for a minute, before the smaller armored woman returns to view. No one else seems to have seen this terrifying vision, with the pub owner puttering around with his glasses and Zan still sleeping soundly. <br /> <br /> &quot;What you hear is correct. By your reckoning, I am &quot;Anathema.&quot; What I am, though, I cannot say. I bear the memories of Alma, a princess in the line of Mereving in the land of Tarkh, in the region called the Hundred Kingdoms. She was betrothed to a man in the kingdom of Zell, to the east of Tarkh, and their union was supposed to unite the two neighbors in harmony, cementing friendships that had been built up over generations. However, then they appeared. Two men, sowing the seeds of strife and war. Kharas, the Lord of Blades, and the Sun-King of Flame, himself, Oda Noodlnaga. The two had armies of beastmen armed with unusual weapons that blew fire like the breath of the gods themselves. They sowed mistrust between Tarkh and Zell, and the princess was slain in the final battle for her home of Asterberg. However, her beloved still loved her, and sought any way to bring her back, employing even dark magicks and the shrines deep beneath Asterberg, baptized by an fell god at the end of time, whose Ichor is said to have stained the earth itself black. It was this that I recall, for I awoke to these two. I was not Alma, and yet, I am, and for this reason, I use her name, for it is the name in the memories in my head. However, when my birth was sussed out, I was called an evil spirit and fled, hounded by the Wyld Hunts of several nations. Which is why I am here. I have an unnatural hunger for blood and flesh, I know this, but I do not wish to prey on innocent humans if I can help it. The creatures of this place share my taste for blood, so I see it as a fair trade. Does that answer your question?&quot; Alma asks, lazily.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T20:04:02-07:00","id":611710,"title":"","content":"Zarah nods and was silent for a moment as she collected her thoughts. Alma was not was she expected. But then, everything was not what she expected since she came to the threshold. Keeping her hand on her knife, Zarah asked the question she really wanted an answer to.<br /> <br /> &quot;How does Zan feel about your status?&quot; He was the real reason why she asked about Alma. The Labyrinth was dangerous and Zarah was sure that either she or her companions would not be able to keep their secret for long.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 08-01-2015, 11:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T20:15:15-07:00","id":611745,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> &quot;Zan sees me as a sign that the god-kings of legend are returning. His family has a long-standing reverence for the sun-kings, and he sees me of proof of his faith's concreteness. His family has surfed the shores of Reality, so this sort of danger in the Labyrinth is second nature to him,&quot; she says,&quot; Or that's what he says. I've not ever seen this palace of ice he keeps going on about.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-01T20:51:04-07:00","id":611783,"title":"","content":"Zarah almost chokes on her drink when Alma says this. &quot;Surfs the shores of Reality?&quot; Zarah says, covering her shock at the revelation of Zan's &quot;faith&quot;. She will have to ask him about it later. &quot;How does one surf the shores of realty?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":3950,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","user":"wonderandawe","date":". 08-01-2015, 11:53 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T01:03:05-07:00","id":611958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dietaku</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=610188#post610188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Orca's flame blasts burn away their target, while the last zombie collapses into a burning pile. Success! Everyone gains 300 levels and a small bag of flaming corpse pieces! Sadly, since Exalted doesn't use levels, you only get the satisfaction of a job well done. You can all have flaming corpse parts, though, if you'd wish.<br /> <br /> What will you do now?</div> </div> </div> </div>Xisa took a long hard stare at the burnt corpses, attempting to discern the origins or category of undead creature Orca had just destroyed.<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Per+Occult, I think.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4841573/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4841573/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4841573/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4841573/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> 6 hits</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Which reminded her. She turned to the Prodigal. &quot;I don't know, who he is.&quot; Then to Lover &quot;I haven't the slightest idea what you are.&quot; Then she whirled about to face Orca. &quot;But I damned well remember you!&quot;<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-02T21:30:54-07:00","id":613007,"title":"","content":"Orca kicks his dropped flame pieces into the air, catching them and beginning to reload them (his mind going to a design for a multi shot flame piece). &quot;Funny Deathknight,&quot; He says as he slides the reloaded weapons back into his coat, &quot;I thought your kind COMMANDED the undead.&quot;<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Revenge of TV Head</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=611958#post611958\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Which reminded her. She turned to the Prodigal. &quot;I don't know, who he is.&quot; Then to Lover &quot;I haven't the slightest idea what you are.&quot; Then she whirled about to face Orca. &quot;But I damned well remember you!&quot;<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Orca raises an eyebrow at the monk, &quot;You're gonna have to be more specific, miss. I've pissed off a LOT of Immaculate Monks back home....&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-06T14:22:07-07:00","id":618077,"title":"","content":"&quot;Well there were quite a few of us on <i>Danaa'd's Talon</i>, of course.&quot; Xisa replied, breathing in and gritting her teeth. &quot;Less so at the Library of Bones, Or during that chase over Island #5. And as I recall, there was only one chasing you through the bloody Streets of Yu Shan!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 08-06-2015, 09:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T00:24:01-07:00","id":618617,"title":"","content":"Orca chuckles, thinking back to those five days he spent in the Celestial City. &quot;That was a fun Carnival. I really gotta go back sometime soon.&quot; A look of realization crossed his face, &quot;Wait, I remember you! You chased me for an entire day through that orchard! You might have caught me too if I didn't hide in that Joybringer's townhouse. I was lucky she was more curious than angry about finding me asleep in her chambers....&quot; He chuckles again, thinking back on the day, seeming to forget entirely about Xisa for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;So what happened after Yu-Shan? Did the Order decide I wasn't feasting on enough infants to continue the chase?&quot; He adds sarcastically.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":814,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","user":"dreamking89","date":". 08-07-2015, 04:08 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T09:05:23-07:00","id":619007,"title":"","content":"The Prodigal hesitates for a second when the Lunar mentions his seeming lack of abilities. He decides that he can explain the vagaries of commanding undead creatures to him later. Something more pressing was calling for his attention.<br /> <br /> He proceeds rapidly through Last Chance, fighting an urge to take all the posters the creatures had placed down and burn them. It would draw attention to him and that wasn't something he needed right now. No, he needed to find Merciful and let him know what was going on. The plan he had started to formulate might still be feasible, but he would have to ask the others to adjust the roles he had already cast them in.<br /> <br /> The real question now was where Merciful had gotten off to. Marian hadn't seen the other Exalt since landing in last chance. It wasn't an overly odd thing for him to disappear, but he would need to be found before more of the creatures showed up to do it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":1146,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","user":"Belkra","date":". 08-26-2015, 11:04 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-07T19:44:41-07:00","id":619691,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=618617#post618617\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Orca chuckles, thinking back to those five days he spent in the Celestial City. &quot;That was a fun Carnival. I really gotta go back sometime soon.&quot; A look of realization crossed his face, &quot;Wait, I remember you! You chased me for an entire day through that orchard! You might have caught me too if I didn't hide in that Joybringer's townhouse. I was lucky she was more curious than angry about finding me asleep in her chambers....&quot; He chuckles again, thinking back on the day, seeming to forget entirely about Xisa for a moment.<br /> <br /> &quot;So what happened after Yu-Shan? Did the Order decide I wasn't feasting on enough infants to continue the chase?&quot; He adds sarcastically.</div> </div> </div> </div>At Orca's brief reverie, she recalled precisely what irritated her about this man, how easily he forgot her. Arrogant, self interested, upstart of a pirate.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Wouldn't know, I'm not very popular amongst the Order these days. It's what brought me to Last Chance.&quot; She fairly growled. &quot;I'm to clear my mind of all the deviltry you've supposedly infected me, while resting here here. Until further notice. As far from the Blessed Isle, where I can do the least amount of damage to their perfect little...<i>lie.&quot; </i>She breathed out, banishing the hostility. &quot;So, what brings you to Last Chance? Surely not these Zombies, I'd figured you have enough of the Undead after Island #5.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 08-07-2015, 10:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-09T07:52:48-07:00","id":621256,"title":"","content":"After looking over the burnt corpse the Lover comes back to the captain looking over his mechanical arm cannon.&quot;<span style=\"font-family:arial\">I think I will need to upgrade our arsenal before we go into the labyrinth captain I find ourselves to be a bit underarmed for this kind of expedition. Is this woman giving you trouble ?&quot;</span> The Lover turns his purple eyes to look at Xixa.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T23:48:16-07:00","id":626368,"title":"","content":"&quot;Take it easy,&quot; Orca says to Lover, &quot;If she wanted to kill me, she'd have tried to by now. As for why I'm here, monk.....Let's call it a <i>very</i> elaborate bet.&quot; Orca silently thinks back to that fateful night in the Diving Sea Snake. <i>Plentimon better not be taking me for a ride,</i> he thought silently to himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;A better arsenal: my three favorite words,&quot; Orca suddenly says with a grin. &quot;I had a few ideas, mainly about these.&quot; With a flick of his wrist, one of his flame pieces is in hand and showing it to the Alchemical. &quot;I can always go for more firepower, but the real issue is efficiency. One shot and the piece is spent. If I didn't carry so many on me, I'd be corpse food. What I need is something with multiple barrels that fire in succession.&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes a look around, &quot;Perhaps I should show you my sketches back at the warehouse.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-15T08:51:57-07:00","id":627640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=626368#post626368\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;Take it easy,&quot; Orca says to Lover, &quot;If she wanted to kill me, she'd have tried to by now. As for why I'm here, monk.....Let's call it a <i>very</i> elaborate bet.&quot; Orca silently thinks back to that fateful night in the Diving Sea Snake. <i>Plentimon better not be taking me for a ride,</i> he thought silently to himself.<br /> <br /> &quot;A better arsenal: my three favorite words,&quot; Orca suddenly says with a grin. &quot;I had a few ideas, mainly about these.&quot; With a flick of his wrist, one of his flame pieces is in hand and showing it to the Alchemical. &quot;I can always go for more firepower, but the real issue is efficiency. One shot and the piece is spent. If I didn't carry so many on me, I'd be corpse food. What I need is something with multiple barrels that fire in succession.&quot;<br /> <br /> He takes a look around, &quot;Perhaps I should show you my sketches back at the warehouse.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The lover smiles a bit at the captain's word concerning the arsenal before his arm cannon retransform into a somewhat normal arm.<br /> <br /> &quot;Better be careful about what you wish for captain, I have helped built engines of destruction that could level entire cities, and I could make them if given enough time and ressources.&quot;<br /> <br /> The lover chuckle as he remember his days in his laboratory. &quot;I would love to captain, now that I have seen what your weapons do I can help you, what kind of amunition does it use ? Speaking of which we should meet with Zarah I asked her to procure steel for me, I have to work on building the repeating crossbows for the expedition if you wish we could help each other.&quot;</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 08-15-2015, 01:39 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-26T16:01:10-07:00","id":640763,"title":"","content":"(Teahouse)<br /> &quot;That's all very good and nice, miss, but let me be frank. What assurances do you have of this &quot;hidden knowledge,&quot; &quot; Zadro says,&quot; Many spin such tales, but do you have any proof that I can see to back up my investment in your ventures?&quot; He asked, eyeing Mirthful squarely.<br /> <br /> (Pub)<br /> <br /> &quot;It's just an expression. His family stands on the edge of the Fairy Lands and does battle with them. I understand that he speaks the language of the Ancients, so he's always peppering his language with these..flowery expressions. He's also been a little drunk since he came to town, so pardon him if he's been overly friendly,&quot; alma says, patting her friend on the back as he mumbles something about &quot;Flowing Wolf Fang Fist Kata.&quot;<br /> <br /> (Alleyway)<br /> <br /> As the circle talks about the benefits of Autochthonian weaponry, a newcomer hops into the alley as well. Garbed in rags, and with their long hair in braids, it is none other than Mitzi, the wyld shaman you met when you first entered the town. However, she's acting a bit...off.<br /> <br /> &quot;Wow,wow, wowie, wow! Misters and Misses! You're strong! Very, very strong! I beg of you, please help me! I'm being hunted right now, and I need a bunch of alphas like you to help me! Please?&quot; she pleaded, wagging her behind. <br /> <br /> Clearly something has happened, but you cannot put your finger on what. What will you do?<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-27T23:06:48-07:00","id":642657,"title":"","content":"Orca eyes the strange shaman carefully. He had not met Mitzi earlier (he and Lover had been clearing the warehouse), but something was certainly peculiar about the woman standing before them. The way she spoke of 'alphas', the way she stood and shook her rear, there was something about it that was almost.....animalistic. He had once run across a tribe of beastmen in the West who referred to their chieftan as &quot;Alpha&quot;, but this girl certainly didn't look to be any less monkey than usual. And she certainly wasn't trying to sacrifice him to any beastmen goddess (a rather stunning Lunar woman, as it turned out, but another story for another time....)<br /> <br /> &quot;Miss Zarah's being hunted by an ancient beast, we're being hunted by undead, she used to be hunting me,&quot; he nods her head towards Xisa,&quot;Everyone's being hunted by something it seems.&quot; Orca says aloud, studying Mitzi quietly as he draws his flame pieces, preparing for whatever might run into the alley after the Wyld shaman.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I'm gonna roll for Perception+Investigation to study Mitzi and figure out what seems to be strange about her.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4857844/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4857844/\" target=\"_blank\"> Loading... </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4857844/\" target=\"_blank\"> http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4857844/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Here's hoping 2 is enough.... </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-30T08:05:20-07:00","id":645429,"title":"","content":"The lover quickly analyse the situation before turning to the captain &quot;We should go back to the warehouse with you're new friends if they wish to come, Zarah asked me to keep a low profile and I am sure that certain element in your world will wish me dead if they knew about me. We should go...&quot; The lover seems strangely agitated all of a sudden for some reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-02T18:19:30-07:00","id":649603,"title":"","content":"(Prodigal)<br /> <br /> To find Merciful, roll Perception+Investigation, at difficulty 3.<br /> <br /> (Alleyway)<br /> <br /> Orca doesn't notice anything out of the ordinary with Mitzi, save her odd posture. However, when he turns to listen to Lover's warnings, she leans over behind him before jerking back and grunting.<br /> <br /> &quot;No, no! I won't smell him! That's where I draw the line!&quot; she mutters, assuming her earlier somberness.<br /> <br /> &quot;Pooie, Pooie, I says,&quot; an immaculate white wolf pup says, appearing in her arms,&quot; You all talk about the Hoofed Lord like he's no big deal. You all are a bunch of alphas, and then there's THIS party pooper. Well, I'll hang with them, mortal Mitzi. You may return to your own life if you wish,&quot; the wolf says.<br /> <br /> &quot;I will not leave you, Lord Hutzupo, but you must understand. Even in my...culture, sniffing someone's behind is most shameful,&quot; she mutters, petting the fluffy god in her arms. <br /> <br /> &quot;Woof, whatever you say,&quot; the puppy god says, grinning at the attention.<br /> <br /> What will you do?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T00:16:49-07:00","id":649802,"title":"","content":"&quot;I would agree to with...&quot; At this point, Xisa looked at the strange metal man, and realized something quite embarrassing. &quot;You. We haven't been properly introduced, have we? Another time perhaps, when we're surrounded by four walls and a roof.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","user":"The Revenge of TV Head","date":". 09-18-2016, 11:45 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T11:54:12-07:00","id":650372,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> <i>I've dawdled here long enough.</i> Though, it was not time wasted. This conversation gave Zarah much to think about. Zarah finishes her drink. &quot;I must be going. I have a few more things to take care of. &quot; Zarah gets up from the table to leave, but then turns around. &quot;What time do you plan on leaving in the morning?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-03T20:13:29-07:00","id":650870,"title":"","content":"The other Exalt has to be around here somewhere. The Prodigal is sure of it. He had seen Merciful make to disembark the ship shortly after it landed. If he did go anywhere in the town, he would have to leave a trace of some sort, and that is exactly what the Daybreak sets out to find. He thinks about all the likely places and starts to mentally list the order of likeliness, until he has a short list of places that would yield the highest chances of finding who he sought.<br /> <br /> That done: he starts at the top of his short list and makes for his first destination.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I have three (3) Perception + three (3) Investigation = six (6) dice for <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4862242/\" target=\"_blank\">three successes</a>. I am not going to assume what kind of stunt that was. I think stunt dice are academic at this point, though as I have met the difficulty of three (3). </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-05T22:03:34-07:00","id":653505,"title":"","content":"&quot;I doubt any of us would object to an adorable puppy god living at the warehouse with us.&quot; Orca says with his trademark grin, &quot;We got more than enough room for him, let's head back.&quot; He starts walking back towards their home base, turning back to look at Xisa. &quot;You can come too, monk. Call it a much slower-paced chase.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-08T07:46:00-07:00","id":656508,"title":"","content":"Staring balefully at Orca, Xisa gave a bow. &quot;Your hospitality is appreciated.&quot; She said through gritted teeth, before following behind. She brought up the rear, an old habit from her days with the Wyld Hunt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-09T16:55:11-07:00","id":658619,"title":"","content":"(Pub)<br /> <br /> &quot;We're leaving tomorrow at dawn. If you wish to accompany us, I'd advise you to procure some weapons and armor. Oh, and also to put your affairs in order. No offense to you, Miss, but you do not have the look of a fighter,&quot; Alma says, taking a short bow to Zarah, and returning to attending to Zan's sleeping body.<br /> <br /> (Alley)<br /> <br /> &quot;I'll have you know, I am over fifty summers of age. But, since you called me adorable, I will let it slide. I am Hutzupo, Squire of Winter Wolves. Tziyga, Mistress of Wolves, is my mother, and also the patron of Mitzi's tribe. She kindly allowed me to possess her while--&quot; the tiny god paused, froze, and hid in Mitzi's arns as a shadow passed over the roofs. Tall, lanky, and impeccably dressed, the figure floated overhead for a moment before moving on. <br /> <br /> &quot;T-that is what I'm trying to avoid. It wants to take me to its Mistress' castle. I can't find my mom or brothers anywhere, and I have THAT following me,&quot; the puppy whined, peeking out of his impromptu burrow. <br /> <br /> (Prodigal)<br /> <br /> Your investigation returns you to the square, where a posh teahouse is in an uproar. Apparently a famous princess is inside, discussing business with Zadro, one of the Icecrowners. Surely Merciful would be involved in such dealings, correct? Besides, your occult senses can smell something amiss, which surely he has his hands in as well.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-13T22:03:13-07:00","id":663880,"title":"","content":"&quot;That?&quot; Xisa asked catching a glimpse of the strange figure. &quot;You wouldn't happen to know what 'that; is, I presume?&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T14:41:05-07:00","id":664824,"title":"","content":"The Lover watches the figure leave &quot;Yeah like she said but could we go to the warehouse ? I'll feel better with something solid over my head if you don't mind and I believe I owe you and Zarah a story captain, I'll need your help to prepare the weapons for our journey through the labyrinth.&quot; The lover pause as a mechanical growl is heard coming from him &quot;Seems like I'm hungry is there something like a culinary specialty here ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-14T22:40:36-07:00","id":665403,"title":"","content":"Orca had been watching the figure pass overhead, his hand flexing as he fought the urge to reach for his flame pieces. When he turned around he removed his hat and gave a bow. &quot;The pleasure is mine, Squire of Winter Wolves. I was called the Firedust Hurricane in the West, but you can call me Orca.&quot; He flashes the minor god a grin. He knew the most important thing to do in a new place (other than avoiding the Wyld Hunt) was to befriend the local divinity. &quot;We'll help you find your mother and brothers, but until then you may stay with us.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It's been a while since I've cooked anything,&quot; Orca shrugs to Lover as the group turns to leave the alley, &quot;That pub where Miss Zarah was might serve food....&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-15T20:37:45-07:00","id":666411,"title":"","content":"The Prodigal works his way carefully and quietly into the teahouse. He does his utmost to disturb no one or give the impression that he is doing anything other than trying to get a good look at whatever it is that is going on.<br /> <br /> In truth this is the second time he has seen this princess involved in a disturbance. The way everyone fawns over her is not natural. The Deathknight had heard of spirits and fair folk that would be able to elicit such a reaction, but this didn't seem like one of those situations. This was all together different and oddly familiar. He sits back a safe distance and merely observes. It would not do to act rashly, especially with the Icecrowner right there.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">I will be activating my Lore Essence Overwhelming for eight (8) dice, spending eight (8) personal motes. I am attempting to get a good bead on what is going on and focusing mainly on the Princess, but will take any information on the Icecrowner I can get if I score well enough. So, I am rolling Perception of three (3) + Lore of five (5) + Excellency for eight (8) = a total of sixteen (16) dice for a total of <a href=\"http://invisiblecastle.com/roller/view/4869520/\" target=\"_blank\">nine successes</a>. This will leave me with a personal essence pool of six (6).</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T07:19:09-07:00","id":682016,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>dreamking89</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth?p=665403#post665403\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Orca had been watching the figure pass overhead, his hand flexing as he fought the urge to reach for his flame pieces. When he turned around he removed his hat and gave a bow. &quot;The pleasure is mine, Squire of Winter Wolves. I was called the Firedust Hurricane in the West, but you can call me Orca.&quot; He flashes the minor god a grin. He knew the most important thing to do in a new place (other than avoiding the Wyld Hunt) was to befriend the local divinity. &quot;We'll help you find your mother and brothers, but until then you may stay with us.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;It's been a while since I've cooked anything,&quot; Orca shrugs to Lover as the group turns to leave the alley, &quot;That pub where Miss Zarah was might serve food....&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>The Lover looks at the small wolf god &quot;Cute, but I would like to get to the warehouse if he is being hunted better to stay away from public places, no ? and I could use a roof over my head and I still need to finish clearing the warehouse and set up a workshop.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-09-29T07:49:33-07:00","id":682029,"title":"","content":"Zarah leaves the pub deep in thought. Could she prepare for an expedition in less than 24 hours? Perhaps it was time to put her abilities to test. She went back to the Guild and asked to push up the delivery of the goods. She offered a discrete bribe to the clerk to assure prompt delivery and high quality goods. <br /> <br /> Afterwards, Zarah headed back to the Warehouse. She would have to ask The Lover and Orca to get their suggestions on Armor and Weapons.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> I am unsure what would be a good bribe. Zarah has 3 Resources, but she is unwilling to deplete herself. <br /> <br /> Int 3 + Bureaucracy 5 + Commence Specialty 1 = 9 dice (5 Successes + 4 Successes for 8 Personal Essence) = 9 Successes Total<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBRV2GF\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBRV2GF\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBRV2GF\" target=\"_blank\"> http://dice.brainclouds.net/Result.aspx?ID=EFBRV2GF </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T16:55:11-07:00","id":690610,"title":"","content":"(Teahouse)<br /> <br /> Prodigal's sight is as he sees A pair going through the politics of business, nothing unusual here or in the Underworld, but...<br /> <br /> A chill ran down his spine as though someone has spilled.ice water down his back as words, black and morose were etched into his mind.<br /> <br /> &quot;The Chosen of Our Cousin stands before you, sweet Paladin of Void. He is cloaked in the lies of our Cousin, the Wyrm of Mistruths. Be wary, Sweet Paladin. His aims are not the Annihilation We crave. Beware, beware! Six marks the stone as Wolf howls for jealous farmers and Dragon makes a nest for Sheep. Beware, beware, our Sweet Knight of Death...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T17:09:38-07:00","id":690612,"title":"","content":"(Alleyway)<br /> <br /> &quot;It was a creatures sent to get me! From some Fairy castle , a what did he call himself &quot;Major Dummy?&quot; From what I heard, he thought I was one of his mistress' babies! Woof! I may be a handsome fellow , but I, Hutzupo, am no Fae!&quot; the tiny god proclaimed, &quot;However, I will accept your offer. Beggars cannot choose their meat , as my big bro always said.&quot;<br /> <br /> As the Circle makes their way back to the earehouse, you see Me deal Davis Franceska waiting for you.<br /> <br /> &quot; I hope I am not too early. One of the faithful donated some lichen buns to my mission this afternoon, and I thought I would share them with you, &quot; the Immaculate sister said sheepishly.<br /> <br /> What will you do?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T17:26:13-07:00","id":690616,"title":"","content":"(Guild)<br /> <br /> The clerk accepts your bribe without comment, writes down a note in a parchment and pushes it into your hand.<br /> <br /> &quot;Your goods will be delivered by sundown, Miss. This ought not be an issue,&quot; He says, matter of factly.<br /> <br /> The note turns out to be a shipping manifest in Guild stenoscript of the like employed by the Realm. <br /> <br /> All Sarah can do now is wait. What will you do now?<br /> .","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1586-dietaku","name":"Dietaku","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1586_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1095"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-05T17:41:11-07:00","id":690628,"title":"","content":"Zarah makes her way back to her warehouse deep in thought. Now she had time to think, she was pissed that Zan took another contract without consulting her. <i>Damn Damn Damn. I knew I should have gotten the Dragonblooded to sign an exclusive contract.</i> Though, in this frigid waste, who knows what authority such a contract would hold. For all Zarah knew, it would be more useful for the chamber pot. Either way, Zan was not in a state to argue business at the pub. <br /> <br /> As she rounded the corner towards the Warehouse, Zarah notices the Immaculate Sister waiting by the door of the Warehouse. <i>Oh, dear.</i> Zarah thought they were going to have dinner on the Airship. Zarah certainly didn't have anything appropriate for Immaculate Monk to eat in the warehouse. Carefully stepping over a pile of manure, Zarah walks up to the sister and give her Zarah's best hostess smile. &quot;Good Evening, Sister. I'm sure whatever you brought is fine.&quot; <i>Put the sister at ease so she wouldn't ask too many probing questions. </i><br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-07T20:15:26-07:00","id":693378,"title":"","content":"&quot;Lichen? Like the stuff that grows on rocks up here?&quot; Orca asks, picking up one of the buns and sniffing at it. Such strange things these Northerners ate! It seemed like centuries since he last had fried octopus wrapped in Wavecrest seaweed. Despite his hesitation, the captain's eyes lit up as he took a bite of the bun. &quot;By the Ocean Father, this is fantastic!!&quot; He gives a tip of his hat, &quot;Much obliged, Sister.&quot; He takes another bite, then opens the door to the warehouse, gesturing for Lover to follow, &quot;Come, my friend. I have blueprints to show you and you have a home you must tell me of.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-07T21:28:23-07:00","id":693468,"title":"","content":"<i>The Neverborn! I must steel myself! </i>the Prodigal thinks to himself as he hears the whispers of his undying masters. He had heard of those like him that were in near constant communication with them, but he rarely, if ever was troubled with their attentions. That they spoke to him now only meant they were taking an interest in what he was doing. It is only through sheer determination that he doesn't cry out for the fear that threatens to overwhelm him.<br /> <br /> The cryptic words continue to echo in the Deathknight's mind as he quickly scans the crowd to see if any have noticed his momentary lapse or even noticed him at all. His composure returns to him slowly as he mulls over the differences in how he views what he is and how the originators of the void view him. Knight, Paladin, these are terms for a warrior. The Daybreak is a scholar above all and that knowledge serves him well in his pursuit of dealing with unruly spirits. If in the process of keeping those spirits in line causes the same to fall into the void and cease to be, so much the better. It keeps the void away off his back and ensures the spirits will trouble mortals no longer. Yet, disposing of spirits in that manner strengthens that which he is tasked with serving and would have died opposing...<br /> <br /> The words suggest that Merciful could be there before the Shadow of the Abyss. He couldn't be sure, but it would almost have to be in the guise of the young woman that had attracted everyone's attention so. No other explanation made sense at this point. Still, as he made his way through the crowd, a way to divine just that without giving anything away were he right or wrong popped into his waiting mind...<br /> <br /> &quot;<span style=\"color:#808080\">Highness, I don't mean to interrupt, but I was tasked with ensuring that you learned while you were in these parts</span>,&quot; <span style=\"color:#000000\">the Prodigal began</span>. &quot;<span style=\"color:#808080\">I respect your wishes to conduct business, but I would like a word with you about how we could schedule your tutoring in religions around Creation. It would mean so very much to me if you would be so...&quot; </span><span style=\"color:#000000\">A pause to make it seem like he was trying to think of the word he wanted to use like a wise courtier would. No special emphasis on the word to draw any attention to it. The pause would be enough to clue in the one that it was meant to alert to his suspicion and no other. </span><span style=\"color:#808080\">&quot;...merciful.&quot;</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I play forum games! Come check out the (mis?)adventures of<br /> Jensven Vargsmed and his canine companion, Shadow in &quot;Forging a Nation&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/44513-ooc-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>,<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/54288-ic-exalted-2-5-forging-a-nation\" target=\"_blank\"> IC</a>)<br /> ...or the <a href=\"https://www.dropbox.com/s/w82hi22ad33hanu/Necro.doc?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Prodigal of Ashen Remorse</a> in &quot;Emerald Labyrinth&quot; (<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/402616-ooc-exalted-2-5-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">OOC</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/play-by-post/416995-ic-exalted-2-5-the-emerald-labyrinth\" target=\"_blank\">IC</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1146-belkra","name":"Belkra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1146_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-10T14:05:14-07:00","id":696478,"title":"","content":"Xisa gave a bow to Franceska, a vague feeling of dread coming upon her, before straightening up and looking her in the eyes. &quot;Sister Franceska, our hosts have picked up another guest.&quot; She said tilting her head towards the tiny wolf. &quot;Hutzupo here is being followed, we may be dealing with some..gate crashers, from very far out of town.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:orangered\">Duly Elected Guild Hierarch</span> of the Exalted Forum<br /> <a href=\"http://northernfoxgames.com/\" target=\"_blank\">http://northernfoxgames.com/</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/331-the-revenge-of-tv-head","name":"The Revenge of TV Head","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar331_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1272"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-10T20:59:24-07:00","id":696765,"title":"","content":"&quot;Gate crashers?&quot; Zarah tucks her hands into her sleeves, where she keeps her knives hidden. She turns to Orca and the Lover. &quot;What sort of trouble did you boys bring to our doorstep?&quot; Another Immaculate Monk and a small dog being follow by Dragons knows what. If trouble keeps piling up, Zarah might not need to worry about the King of Hoof.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-12T23:33:54-07:00","id":699524,"title":"","content":"Orca gives his Alchemical friend a playful jab, &quot;She calls down the wrath of an ancient behemoth upon her head not even a day ago, and WE'RE the troublemakers for taking in a lost puppy.&quot; He takes a bite of his lichen treat again.<br /> <br /> &quot;We didn't cause any trouble!&quot; Orca yells back to Zarah, &quot;The monk and the godling approached us looking for assistance and we offered our help.&quot; He turns around to face the group after he'd gone through his stuff to take out his weapon sketches. &quot;Oh, and Miss Zarah? This is Xisa.&quot; He gestures to the other monk in the group, &quot;We....sort of have a past.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T08:45:34-07:00","id":723200,"title":"","content":"Following the captain inside The Lover takes a bun and pays way too much to the sister for it &quot;Thank you miss&quot;.Rolling his eyes before smiling at Zarah while the captain rummage through his personal effects &quot;Well, we all have a different meaning of the word trouble I suppose, how was your supply run ? I would like to begin woring as soon as possible. Since Zan expressed interest in a power armor I figured that we could use some as well, certain low maintenance design used in Autochtonia are quite robust and simple to use.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-24T16:58:59-07:00","id":724493,"title":"","content":"&quot;Our supplies should be here by the end of the day.&quot; Zarah reenters the warehouse, keeping a close eye on the two Immaculate Monks. &quot;Unfortunately, I was not planning on hosting the meal itself, so all I have to offer is some ice wine and... well, I do not remember what is in this Jug,&quot; Holding up jug she got at the tavern. &quot;Orca, be our Imperial Taste Tester and tell us what it is.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-02T22:47:02-08:00","id":750743,"title":"","content":"Orca takes the jug, turning it up and taking a big swig from it. &quot;Mmmmm! I don't know what it might be, but it's strong!&quot; He reaches into an open crate, pulling out a bunch of pewter cups and pouring some of the drink into each one. &quot;The perfect drink to celebrate our new little endeavor we have going here!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Oh boys! Look what I got here!&quot;<br /> &quot;Hey, where the Dynast women at?&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/814-dreamking89","name":"dreamking89","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T11:23:25-08:00","id":774925,"title":"","content":"Grabbing a cup from Orca, The Lover smells it a bit before looking at the other &quot;True this could be the beginning of a strong and beneficial friendship, depending on how long your lifespan is.&quot; Raising his cup waiting for for the others, once the materials are delivered we'll be able to get to work on preparing ourselves for the labyrinth though I estimate it may take a week or two to be completely operational.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2087,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","user":"Magnusar","date":". 11-26-2015, 02:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2087-magnusar","name":"Magnusar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2087_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"458"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}